(1660214, 224957, 15212, '<td valign="top">Clever Idea, however there are some things I notice:<br/>1. The shoe is out of focus. To make this perspective trick work the whole image need to be in focus.<br/>2. It''s oversharpened. Perhaps to try and make up for OOF shoe?<br/>3. Harsh midday lighting. Early morning or late evening when the sun is closer to the horizon makes images much more pleasing to look at.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps!</td>', 'Clever Idea, however there are some things I notice:1. The shoe is out of focus. To make this perspective trick work the whole image need to be in focus.2. It''s oversharpened. Perhaps to try and make up for OOF shoe?3. Harsh midday lighting. Early morning or late evening when the sun is closer to the horizon makes images much more pleasing to look at. I hope this helps!', '2005-08-31 01:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
