(1661013, 223994, 37005, '<td valign="top">Image is too small to get an adequate representation of the subject.  Composition looks interesting but due to the size I cannot get a real feel for subject.</td>', 'Image is too small to get an adequate representation of the subject.  Composition looks interesting but due to the size I cannot get a real feel for subject.', '2005-08-31 08:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661018, 223790, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  From the thumbnail, I couldn''t tell what it was.  Such a nice diversion from all the sneakers and running shoes!!!! The symmetry and contrast really works well here.  Good one.</td>', 'Very clever.  From the thumbnail, I couldn''t tell what it was.  Such a nice diversion from all the sneakers and running shoes!!!! The symmetry and contrast really works well here.  Good one.', '2005-08-31 09:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661020, 224769, 37005, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I do like the angle and the soft b&amp;w feel of this photo.  But the title does not match what you view in the photo.  The DOF is too shallow to allow the viewer of the photo to see this.  I think the title, in this case, hurts your score.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice composition, I do like the angle and the soft b&w feel of this photo.  But the title does not match what you view in the photo.  The DOF is too shallow to allow the viewer of the photo to see this.  I think the title, in this case, hurts your score.   ', '2005-08-31 09:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661021, 224622, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think the lightening of this works because of the subject matter. It has that sweet dreamy sense to it.</td>', 'I think the lightening of this works because of the subject matter. It has that sweet dreamy sense to it.', '2005-08-31 09:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661026, 224841, 37430, '<td valign="top">I feel stronger contrast and b/w with slightly warmer tone would have been better over sepia.5.</td>', 'I feel stronger contrast and b/w with slightly warmer tone would have been better over sepia.5.', '2005-08-31 09:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
