(1661043, 223831, 37430, '<td valign="top">Neat. Something seems to be missing but I dont know what. Maybe shallow DoF would help or any other angle for shoes ... maybe.8.</td>', 'Neat. Something seems to be missing but I dont know what. Maybe shallow DoF would help or any other angle for shoes ... maybe.8.', '2005-08-31 09:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
