(1661095, 224179, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great boots. I like the gutsy urban sense the shot has. The hint of the oversized fishnets is an additional pattern. The shadowing is good. I''d remove the jewelry - I find it a tad distracting.</td>', 'Great boots. I like the gutsy urban sense the shot has. The hint of the oversized fishnets is an additional pattern. The shadowing is good. I''d remove the jewelry - I find it a tad distracting.', '2005-08-31 09:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
