(1661114, 224839, 37961, '<td valign="top">What a cute bunny. Lighting and set up is good....love the title. 10.</td>', 'What a cute bunny. Lighting and set up is good....love the title. 10.', '2005-08-31 09:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
