(1661737, 224957, 42869, '<td valign="top">Great idea, need more light on shoe and less DOF to keep all in focus</td>', 'Great idea, need more light on shoe and less DOF to keep all in focus', '2005-08-31 12:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661739, 225073, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is great!   Great focus, and a refreshing change from all the other people-shoes :)</td>', 'This is great!   Great focus, and a refreshing change from all the other people-shoes :)', '2005-08-31 12:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661741, 222272, 42927, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2005-08-31 12:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661747, 223125, 34192, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you added the candle and the haning thing.  Simple is much better.  Crop out the left half and it would greatly improve your composition. The focus should be the dogs expression, which would make this a winning image.  A lower point of view may improve it just a touch.  I don''t mean to be harsh but this image has a lot of great things going for it - the perfect subject (the shoes and the dog) with extraneous details than take away from its charm.  So, I''m covering up the left side and working from there.  The image is just ever so slightly out of focus.  Except for the purple cast on the left side, the lighting is pretty good.  I like the way the dog and the shoes are composed. 7 - good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you added the candle and the haning thing.  Simple is much better.  Crop out the left half and it would greatly improve your composition. The focus should be the dogs expression, which would make this a winning image.  A lower point of view may improve it just a touch.  I don''t mean to be harsh but this image has a lot of great things going for it - the perfect subject (the shoes and the dog) with extraneous details than take away from its charm.  So, I''m covering up the left side and working from there.  The image is just ever so slightly out of focus.  Except for the purple cast on the left side, the lighting is pretty good.  I like the way the dog and the shoes are composed. 7 - good luck in the challenge.', '2005-08-31 12:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661754, 224350, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea!   Love the composition.   I wish the horeshoe was a little bit sharper, but I love the picture anyway.  7</td>', 'Very creative idea!   Love the composition.   I wish the horeshoe was a little bit sharper, but I love the picture anyway.  7', '2005-08-31 12:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661762, 224764, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp!!!!!    Cool composition!</td>', 'Nice and sharp!!!!!    Cool composition!', '2005-08-31 12:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661769, 224179, 21216, '<td valign="top">Very sexy, good lighting, exciting. The details are really nice, like the reflection of the booth on the floor, that''s just marvelous, that alone could have made the pica success. The silver cross and the booth laces go well together and seem to complete the picture. I may be wrong but the fishnet stocking just don''t seem to fit into the picture somehow, sure they''re meant to be sexy, but they''re too intrusive for my taste. But hey, that''s just a minor detail in this very creative picture.</td>', 'Very sexy, good lighting, exciting. The details are really nice, like the reflection of the booth on the floor, that''s just marvelous, that alone could have made the pica success. The silver cross and the booth laces go well together and seem to complete the picture. I may be wrong but the fishnet stocking just don''t seem to fit into the picture somehow, sure they''re meant to be sexy, but they''re too intrusive for my taste. But hey, that''s just a minor detail in this very creative picture.', '2005-08-31 12:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661781, 223152, 42602, '<td valign="top">Hahaha.... There are two pairs on a powerline close to my house! Ironically, one pair is masculine and the other is feminine... ;) I DO sort of wonder if there''s a story behind them. <br/> <br/>Anyways, nice contrast.</td>', 'Hahaha.... There are two pairs on a powerline close to my house! Ironically, one pair is masculine and the other is feminine... ;) I DO sort of wonder if there''s a story behind them.  Anyways, nice contrast.', '2005-08-31 12:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661786, 225045, 21216, '<td valign="top">Looks like a window display, and as a window display I''m sure it gets lots of attention but as a photograph, well it''s quite busy. The colours go really well together and the lighting is well executed too but like I said the papers just doesn''t seem to belong in this picture. And I still stand beside my belief that this is a window display :P</td>', 'Looks like a window display, and as a window display I''m sure it gets lots of attention but as a photograph, well it''s quite busy. The colours go really well together and the lighting is well executed too but like I said the papers just doesn''t seem to belong in this picture. And I still stand beside my belief that this is a window display :P', '2005-08-31 12:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661791, 225056, 39700, '<td valign="top">Very original !</td>', 'Very original !', '2005-08-31 12:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661792, 224694, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and great sharpness. I like the composition too.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and great sharpness. I like the composition too.', '2005-08-31 12:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661793, 224425, 42602, '<td valign="top">Nice... I like the action. Good job on the sharp, too. However, this particular picture may have worked better w/a different colorization or sepia tone. ;)</td>', 'Nice... I like the action. Good job on the sharp, too. However, this particular picture may have worked better w/a different colorization or sepia tone. ;)', '2005-08-31 12:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
