(1661803, 223782, 42602, '<td valign="top">Cute! :) I love your background, and you did an awesome job of varigating the flip-flop colors. The capris was a very nice touch, too.<br/> <br/>Possible variation: Instead of all 5 girls having their feet strait out, you could have the feet all in relaxed positions (crossed, loose, slightly spaced, etc) as if 5 friends are sitting and chatting and their cute feet happen to line up that way. :)<br/> <br/>All in all, a very nice picture. Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Cute! :) I love your background, and you did an awesome job of varigating the flip-flop colors. The capris was a very nice touch, too. Possible variation: Instead of all 5 girls having their feet strait out, you could have the feet all in relaxed positions (crossed, loose, slightly spaced, etc) as if 5 friends are sitting and chatting and their cute feet happen to line up that way. :) All in all, a very nice picture. Keep up the great work!', '2005-08-31 12:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661805, 223492, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww. . . .that is sweet.   I think a litle tighter crop may have enhanced this even more, but maybe that''s just me.   I tend to prefer close-up tight crops.   But I do love the picture!!!</td>', 'Awwwwww. . . .that is sweet.   I think a litle tighter crop may have enhanced this even more, but maybe that''s just me.   I tend to prefer close-up tight crops.   But I do love the picture!!!', '2005-08-31 12:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661807, 224109, 42602, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but too dark. It''s hard to tell what''s happening.</td>', 'Interesting, but too dark. It''s hard to tell what''s happening.', '2005-08-31 12:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
