(1661809, 224611, 24454, '<td valign="top">How cute!     He looks like he''s thinking, "What in the heck is he DOING to me!!!    What a good sport!</td>', 'How cute!     He looks like he''s thinking, "What in the heck is he DOING to me!!!    What a good sport!', '2005-08-31 12:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661810, 224772, 24454, '<td valign="top">Love this one!   Very appealing!</td>', 'Love this one!   Very appealing!', '2005-08-31 12:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661812, 223493, 43115, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but to pull it off, both shoes should have been in focus.  Try getting directly over top of the subject when doing macro like this.</td>', 'Great concept, but to pull it off, both shoes should have been in focus.  Try getting directly over top of the subject when doing macro like this.', '2005-08-31 12:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661815, 224622, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is BEAUTIFUL!    I love the gauzy look.   It works perfectly with this!   Good luck.  This is one of my favorites!  10</td>', 'That is BEAUTIFUL!    I love the gauzy look.   It works perfectly with this!   Good luck.  This is one of my favorites!  10', '2005-08-31 12:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661817, 224818, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like the crop and composition of this!</td>', 'I really like the crop and composition of this!', '2005-08-31 12:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661819, 222992, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness!</td>', 'Great sharpness!', '2005-08-31 12:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661821, 225031, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. . . I bet you are hearing way too many times tho about the focus (sorry).  I''ve been on the receiving end of the focus issue many times, that''s the only reason I know.   Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition. . . I bet you are hearing way too many times tho about the focus (sorry).  I''ve been on the receiving end of the focus issue many times, that''s the only reason I know.   Good luck.', '2005-08-31 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661822, 224934, 42602, '<td valign="top">Hahaha... I like it.  Just a few tips.. Watch the contrast on the black and white. This is a great, sharp picture,  but it may have worked better in color because the greenry would set the black shoes and car off, instead of fading in. <br/> <br/>Possible variation: Beat up sneakers in feet hanging lazily out window. :)<br/> <br/>Keep up the great work!</td>', 'Hahaha... I like it.  Just a few tips.. Watch the contrast on the black and white. This is a great, sharp picture,  but it may have worked better in color because the greenry would set the black shoes and car off, instead of fading in.  Possible variation: Beat up sneakers in feet hanging lazily out window. :) Keep up the great work!', '2005-08-31 12:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661823, 223403, 42871, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but if I had taken it I would have had an out of focus guy the the background with a surf board running down to the water.</td>', 'I like the picture, but if I had taken it I would have had an out of focus guy the the background with a surf board running down to the water.', '2005-08-31 12:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661824, 224622, 42602, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Careful with the contrast.</td>', 'Very nice. Careful with the contrast.', '2005-08-31 12:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661826, 225050, 24454, '<td valign="top">How cool!    Amazing how special effects like this make even a pair of shoes stand out and look incredible!!!   Fantastic job!!!!  10</td>', 'How cool!    Amazing how special effects like this make even a pair of shoes stand out and look incredible!!!   Fantastic job!!!!  10', '2005-08-31 12:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661829, 224698, 43115, '<td valign="top">The cropping of the models is slightly disturbing... Also the downhill slant is distracting.</td>', 'The cropping of the models is slightly disturbing... Also the downhill slant is distracting.', '2005-08-31 12:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661831, 225011, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2005-08-31 12:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
