(1661834, 223125, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . . how could you not love a pair of shoes with that little fellow dressing them up!!!!!   (sorry if he''s a she)   VERY cute picture.    I may have loved it even more if it were just the shoes and the pup in the picture without the other stuff, but I do love this one!</td>', 'Awwww. . . how could you not love a pair of shoes with that little fellow dressing them up!!!!!   (sorry if he''s a she)   VERY cute picture.    I may have loved it even more if it were just the shoes and the pup in the picture without the other stuff, but I do love this one!', '2005-08-31 12:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661836, 224970, 42602, '<td valign="top">Interesting... I like the contrast, but the positioning of the foot is a bit off.</td>', 'Interesting... I like the contrast, but the positioning of the foot is a bit off.', '2005-08-31 12:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661837, 223981, 42871, '<td valign="top">Shoudlnt the focus have been the shoes?</td>', 'Shoudlnt the focus have been the shoes?', '2005-08-31 12:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661838, 222814, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!!    How could anyone not love a pair of shoes with THAT scene complimenting it!!!!   10</td>', 'Beautiful!!!!    How could anyone not love a pair of shoes with THAT scene complimenting it!!!!   10', '2005-08-31 12:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661843, 225047, 40430, '<td valign="top">great idea; nice composition, color and sharpness</td>', 'great idea; nice composition, color and sharpness', '2005-08-31 13:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661845, 222596, 43115, '<td valign="top">I would have switched the focal point to the shoe, since it is the object of the contest.  Good idea though.</td>', 'I would have switched the focal point to the shoe, since it is the object of the contest.  Good idea though.', '2005-08-31 13:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661846, 225042, 24454, '<td valign="top">THAT is awesome!!!!!   Beautiful composition.  Perfect sharpness.   Perfect complimenting colors.   This is one of my most favorites in this challenge!  10</td>', 'THAT is awesome!!!!!   Beautiful composition.  Perfect sharpness.   Perfect complimenting colors.   This is one of my most favorites in this challenge!  10', '2005-08-31 13:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661849, 224981, 24454, '<td valign="top">That''s cute!  Very creative.   I like this one a lot!</td>', 'That''s cute!  Very creative.   I like this one a lot!', '2005-08-31 13:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661852, 224469, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo!   Great focus and composition.</td>', 'Very interesting photo!   Great focus and composition.', '2005-08-31 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661854, 224908, 42602, '<td valign="top">HEY! Some girls did that at camp one year... Snuck into the cabins last night and strung around 300 on them in a tree. LOL This must have been a fun one to take. <br/> <br/>One thing to watch though. You had a beautiful top to the tree, where the bright greenery contrasted beautifully against the sky, but by taking the full profile of the subject tree, you included the not-quite-so-beautiful background trees and some dead-wood. Next time, look for that contrast and crop accordingly.<br/> <br/>Good job! :)</td>', 'HEY! Some girls did that at camp one year... Snuck into the cabins last night and strung around 300 on them in a tree. LOL This must have been a fun one to take.  One thing to watch though. You had a beautiful top to the tree, where the bright greenery contrasted beautifully against the sky, but by taking the full profile of the subject tree, you included the not-quite-so-beautiful background trees and some dead-wood. Next time, look for that contrast and crop accordingly. Good job! :)', '2005-08-31 13:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661855, 224883, 42837, '<td valign="top">The nude model seems to be detracting from the theme. The punky grungy effect  of just the monochrome trainers and bright pink pop socks would have been more powerful just by themselves. Less is more.</td>', 'The nude model seems to be detracting from the theme. The punky grungy effect  of just the monochrome trainers and bright pink pop socks would have been more powerful just by themselves. Less is more.', '2005-08-31 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661857, 224747, 24454, '<td valign="top">You know. . . the grunge and slight grain really works on this.   Very interesting photo!</td>', 'You know. . . the grunge and slight grain really works on this.   Very interesting photo!', '2005-08-31 13:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661861, 224912, 40430, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, sharpness and contrast</td>', 'excellent shot, sharpness and contrast', '2005-08-31 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661862, 224700, 24454, '<td valign="top">Whooaaa. . . how''d you do THAT!  Very interesting looking!</td>', 'Whooaaa. . . how''d you do THAT!  Very interesting looking!', '2005-08-31 13:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661863, 224554, 42602, '<td valign="top">Hmm... nice try, but a few problems. Too close, hard to see what/where focus is. Camera had a hard time focusing so close, too, and it made the pic slightly fuzzy. Colors need some help-- a little too drab w/o enough contrast.</td>', 'Hmm... nice try, but a few problems. Too close, hard to see what/where focus is. Camera had a hard time focusing so close, too, and it made the pic slightly fuzzy. Colors need some help-- a little too drab w/o enough contrast.', '2005-08-31 13:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661864, 224255, 42871, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool, very creative.</td>', 'Wow, very cool, very creative.', '2005-08-31 13:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661868, 224580, 42602, '<td valign="top">I like the red filter. Very nice. Good contrast.</td>', 'I like the red filter. Very nice. Good contrast.', '2005-08-31 13:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1661869, 224914, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . . that is cute!</td>', 'Awwww. . . that is cute!', '2005-08-31 13:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
