(1661873, 224957, 42871, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were going for, but you need 2 things to make it work:<br/>1. The shoe needs to be in focus.<br/>2. The shoe had to have the same lighting on it that the figure you are stepping on has.</td>', 'I understand what you were going for, but you need 2 things to make it work:1. The shoe needs to be in focus.2. The shoe had to have the same lighting on it that the figure you are stepping on has.', '2005-08-31 13:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
