(1662093, 222675, 34337, '<td valign="top">If the graphic quality of this shot was a notch better, it would be a top finisher.  Out line of shoes looks choppy rather than smooth.  Perfect otherwise though.  Have a great day!</td>', 'If the graphic quality of this shot was a notch better, it would be a top finisher.  Out line of shoes looks choppy rather than smooth.  Perfect otherwise though.  Have a great day!', '2005-08-31 13:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662094, 223340, 43115, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite know what to say about this one, except that the subject matter, the shoes, is almost lost due to the size of the photo.  But you couldn''t crop it without loosing the context... somehow I just don''t think that this photo, while a good shot, was right for this format.</td>', 'I don''t quite know what to say about this one, except that the subject matter, the shoes, is almost lost due to the size of the photo.  But you couldn''t crop it without loosing the context... somehow I just don''t think that this photo, while a good shot, was right for this format.', '2005-08-31 13:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
