(1662098, 224067, 43115, '<td valign="top">In a challenge with nearly 500 entries you''ve got to stand out from the croud.  Creativity and artistic components become even more important than the technical aspects.  Yours does this better than the average entry in this contest, but not incredibly well.  Are they posed on a backpack?  The shadow at the corners of the frame is distracting to me.  Would have preferred the whole frame be exposed so I have a little better idea of my surroundings.</td>', 'In a challenge with nearly 500 entries you''ve got to stand out from the croud.  Creativity and artistic components become even more important than the technical aspects.  Yours does this better than the average entry in this contest, but not incredibly well.  Are they posed on a backpack?  The shadow at the corners of the frame is distracting to me.  Would have preferred the whole frame be exposed so I have a little better idea of my surroundings.', '2005-08-31 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1);
