(1662108, 225030, 42837, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the reference in the title. But as it stands I guess you''re trying to convey a creepy feeling with the cockroaches, yes? If so the effect seems less ''creepy'', and more ''slightly untidy'', given the chice of slightly scuffed shoe, and slightly frayed jean.</td>', 'I don''t get the reference in the title. But as it stands I guess you''re trying to convey a creepy feeling with the cockroaches, yes? If so the effect seems less ''creepy'', and more ''slightly untidy'', given the chice of slightly scuffed shoe, and slightly frayed jean.', '2005-08-31 14:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662114, 224587, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good DOF capturing the logo, strong composition and good movement or action in the diagonal line. And the complementary colours add the finishing touch, excellent. I''d buy a pair, yo should get in touch with their advertising dept and show them this. 10</td>', 'Good DOF capturing the logo, strong composition and good movement or action in the diagonal line. And the complementary colours add the finishing touch, excellent. I''d buy a pair, yo should get in touch with their advertising dept and show them this. 10', '2005-08-31 14:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
