(1662461, 224831, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition.  I think I would like it better though if either the hair is out of the frame or her whole head was in it, as it is it just draws my eye away from the shoes.  7 from me.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition.  I think I would like it better though if either the hair is out of the frame or her whole head was in it, as it is it just draws my eye away from the shoes.  7 from me.', '2005-08-31 15:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
