(1662471, 225011, 42826, '<td valign="top">love the b&amp;w...</td>', 'love the b&w...', '2005-08-31 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662479, 224593, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but there are two things that bug me a little about the image.  <br/> <br/>1:  The blue cast that is over the whole image isn''t very flattering, I would have liked it more with a warmer WB.<br/> <br/>2:  The whole ocean part isn''t flattering at all.  First of all the horizon is both tilted and distorted and secondly the whole area is severly overexposed with no detail so it doesn''t do justice to this scene.  <br/> <br/>4 from me because of the reasons I said but had you corrected this, for example by taking this photo at another focal length to minimise the distortion of the horizon and then also taking it for example at another time of day or from another angle so you could have lit the shoe part of the image and the horizon the same I would have liked it a whole lot more.  <br/> <br/>Short version is that I like the idea behind this shot but not how it''s executed so keep experimenting!</td>', 'Nice idea but there are two things that bug me a little about the image.   1:  The blue cast that is over the whole image isn''t very flattering, I would have liked it more with a warmer WB. 2:  The whole ocean part isn''t flattering at all.  First of all the horizon is both tilted and distorted and secondly the whole area is severly overexposed with no detail so it doesn''t do justice to this scene.   4 from me because of the reasons I said but had you corrected this, for example by taking this photo at another focal length to minimise the distortion of the horizon and then also taking it for example at another time of day or from another angle so you could have lit the shoe part of the image and the horizon the same I would have liked it a whole lot more.   Short version is that I like the idea behind this shot but not how it''s executed so keep experimenting!', '2005-08-31 15:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662482, 224021, 22937, '<td valign="top">For me this is the blue ribbon photo - great shot! Definitely worth a 10.</td>', 'For me this is the blue ribbon photo - great shot! Definitely worth a 10.', '2005-08-31 15:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662487, 223607, 27482, '<td valign="top">I am not a big fan of shots that need the title to explain the shot and as I am no fan of tap dancing and don''t know what kind of shoes they use there I feel this shot is in a gray area in regards to that.  Anyway this is not a bad shot at all but I think I would have liked it better if you had entered a wider shot to show me what was going.  5 from me.</td>', 'I am not a big fan of shots that need the title to explain the shot and as I am no fan of tap dancing and don''t know what kind of shoes they use there I feel this shot is in a gray area in regards to that.  Anyway this is not a bad shot at all but I think I would have liked it better if you had entered a wider shot to show me what was going.  5 from me.', '2005-08-31 16:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662488, 224957, 40386, '<td valign="top">This was a wonderful idea however I would have preferred to have seen the shoe in focus as well as the girl which would have made it more realistic. Good luck</td>', 'This was a wonderful idea however I would have preferred to have seen the shoe in focus as well as the girl which would have made it more realistic. Good luck', '2005-08-31 16:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662489, 222261, 22937, '<td valign="top">Really like the feeling captured in this photo - 9 points for you!</td>', 'Really like the feeling captured in this photo - 9 points for you!', '2005-08-31 16:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662491, 223299, 42132, '<td valign="top">this didn''t immediately catch my eye in the thumbnails so glad I caught it 2nd time round.composition,lighting,focus,details....lovely</td>', 'this didn''t immediately catch my eye in the thumbnails so glad I caught it 2nd time round.composition,lighting,focus,details....lovely', '2005-08-31 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662494, 224772, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like where you are going with the post processing but it needs to be more "pristine" and sharp to totally engage my attention, keep up experimenting though.  One of the better shots in the challenge, gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like where you are going with the post processing but it needs to be more "pristine" and sharp to totally engage my attention, keep up experimenting though.  One of the better shots in the challenge, gave it a 7.', '2005-08-31 16:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662503, 223152, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and above average in the challenge but I dunno... kindof boring to look at, needs something to make it pop a bit more, like a seagull trying to steal the shoes or something...  6 from me.</td>', 'Nice composition and above average in the challenge but I dunno... kindof boring to look at, needs something to make it pop a bit more, like a seagull trying to steal the shoes or something...  6 from me.', '2005-08-31 16:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662510, 224975, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don''t care what you did in the pos processing but I can say that I don''t care for it at all, waaaayyyy to grainy and flat for my taste.  Just wanted to tell you why I gave it a 3, and only reason why I didn''t vote lower is that it''s on topic.  However, if you like this shot, stick with it, after all, this is just my opinion and opinions are like assholes, everyone has got one...</td>', 'I don''t care what you did in the pos processing but I can say that I don''t care for it at all, waaaayyyy to grainy and flat for my taste.  Just wanted to tell you why I gave it a 3, and only reason why I didn''t vote lower is that it''s on topic.  However, if you like this shot, stick with it, after all, this is just my opinion and opinions are like assholes, everyone has got one...', '2005-08-31 16:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662511, 223834, 21216, '<td valign="top">This may be one of the best pictures I''ve seen in a while, it just leaves the viewer wondering it really does, and the post-processing is marvelous as well... Of course the pole there is really misplaced but it really doesn''t interfere the picture. This is a beautiful conceptual piece, left to the viewers interpretation, you just wonder, what are the shoes doing there? Did they have an owner that just jumped into the water? Or did they go there all by themselves...A 10 for a magnificent out of the box shot</td>', 'This may be one of the best pictures I''ve seen in a while, it just leaves the viewer wondering it really does, and the post-processing is marvelous as well... Of course the pole there is really misplaced but it really doesn''t interfere the picture. This is a beautiful conceptual piece, left to the viewers interpretation, you just wonder, what are the shoes doing there? Did they have an owner that just jumped into the water? Or did they go there all by themselves...A 10 for a magnificent out of the box shot', '2005-08-31 16:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662513, 224645, 42132, '<td valign="top">nice shot,great composition</td>', 'nice shot,great composition', '2005-08-31 16:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662517, 223025, 36619, '<td valign="top">love the concept. wishing for a bit sharper focus though.</td>', 'love the concept. wishing for a bit sharper focus though.', '2005-08-31 16:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662518, 224520, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice touch to have the shoe on the left stand up a little bit, I don''t love it but still a 7 from me.  Nice texture and tones.</td>', 'Nice touch to have the shoe on the left stand up a little bit, I don''t love it but still a 7 from me.  Nice texture and tones.', '2005-08-31 16:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662519, 224342, 21216, '<td valign="top">There is a great setup as well as a great idea behind this shot, the only thing that''s really annoying it the really harsh lighting which could have semi-fixed with curves or waited for a later hour.</td>', 'There is a great setup as well as a great idea behind this shot, the only thing that''s really annoying it the really harsh lighting which could have semi-fixed with curves or waited for a later hour.', '2005-08-31 16:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1662523, 225019, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice work on the PP, I think you made a right choice to make this sepia toned.  I like the look on the little guy too, he looks as he is about to reach for his gun in a quick draw contest :)<br/> <br/>8 from me as technically this shot is pretty much flawless but I didn''t go "wow" when I saw it.</td>', 'Nice work on the PP, I think you made a right choice to make this sepia toned.  I like the look on the little guy too, he looks as he is about to reach for his gun in a quick draw contest :) 8 from me as technically this shot is pretty much flawless but I didn''t go "wow" when I saw it.', '2005-08-31 16:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
