(1662618, 223741, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, the "feet without faces" works very well here, nicely composed.  I think I would have liked it better though with a sligthly cooler WB as I feel it´s a bit too red but other than that, very nice.  7 from me.<br/> <br/>(p.s. oh and why only 535 pixles on the big side, the shot would look better in a bigger resolution).</td>', 'Nice, the "feet without faces" works very well here, nicely composed.  I think I would have liked it better though with a sligthly cooler WB as I feel it´s a bit too red but other than that, very nice.  7 from me. (p.s. oh and why only 535 pixles on the big side, the shot would look better in a bigger resolution).', '2005-08-31 16:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
