(1662643, 223782, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice, the thumbnail looked nice and it did not dissapoint.  Still not jawdroppingly awesome but definately one of the better shots in the challenge, 7 from me.</td>', 'Nice, the thumbnail looked nice and it did not dissapoint.  Still not jawdroppingly awesome but definately one of the better shots in the challenge, 7 from me.', '2005-08-31 16:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
