(1663004, 224437, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hehe, witty! Strong composition, though I would like to see a version without the second shoe behind the little figure. The second shoe does add a nice DOF, but it seems to be at the expense of the possibly greater effect of him aginst a white background. I think that would add even more weight to the shoe he''s holding back, and the shape would be more powerful. Less is more. 9</td>', 'Hehe, witty! Strong composition, though I would like to see a version without the second shoe behind the little figure. The second shoe does add a nice DOF, but it seems to be at the expense of the possibly greater effect of him aginst a white background. I think that would add even more weight to the shoe he''s holding back, and the shape would be more powerful. Less is more. 9', '2005-08-31 18:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
