(1663408, 224861, 41669, '<td valign="top">image needs to be sharper...hard with jpegs sometimes--and your subject is perhaps wasting what should be a dramatic place...cliffs, water, conflict, danger, serentiy....make me feel something.</td>', 'image needs to be sharper...hard with jpegs sometimes--and your subject is perhaps wasting what should be a dramatic place...cliffs, water, conflict, danger, serentiy....make me feel something.', '2005-08-31 20:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
