(1664377, 222787, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition.  I love the dress, but since shoes are supposed to be the main subject of the picture, I might have cropped it closer to show off the shoes better but then you would have lost the dress.  That''s just me.  Congratulations on one of the few really nice pictures in this challenge.</td>', 'I really like this composition.  I love the dress, but since shoes are supposed to be the main subject of the picture, I might have cropped it closer to show off the shoes better but then you would have lost the dress.  That''s just me.  Congratulations on one of the few really nice pictures in this challenge.', '2005-08-31 23:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664381, 224645, 36988, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, contrast and ballance</td>', 'nice lighting, contrast and ballance', '2005-08-31 23:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664382, 224760, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but they should have been in focus.  Either that or you should have gotten a speed blur.</td>', 'Nice idea, but they should have been in focus.  Either that or you should have gotten a speed blur.', '2005-08-31 23:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664383, 224739, 35545, '<td valign="top">Ouch.  My feet hurt just looking at them, but I won''t mark you down for that.</td>', 'Ouch.  My feet hurt just looking at them, but I won''t mark you down for that.', '2005-08-31 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664386, 225004, 11295, '<td valign="top">A bit too tight for me... I had to look a few times before I realized the person is standing on a skateboard. But really good DOF work.</td>', 'A bit too tight for me... I had to look a few times before I realized the person is standing on a skateboard. But really good DOF work.', '2005-08-31 23:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
