(1664403, 224444, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but that black line (shadow?) across the top is distracting.  I think cropping would have worked better.</td>', 'Good idea, but that black line (shadow?) across the top is distracting.  I think cropping would have worked better.', '2005-08-31 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
