(1664408, 223296, 35545, '<td valign="top">Looks washed out.  Do the birds have red eye?  I''d have gotten rid of the dirt on the heel of the left shoe.  It is a clever idea, though.</td>', 'Looks washed out.  Do the birds have red eye?  I''d have gotten rid of the dirt on the heel of the left shoe.  It is a clever idea, though.', '2005-08-31 23:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
