(1664925, 223025, 39483, '<td valign="top">Love love love  this picture! I hope you ribbon! The composition with its slanted line works very well. The black/pink on white is also great! Nice contrast and original idea. The only minor detail might be that the photo seems just a bit overprocessed at the edges...<br/>But really, very well done! Good luck. A new favorite</td>', 'Love love love  this picture! I hope you ribbon! The composition with its slanted line works very well. The black/pink on white is also great! Nice contrast and original idea. The only minor detail might be that the photo seems just a bit overprocessed at the edges...But really, very well done! Good luck. A new favorite', '2005-09-01 03:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664928, 224927, 42861, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done.</td>', 'Very cleverly done.', '2005-09-01 03:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664929, 224008, 39483, '<td valign="top">Such a nice capture. The depth of field is perfect, the warm tones perfect, the composition, you guessed it :) <br/>I like the originality of the photo and the execution of the shot. Minor detail but there is a bit of distracting glare (?) and weird line at the bottom right? The piece of cloth also distracts a tad IMHO!<br/>In any case, I hope you score high! Good luck</td>', 'Such a nice capture. The depth of field is perfect, the warm tones perfect, the composition, you guessed it :) I like the originality of the photo and the execution of the shot. Minor detail but there is a bit of distracting glare (?) and weird line at the bottom right? The piece of cloth also distracts a tad IMHO!In any case, I hope you score high! Good luck', '2005-09-01 03:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
