(1664946, 224606, 39483, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great idea for a photo. It seems that critics feel  that amidst a whole lot of one thing (white shoes) you should include one that doesn''t quite fit (like a red shoe for example) or maybe all on one side except for a lone one in the corner? In any case, good idea. It might work better if sharper and more cropped?<br/>Nice job</td>', 'I think this is a great idea for a photo. It seems that critics feel  that amidst a whole lot of one thing (white shoes) you should include one that doesn''t quite fit (like a red shoe for example) or maybe all on one side except for a lone one in the corner? In any case, good idea. It might work better if sharper and more cropped?Nice job', '2005-09-01 03:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
