(1664987, 224815, 42408, '<td valign="top">I like this picture even though it''s somewhat plain you follow the rule of thirds. I like how the water is blue and eventually turns clear. i like how there is no background distracting it. I also like the white sand.. Great job. Good luck!</td>', 'I like this picture even though it''s somewhat plain you follow the rule of thirds. I like how the water is blue and eventually turns clear. i like how there is no background distracting it. I also like the white sand.. Great job. Good luck!', '2005-09-01 04:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664988, 225050, 42408, '<td valign="top">Wow I like the crazy green light!! This is so rad! I like how on the shoe laces there''s some green too! Wow... Great job! Good luck! 10</td>', 'Wow I like the crazy green light!! This is so rad! I like how on the shoe laces there''s some green too! Wow... Great job! Good luck! 10', '2005-09-01 04:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664989, 223101, 21216, '<td valign="top">Not bad this could be a great fashion shot, the lighting is awsome, the high contrast is great. The location is quite nice as well, I love that stony feel and the replace colour really works well with it. But it really doesn''t go with your idea of "Birds of a feather"; because they have nothing alike, my suggestion would have been (if they are posing models that is) to find identical clothes and shoes for them and make them pose alike. Because like this it kind of seems out of there and random. But technically it''s a great and original shot.</td>', 'Not bad this could be a great fashion shot, the lighting is awsome, the high contrast is great. The location is quite nice as well, I love that stony feel and the replace colour really works well with it. But it really doesn''t go with your idea of "Birds of a feather"; because they have nothing alike, my suggestion would have been (if they are posing models that is) to find identical clothes and shoes for them and make them pose alike. Because like this it kind of seems out of there and random. But technically it''s a great and original shot.', '2005-09-01 04:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664990, 224447, 42408, '<td valign="top">I think the trash by the guys foot is really distracting. The orange thing in the background is really distracting. Maybe a closer shot would have been better? Who knows. Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'I think the trash by the guys foot is really distracting. The orange thing in the background is really distracting. Maybe a closer shot would have been better? Who knows. Good luck on the challenge!', '2005-09-01 04:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664991, 225066, 42408, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but what''s in the background. I think that light is somewhat distracting? I''m not sure.. Maybe it''s just me.. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this photo, but what''s in the background. I think that light is somewhat distracting? I''m not sure.. Maybe it''s just me.. Good luck.', '2005-09-01 04:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
