(1664993, 224368, 39110, '<td valign="top">This is the very first time I have been compelled to comment in a challenge  I felt like I was  pulled back to this photo! It is an incredibly poignent(sp?) photo  and such a different take on the challenge.I feel though it has the potential to be an even better photo taken from a lower down angle and getting in closer. I also really like  what you have done with the colours of the flowers and the flag. Technically I''m not competent enough to make much more comment but I just want to thank you again for the first photo that "spoke to me"</td>', 'This is the very first time I have been compelled to comment in a challenge  I felt like I was  pulled back to this photo! It is an incredibly poignent(sp?) photo  and such a different take on the challenge.I feel though it has the potential to be an even better photo taken from a lower down angle and getting in closer. I also really like  what you have done with the colours of the flowers and the flag. Technically I''m not competent enough to make much more comment but I just want to thank you again for the first photo that "spoke to me"', '2005-09-01 04:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1664994, 223895, 42408, '<td valign="top">I like the colors but maybe a different angle, not the lighthouse thing in the background (it''s kind of distracting), and that sailboat in the middle along with that red light. Just some things I thought you could work on. But great idea!</td>', 'I like the colors but maybe a different angle, not the lighthouse thing in the background (it''s kind of distracting), and that sailboat in the middle along with that red light. Just some things I thought you could work on. But great idea!', '2005-09-01 04:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
