(1665225, 224957, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but not the outcome, mainly for 3 reasons.  The shoe that is doing the "crushing" is out of focus so you need a smaller aperture to get the whole scene in the DOF.  Secondly a small portion of the crushing shoe is overlapping her heel.  Thirdly the lighting is very uneven between the shoe and the girl, probably because the shoe is in a shadow and the top half of the girl is in direct sunlight.  I really encourage you to keep experimenting as I like your thinking with this but this particular shot isn´t hitting the spot with me, I gave it a 4.</td>', 'I like the idea but not the outcome, mainly for 3 reasons.  The shoe that is doing the "crushing" is out of focus so you need a smaller aperture to get the whole scene in the DOF.  Secondly a small portion of the crushing shoe is overlapping her heel.  Thirdly the lighting is very uneven between the shoe and the girl, probably because the shoe is in a shadow and the top half of the girl is in direct sunlight.  I really encourage you to keep experimenting as I like your thinking with this but this particular shot isn´t hitting the spot with me, I gave it a 4.', '2005-09-01 06:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665245, 224420, 40977, '<td valign="top">Great feel to this shot.  The imagery is terrific and the colors add instead of distracting from the overall feel.  9 - Great Shot</td>', 'Great feel to this shot.  The imagery is terrific and the colors add instead of distracting from the overall feel.  9 - Great Shot', '2005-09-01 07:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
