(1665489, 223815, 30817, '<td valign="top">... appears they got a little too far up in there.  I like your highkey appraoach as a form of contrast to the rough appearance of your subject.  Excellent.</td>', '... appears they got a little too far up in there.  I like your highkey appraoach as a form of contrast to the rough appearance of your subject.  Excellent.', '2005-09-01 10:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
