(1665572, 223976, 15832, '<td valign="top">That´s funny...<br/>The idea is great but there are small details bothering me littel bit.<br/>His legs should be either more visible or totally out of the photo. the green at the bottom is adding extra to the photo that is nice but the long strawes are not nessesery.<br/>I would have tried to take this  photo whitout rotaiting the camera and get closer to the subject. Then i would try to put more contrast on it and turn it into B&amp;W to get this western mood.   But these are just my personal thoughts!!! <br/>Good luck...7</td>', 'That´s funny...The idea is great but there are small details bothering me littel bit.His legs should be either more visible or totally out of the photo. the green at the bottom is adding extra to the photo that is nice but the long strawes are not nessesery.I would have tried to take this  photo whitout rotaiting the camera and get closer to the subject. Then i would try to put more contrast on it and turn it into B&W to get this western mood.   But these are just my personal thoughts!!! Good luck...7', '2005-09-01 10:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
