(1665623, 223709, 40977, '<td valign="top">They must be right "everything is big in Texas".  I don''t know if there is a better angle...probably not.  There is so much going on in the shot that it distracts from the boots. I know you need a reference point for their size.  I think you got the shot that was there, it just has way to much going on IMO.  But I do like the boots.</td>', 'They must be right "everything is big in Texas".  I don''t know if there is a better angle...probably not.  There is so much going on in the shot that it distracts from the boots. I know you need a reference point for their size.  I think you got the shot that was there, it just has way to much going on IMO.  But I do like the boots.', '2005-09-01 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665624, 222714, 30817, '<td valign="top">There are so many literal representations of gym shoes in this challenge that your choice to merely suggest them and then proceed with your story, is a bold and dare I say brilliant idea that lifts your effort out of the pile of shots laying on the floor beneath this trophy on a mantle.  The "story" here, the suggestion that this young person wants something they perhaps cannot have, has been lived by us all at some point.  So immediarely you have sympatico with your viewer.  But what really lifts this shot to great heights is the clever use of foreground element to convey a reality/dream state that transcends the theme of merely showing shoes and forces us to look at an emotional state.  This is my blue ribbon regardless of how you make out among the masses.  Thanks for making me think. 10 and fav</td>', 'There are so many literal representations of gym shoes in this challenge that your choice to merely suggest them and then proceed with your story, is a bold and dare I say brilliant idea that lifts your effort out of the pile of shots laying on the floor beneath this trophy on a mantle.  The "story" here, the suggestion that this young person wants something they perhaps cannot have, has been lived by us all at some point.  So immediarely you have sympatico with your viewer.  But what really lifts this shot to great heights is the clever use of foreground element to convey a reality/dream state that transcends the theme of merely showing shoes and forces us to look at an emotional state.  This is my blue ribbon regardless of how you make out among the masses.  Thanks for making me think. 10 and fav', '2005-09-01 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
