(1665795, 224255, 30817, '<td valign="top">Was this challenge your validation for buying the new bike shoes?  Good thinking!   You did a fine job of using this technique to suggest movement.  I like the 3 red spots on the far shoe peeking around the down tube.  That the chain is not moving, does not diminish nor improve the quality of the shot, but does reduce the speed and intricacy factors a little.  Love the green blur of vegetation on the right side.  7.</td>', 'Was this challenge your validation for buying the new bike shoes?  Good thinking!   You did a fine job of using this technique to suggest movement.  I like the 3 red spots on the far shoe peeking around the down tube.  That the chain is not moving, does not diminish nor improve the quality of the shot, but does reduce the speed and intricacy factors a little.  Love the green blur of vegetation on the right side.  7.', '2005-09-01 12:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665796, 223898, 42602, '<td valign="top">Nice action, lighting, color. Contrast is very good. You may want to turn the model slightly next time so light spills across both legs.</td>', 'Nice action, lighting, color. Contrast is very good. You may want to turn the model slightly next time so light spills across both legs.', '2005-09-01 12:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
