(1665845, 222938, 30817, '<td valign="top">You nailed this shot ... in midstride!  Rumbling down the track of an elemental theme, this piece works because all its components move right into the viewer, just as the stride does.  The white BG isolates the activity and forces the eye to remain riveted on the freight train bearing down.  The crisp focus on what is about to hit, aids in identity and proximity.  But the best part of this composition is the trailing foot that, though only an apparition at this point, we know is going to clobber us soon after the front foot lands.  It is this anticipation that forces our eye to survey the scene and calculate how much longer we have until impact.   Great conception and execution!  One of my top ten picks for this week''s challenge.</td>', 'You nailed this shot ... in midstride!  Rumbling down the track of an elemental theme, this piece works because all its components move right into the viewer, just as the stride does.  The white BG isolates the activity and forces the eye to remain riveted on the freight train bearing down.  The crisp focus on what is about to hit, aids in identity and proximity.  But the best part of this composition is the trailing foot that, though only an apparition at this point, we know is going to clobber us soon after the front foot lands.  It is this anticipation that forces our eye to survey the scene and calculate how much longer we have until impact.   Great conception and execution!  One of my top ten picks for this week''s challenge.', '2005-09-01 12:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665849, 223025, 30817, '<td valign="top">Totally cute and wildly fun! This is a textbook lesson in simple, creative composition.  One of those images that one can easily fall in love with ... kind of like a shot of Audrey Hepburn.  The swoosh line of the table is great, but the  twisted knee makes it all work.  One of my ribbon picks for this challenge.  9 and a fav.</td>', 'Totally cute and wildly fun! This is a textbook lesson in simple, creative composition.  One of those images that one can easily fall in love with ... kind of like a shot of Audrey Hepburn.  The swoosh line of the table is great, but the  twisted knee makes it all work.  One of my ribbon picks for this challenge.  9 and a fav.', '2005-09-01 12:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665853, 224394, 30817, '<td valign="top">There were many shoes-left-on-the-floor-as-a-metaphor shots in this challenge, but yours was far and away the most successful.  I feel the inclusion of the necktie was the dominant clincher.  The way it is positioned speaks to the formality of the start of the work day (top left with the knot still in place) and then lower, how it wilts and bends thoughout the day with all the navigations its owner must accomodate, until it is spent and flat out exhausted as indicated at bottom right.  This "timeline" in rich red tones literally wraps the wingtip (the business day) as it is removed from his foot and his life for at least one more night of rest and recuperation until he is back at it again tomorrow.  So nicely done and technically perserved so that the viewer can read this story in comfort, like an evening paper.  One of my top ten picks for this challenge.  9.</td>', 'There were many shoes-left-on-the-floor-as-a-metaphor shots in this challenge, but yours was far and away the most successful.  I feel the inclusion of the necktie was the dominant clincher.  The way it is positioned speaks to the formality of the start of the work day (top left with the knot still in place) and then lower, how it wilts and bends thoughout the day with all the navigations its owner must accomodate, until it is spent and flat out exhausted as indicated at bottom right.  This "timeline" in rich red tones literally wraps the wingtip (the business day) as it is removed from his foot and his life for at least one more night of rest and recuperation until he is back at it again tomorrow.  So nicely done and technically perserved so that the viewer can read this story in comfort, like an evening paper.  One of my top ten picks for this challenge.  9.', '2005-09-01 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1665856, 224810, 30817, '<td valign="top">I feel good looking at this photograph!  It is a stylish, stimulating and uniquely accurate abstract design that also works on a communicative level as well as an aesthetic level, but I don''t think that is why it is so much fun.  I know why.  The high and low linear quality is like a photographic roller coaster.  The jumble of light tones at the bottom, a loop-de-loop.  This is fun because it an amusement park .... not a pair of shoes.  One of my top ten picks for this challenge.  9.</td>', 'I feel good looking at this photograph!  It is a stylish, stimulating and uniquely accurate abstract design that also works on a communicative level as well as an aesthetic level, but I don''t think that is why it is so much fun.  I know why.  The high and low linear quality is like a photographic roller coaster.  The jumble of light tones at the bottom, a loop-de-loop.  This is fun because it an amusement park .... not a pair of shoes.  One of my top ten picks for this challenge.  9.', '2005-09-01 12:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
