(1666017, 224921, 40703, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting; it''s very ambient and surrounds the two subjects. No distracting shadows. Nice sepia tone. Good contrast. 8</td>', 'I love the lighting; it''s very ambient and surrounds the two subjects. No distracting shadows. Nice sepia tone. Good contrast. 8', '2005-09-01 13:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
