(1666024, 224986, 41129, '<td valign="top">the building reflected in the metal distracts from the shoe, which meant i then had to look again to find the shoe....</td>', 'the building reflected in the metal distracts from the shoe, which meant i then had to look again to find the shoe....', '2005-09-01 13:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666026, 224393, 27482, '<td valign="top">This photo brought a smile on my face, I love his expression.  However, even though the quality of the photo is very nice this just looks like a snapshot of your kid to me, a good snapshot but nothing more.  I have a feeling I would have liked it more if the horizon hadn''t been tilted, if you hadn´t had that shadow in the lower right corner and if this shot had been wider or further away so that I could see the surroundings better.  6 from me.</td>', 'This photo brought a smile on my face, I love his expression.  However, even though the quality of the photo is very nice this just looks like a snapshot of your kid to me, a good snapshot but nothing more.  I have a feeling I would have liked it more if the horizon hadn''t been tilted, if you hadn´t had that shadow in the lower right corner and if this shot had been wider or further away so that I could see the surroundings better.  6 from me.', '2005-09-01 13:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666028, 224921, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good choice to make this sepia toned.  Love the composition and one of the better photos in the challenge, 8 from me.</td>', 'Very nice, good choice to make this sepia toned.  Love the composition and one of the better photos in the challenge, 8 from me.', '2005-09-01 13:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
