(1666038, 223266, 27482, '<td valign="top">Of course this is just my opinion so just take it like that but I have never ever understood why soft focus was so popular a decade ago, I just don´t like that style.  However, this is not a bad choice for a soft focus shot if you neccesarily have to do one but I would probably have rated this higher if it had been pristine sharp...</td>', 'Of course this is just my opinion so just take it like that but I have never ever understood why soft focus was so popular a decade ago, I just don´t like that style.  However, this is not a bad choice for a soft focus shot if you neccesarily have to do one but I would probably have rated this higher if it had been pristine sharp...', '2005-09-01 13:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666043, 224926, 22379, '<td valign="top">i would have scored this image a lot higher if it was not for the harsh postprocessing- as it stands it falls into the catagory of digital art rather that photography imho</td>', 'i would have scored this image a lot higher if it was not for the harsh postprocessing- as it stands it falls into the catagory of digital art rather that photography imho', '2005-09-01 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
