(1666050, 225050, 36001, '<td valign="top">a brilliant idea well executioned. Well done, had to give it a 10</td>', 'a brilliant idea well executioned. Well done, had to give it a 10', '2005-09-01 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666051, 224255, 43079, '<td valign="top">Outstanding photo - best by far well done</td>', 'Outstanding photo - best by far well done', '2005-09-01 14:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666052, 224554, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well this is the first 1 I give out this challenge and there were 2 reasons.<br/> <br/>1.  The focus is way off so there is no friggin way to see what is in the picture.<br/>2.  I can´t make out anything that even closely resembles a shoe so as far as I am concerned it´s off topic no matter what the title says.<br/> <br/>Would have given 3 if I had been able to make out an out of focus shoe.  I encourage you to keep up the experimentation though but if you want to do well in these challenges you have to stick to the basics wich is to at least have the shot in focus...</td>', 'Well this is the first 1 I give out this challenge and there were 2 reasons. 1.  The focus is way off so there is no friggin way to see what is in the picture.2.  I can´t make out anything that even closely resembles a shoe so as far as I am concerned it´s off topic no matter what the title says. Would have given 3 if I had been able to make out an out of focus shoe.  I encourage you to keep up the experimentation though but if you want to do well in these challenges you have to stick to the basics wich is to at least have the shot in focus...', '2005-09-01 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
