(1666141, 224469, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  It would be neat if you could put a line in to make it look like a reflection.</td>', 'Very cool!  It would be neat if you could put a line in to make it look like a reflection.', '2005-09-01 14:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666146, 222938, 42385, '<td valign="top">Powerful picture!</td>', 'Powerful picture!', '2005-09-01 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666151, 224458, 42385, '<td valign="top">Very nice and original picture. I don''t like so much the "green" colour of the sky, anyway I think this is a very interesting picture, and very original idea. Congratulations.</td>', 'Very nice and original picture. I don''t like so much the "green" colour of the sky, anyway I think this is a very interesting picture, and very original idea. Congratulations.', '2005-09-01 14:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666156, 224803, 42385, '<td valign="top">wow! powerfull picture. Very nice, elegant.</td>', 'wow! powerfull picture. Very nice, elegant.', '2005-09-01 14:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666175, 224840, 22379, '<td valign="top">I like the selective desat. The way you chose to present this image has harmed your overall score. The roated boarder is not appealing to the eye. You would have been better off to have cropped the image.</td>', 'I like the selective desat. The way you chose to present this image has harmed your overall score. The roated boarder is not appealing to the eye. You would have been better off to have cropped the image.', '2005-09-01 14:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666179, 223631, 42385, '<td valign="top">Nice colours combination, interesting picture, although the shadow looks blue over the white line, that is a weak point I find, anyway I like the picture.</td>', 'Nice colours combination, interesting picture, although the shadow looks blue over the white line, that is a weak point I find, anyway I like the picture.', '2005-09-01 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666180, 224554, 38924, '<td valign="top">I applaud your creativity, however I would have liked to have seen it in focus.</td>', 'I applaud your creativity, however I would have liked to have seen it in focus.', '2005-09-01 14:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666182, 223801, 43383, '<td valign="top">Tragic.</td>', 'Tragic.', '2005-09-01 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666184, 222748, 22379, '<td valign="top">You need to adjust the white balance on your camera - the corrosponding menu item or button will say WB on it. You camera needed to be set to tungsten light. <br/>T^his image is out of focus and lacks strong composition.</td>', 'You need to adjust the white balance on your camera - the corrosponding menu item or button will say WB on it. You camera needed to be set to tungsten light. T^his image is out of focus and lacks strong composition.', '2005-09-01 14:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666185, 222566, 36001, '<td valign="top">nice photo but I''m not sure how it fits in with basic editing. Surely you have desaturated it in some way and then paint brushed some of the colour back in which is ''spot editing'' and not allowed.</td>', 'nice photo but I''m not sure how it fits in with basic editing. Surely you have desaturated it in some way and then paint brushed some of the colour back in which is ''spot editing'' and not allowed.', '2005-09-01 14:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666187, 224934, 42385, '<td valign="top">Really nice, powerfull picture. I love it.</td>', 'Really nice, powerfull picture. I love it.', '2005-09-01 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666191, 224646, 22379, '<td valign="top">While the subject matter is interesting, the image has a "snapshot" feel to it, like you were recording the dancers feet to remember his costume for a family holiday photo album. <br/>If the subject is standing still, get down on level with the feet. Alternatively, photo graph the feet in action - show us he is a dancer.</td>', 'While the subject matter is interesting, the image has a "snapshot" feel to it, like you were recording the dancers feet to remember his costume for a family holiday photo album. If the subject is standing still, get down on level with the feet. Alternatively, photo graph the feet in action - show us he is a dancer.', '2005-09-01 14:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666194, 224751, 22379, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be off in this image, right before the opening of the front shoe sems to be where the focus falls. If i were using a shallow DOF for this photo, i would have had the shoe toe in focus, but this image would be stronger with a depeper DOF.<br/>Why are the shoes up on a banister? Does the owner regularly walk along the banister? <br/>Feet would have helped in the presentation of these shoes.</td>', 'The focus seems to be off in this image, right before the opening of the front shoe sems to be where the focus falls. If i were using a shallow DOF for this photo, i would have had the shoe toe in focus, but this image would be stronger with a depeper DOF.Why are the shoes up on a banister? Does the owner regularly walk along the banister? Feet would have helped in the presentation of these shoes.', '2005-09-01 14:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666204, 224339, 22379, '<td valign="top">This photo has been oversharpened. The middle white sneaker is over exposed. The composition would have been stronger if you used rule of thirds.</td>', 'This photo has been oversharpened. The middle white sneaker is over exposed. The composition would have been stronger if you used rule of thirds.', '2005-09-01 14:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666208, 224593, 22379, '<td valign="top">You have the focus on the mountain rather than the feet. Why does each person only have one leg? The composition in regards to what the image should have been about (the shoes) is very dull and muddled.</td>', 'You have the focus on the mountain rather than the feet. Why does each person only have one leg? The composition in regards to what the image should have been about (the shoes) is very dull and muddled.', '2005-09-01 14:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666233, 224554, 43047, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what i see here; to me it''s not art but a blurry photo of something i can''t identify; sorry 2</td>', 'I don''t know what i see here; to me it''s not art but a blurry photo of something i can''t identify; sorry 2', '2005-09-01 14:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666243, 225060, 22379, '<td valign="top">no one - he is sitting down. The light on this is really bad, to blow out a black shoe so bad that half of it appears white is a good reason to delete that file and try again. Looking at a mans groin is not very photogentic and does not add to the themse. <br/>Don''t men normally wear socks and dress pants with shoes like that? Attention to detail in costuming is important in a photograph.</td>', 'no one - he is sitting down. The light on this is really bad, to blow out a black shoe so bad that half of it appears white is a good reason to delete that file and try again. Looking at a mans groin is not very photogentic and does not add to the themse. Don''t men normally wear socks and dress pants with shoes like that? Attention to detail in costuming is important in a photograph.', '2005-09-01 15:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666249, 224554, 43079, '<td valign="top">could be anything!!</td>', 'could be anything!!', '2005-09-01 15:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666252, 222933, 22379, '<td valign="top">Why is a shoe sitting in a river with no foot?<br/>The water behind the shoe is over exposed, and the shadows have no details. When taking a photo of a black object with a bright back ground you need to meter your camera (hold the shutter button half way down) in the darkest area so there is still enough details present in the dark area. Would have ben easier though to have just roated the boat around and not taken the photo with the sun glare behind the boot.</td>', 'Why is a shoe sitting in a river with no foot?The water behind the shoe is over exposed, and the shadows have no details. When taking a photo of a black object with a bright back ground you need to meter your camera (hold the shutter button half way down) in the darkest area so there is still enough details present in the dark area. Would have ben easier though to have just roated the boat around and not taken the photo with the sun glare behind the boot.', '2005-09-01 15:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666254, 224988, 37961, '<td valign="top">Too busy. Strap marks on the persons feet are distracting. Not sure the angle is really flattering either. But those are cute shoes.</td>', 'Too busy. Strap marks on the persons feet are distracting. Not sure the angle is really flattering either. But those are cute shoes.', '2005-09-01 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666255, 224803, 37961, '<td valign="top">Those are some ridiculous shoes. Man. Creative Angle though.</td>', 'Those are some ridiculous shoes. Man. Creative Angle though.', '2005-09-01 15:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
