(1666404, 223802, 22379, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea that has been hurt by using such a small image size. Aim for 500 pixels long as the minimum. Lighting needs to be balance on the left so to even out the strong light on the right. Pay attention to background, as small details can make or break an image.</td>', 'This is a good idea that has been hurt by using such a small image size. Aim for 500 pixels long as the minimum. Lighting needs to be balance on the left so to even out the strong light on the right. Pay attention to background, as small details can make or break an image.', '2005-09-01 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
