(1666406, 223296, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice moment you caught here, too bad the image quality is horrible.  Too much noise, too little contrast and a whole lot of artefacts, especially in the green area to the left of the shoes.  It seems to me that by taking this picture in this setting with your camera is stretching it to it´s limits, I would suggest you taking it again when there is more light available and try to keep the ISO at it´s lowest setting and try using a bigger lightsource.  3 from me.</td>', 'Nice moment you caught here, too bad the image quality is horrible.  Too much noise, too little contrast and a whole lot of artefacts, especially in the green area to the left of the shoes.  It seems to me that by taking this picture in this setting with your camera is stretching it to it´s limits, I would suggest you taking it again when there is more light available and try to keep the ISO at it´s lowest setting and try using a bigger lightsource.  3 from me.', '2005-09-01 15:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
