(1666447, 224916, 22379, '<td valign="top">while the texture of the floor is interesting, there would have been better ways to include it in the image than looking down at your feet and taking a snap. The glare on the floor is a little distracting.</td>', 'while the texture of the floor is interesting, there would have been better ways to include it in the image than looking down at your feet and taking a snap. The glare on the floor is a little distracting.', '2005-09-01 16:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
