(1666450, 222596, 22379, '<td valign="top">this to me is a photo about weddings, about a bible and 2 rings about love. If it wasnt a show challenge, i would not have even guessed the ivory object was a shoe.</td>', 'this to me is a photo about weddings, about a bible and 2 rings about love. If it wasnt a show challenge, i would not have even guessed the ivory object was a shoe.', '2005-09-01 16:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
