(1666473, 224667, 22379, '<td valign="top">You are hurting your own score by posting a tiny image, try for a 500px length minimum. The lighting behind the shoe is very harsh, and the crop tight. I would have prefered to zoom out a little so we could see the shoe in the field to but in contxt that it is lost.</td>', 'You are hurting your own score by posting a tiny image, try for a 500px length minimum. The lighting behind the shoe is very harsh, and the crop tight. I would have prefered to zoom out a little so we could see the shoe in the field to but in contxt that it is lost.', '2005-09-01 16:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
