(1666495, 223625, 27482, '<td valign="top">Validated or not, I just don´t care at all for the post processing.  If you like it, keep it up though cause what the hell do I know though but I thought you deserved an explanation as to why I only gave it a 3 and that´s mainly just because you are on topic.</td>', 'Validated or not, I just don´t care at all for the post processing.  If you like it, keep it up though cause what the hell do I know though but I thought you deserved an explanation as to why I only gave it a 3 and that´s mainly just because you are on topic.', '2005-09-01 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666497, 223313, 22379, '<td valign="top">I fine this image to be very unispired (though i do appriciate that you actually went out and looked for shoes).<br/>There are more dinamic ways of presenting rows of shoes so to interest the audience. For example looking at the rack of shoes from straight ahead but angling the camer so it appeared that the shoes were all on an upwards slope.</td>', 'I fine this image to be very unispired (though i do appriciate that you actually went out and looked for shoes).There are more dinamic ways of presenting rows of shoes so to interest the audience. For example looking at the rack of shoes from straight ahead but angling the camer so it appeared that the shoes were all on an upwards slope.', '2005-09-01 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1666502, 224158, 32147, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the subject.  Its a great idea.  I only wish that the shoe was sharper and more in focus.</td>', 'I like the composition and the subject.  Its a great idea.  I only wish that the shoe was sharper and more in focus.', '2005-09-01 16:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
