(1666638, 223834, 42025, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, intresting all the shoes are black, almost give the impression of people standing and lookingout</td>', 'Nice use of color, intresting all the shoes are black, almost give the impression of people standing and lookingout', '2005-09-01 17:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
