(1666812, 224179, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh, intriguing choice to crop the head and make it anonymous and hence more enigmatic too. Greeaat boots - do you know the song "boots, boots, kinky boots" - one of those songs that came out in my childhood - maybe it was a cover of an earlier one - not sure - that I used to chant - this is a nicely lit and nicely composed image with some great texture contrasts in the skin, leather and concrete.</td>', 'Oooh, intriguing choice to crop the head and make it anonymous and hence more enigmatic too. Greeaat boots - do you know the song "boots, boots, kinky boots" - one of those songs that came out in my childhood - maybe it was a cover of an earlier one - not sure - that I used to chant - this is a nicely lit and nicely composed image with some great texture contrasts in the skin, leather and concrete.', '2005-09-01 18:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
