(1666835, 224827, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W, the contents work well in this tone. The gradation from light to dark in the upper part is smooth and pleasent.<br/>I like the composition, but would prefer a more square crop. The space in the lower fifth of the photo does little for the photo, it could do without.<br/>A view on someones back like this, with the shoe on the floor, makes me wonder what the person is doing. The effect is some kind of curiosity and expectation. A good way to catch the viewer. 9</td>', 'Good B&W, the contents work well in this tone. The gradation from light to dark in the upper part is smooth and pleasent.I like the composition, but would prefer a more square crop. The space in the lower fifth of the photo does little for the photo, it could do without.A view on someones back like this, with the shoe on the floor, makes me wonder what the person is doing. The effect is some kind of curiosity and expectation. A good way to catch the viewer. 9', '2005-09-01 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
