(1667457, 224827, 30817, '<td valign="top">I feel ANY good photograph is in some way "photojournalism."  For, in fact, shouldn''t a good photograph contain information worthy of one''s daily journal?  This shot cannot (and will not) be pigeon-holed into a category (landscape, still life, etc.)   It is expansive enough to touch all of them if the viewer wishes to make the connections.  In turning a theme as nebulous as "shoes" into a warring, brooding, epic story complete with plot and subplots; you have lifted not only the theme, but the viewer as well and gone to where a good photograph can take us.  You have added a page to my journal today.  One of my picks to ribbon ... which is usually a curse to mediocrity among the mass voters, but hey.... I read what you wrote here and appreciated your penmanship.</td>', 'I feel ANY good photograph is in some way "photojournalism."  For, in fact, shouldn''t a good photograph contain information worthy of one''s daily journal?  This shot cannot (and will not) be pigeon-holed into a category (landscape, still life, etc.)   It is expansive enough to touch all of them if the viewer wishes to make the connections.  In turning a theme as nebulous as "shoes" into a warring, brooding, epic story complete with plot and subplots; you have lifted not only the theme, but the viewer as well and gone to where a good photograph can take us.  You have added a page to my journal today.  One of my picks to ribbon ... which is usually a curse to mediocrity among the mass voters, but hey.... I read what you wrote here and appreciated your penmanship.', '2005-09-01 21:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
