(1668850, 225007, 34217, '<td valign="top">You know this has been done.  The picture like this is in my favorites section.  I propbably would vote higher if I did not think you copied, let me know where you got the idea and be honest</td>', 'You know this has been done.  The picture like this is in my favorites section.  I propbably would vote higher if I did not think you copied, let me know where you got the idea and be honest', '2005-09-02 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1668853, 224749, 42837, '<td valign="top">The composition has good potential, but would make a little more sense if the camera was a little higher. It kind of gives the impression of the viewer having just been run over by the biker in the shot as it is now. Seeing the sole of someones shoe gives the psychological image of being trampled underfoot, you get me? And maybe the depth of field could have pulled the viewers focus down to the boot rather than the petrol tank in the centre. Look at the writing on the boot and tank to see what I mean. And a tiny point lastly, but would a battered 10 year old scruffy pair of boots fitted the title a bit more?</td>', 'The composition has good potential, but would make a little more sense if the camera was a little higher. It kind of gives the impression of the viewer having just been run over by the biker in the shot as it is now. Seeing the sole of someones shoe gives the psychological image of being trampled underfoot, you get me? And maybe the depth of field could have pulled the viewers focus down to the boot rather than the petrol tank in the centre. Look at the writing on the boot and tank to see what I mean. And a tiny point lastly, but would a battered 10 year old scruffy pair of boots fitted the title a bit more?', '2005-09-02 12:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1668854, 225050, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is a fun idea and you pulled it off well. The only thing I have a problem with is the darkness of the boots. They seemed to need a little more light. 9</td>', 'This is a fun idea and you pulled it off well. The only thing I have a problem with is the darkness of the boots. They seemed to need a little more light. 9', '2005-09-02 12:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1668855, 224991, 42837, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is very tight in this shot, and focuses on the strap on the left shoe, and a little on the heel. It would be easier on the eye to bring the whole of the shoes into focus. The edge of the table in the background cutting awkwardly through the shot makes the composition uneasy, and could be resolved with a higher angle, or placing a large card behind the shoes or something.</td>', 'The depth of field is very tight in this shot, and focuses on the strap on the left shoe, and a little on the heel. It would be easier on the eye to bring the whole of the shoes into focus. The edge of the table in the background cutting awkwardly through the shot makes the composition uneasy, and could be resolved with a higher angle, or placing a large card behind the shoes or something.', '2005-09-02 12:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1668856, 225007, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! I love the sky and the texture in the old boot. 10</td>', 'This is a great shot! I love the sky and the texture in the old boot. 10', '2005-09-02 12:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1668858, 224921, 32644, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! Very active yet sharp. Excellent! 10</td>', 'What a great shot! Very active yet sharp. Excellent! 10', '2005-09-02 12:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
