(1669060, 223380, 19978, '<td valign="top">A wonderful take on the challenge. Not many of us ever get to see this done. Nice close up. Great tones, textures and detail on his arms - you can see how much effort a job like this takes.</td>', 'A wonderful take on the challenge. Not many of us ever get to see this done. Nice close up. Great tones, textures and detail on his arms - you can see how much effort a job like this takes.', '2005-09-02 14:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669065, 224288, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice simple arrangement. I think you should have illuminated the shoe a little better - it''s tough to see the detail that is there. The backlit sheet looks a little messy too, which detracts from the simplistic feel your photo projects.</td>', 'Nice simple arrangement. I think you should have illuminated the shoe a little better - it''s tough to see the detail that is there. The backlit sheet looks a little messy too, which detracts from the simplistic feel your photo projects.', '2005-09-02 14:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669066, 223209, 19978, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot. The implied movement, the bright colors, etc. Very nicely done. You don''t see pants like this everyday!</td>', 'I like this photo a lot. The implied movement, the bright colors, etc. Very nicely done. You don''t see pants like this everyday!', '2005-09-02 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669067, 225019, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice kid portrait. I''d probably have cropped a little closer, ikeeping the boots (since that''s the hook to the challenge) but losing a little of the hat, which is a little blurred anyway. This would have given you a tighter focus on his face, which is adorable.</td>', 'Very nice kid portrait. I''d probably have cropped a little closer, ikeeping the boots (since that''s the hook to the challenge) but losing a little of the hat, which is a little blurred anyway. This would have given you a tighter focus on his face, which is adorable.', '2005-09-02 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669089, 223783, 19978, '<td valign="top">Ah, this picture could have been so much more. It looks like some inherent blur as well as possible compression or sharpening artifacts. All detract from the wonderful texture and feel of these old boots. You''ll also get slammed because you sized it too small, but that wouldn''t be as much of a problem if the photo was crisper and better processed.</td>', 'Ah, this picture could have been so much more. It looks like some inherent blur as well as possible compression or sharpening artifacts. All detract from the wonderful texture and feel of these old boots. You''ll also get slammed because you sized it too small, but that wouldn''t be as much of a problem if the photo was crisper and better processed.', '2005-09-02 14:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669090, 223025, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect, very nice photo. I''d have cropped closer to the shoes on the bottom, which still would have left lots of whitespace at top and between the legs. Very minor nit, as I said, great photo!</td>', 'Very cool effect, very nice photo. I''d have cropped closer to the shoes on the bottom, which still would have left lots of whitespace at top and between the legs. Very minor nit, as I said, great photo!', '2005-09-02 14:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
