(1669448, 223153, 35444, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture - but there are no shoes in it.</td>', 'This is a good picture - but there are no shoes in it.', '2005-09-02 17:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669453, 224955, 30817, '<td valign="top">You might not have known how literally voters take the theme on this site, so prepare yourself for a low score.  But most people here probably do understand your meaning of "shoes through the suggestion of shoes."  Unfortunately it is this outside the box thinking that doesn''t wash too well here.  As for your piece here: while you are saying the shoes have been here and are gone, you only say they sunk in the mud before they left.  This could have been stronger aethetically if an element or artifact had been left behind, beside the prints.  Something with a contrasting color left on the ground in that center left area ... perhaps something expensive or potentially important, like a watch or a keyring with key.  Just something either mysterious or contrasty adding one additional color would have lifted this out of the mucky mire and up to a higher realm of interest.  4.</td>', 'You might not have known how literally voters take the theme on this site, so prepare yourself for a low score.  But most people here probably do understand your meaning of "shoes through the suggestion of shoes."  Unfortunately it is this outside the box thinking that doesn''t wash too well here.  As for your piece here: while you are saying the shoes have been here and are gone, you only say they sunk in the mud before they left.  This could have been stronger aethetically if an element or artifact had been left behind, beside the prints.  Something with a contrasting color left on the ground in that center left area ... perhaps something expensive or potentially important, like a watch or a keyring with key.  Just something either mysterious or contrasty adding one additional color would have lifted this out of the mucky mire and up to a higher realm of interest.  4.', '2005-09-02 17:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
