(1669479, 224815, 30817, '<td valign="top">Here is another "feet are shoes too" entry.  No they''re not.  No more than hands are gloves.  As for the composition: I like the distant light blue shade, but there is no other adjacent color to compliment it (the feet, because of their earth tones and position are a non-entity in terms of color.)  This would have come across better as a high key B&amp;W.  Perhaps a little more ankle showing and all four borders are white with a gradual fade into the lines, shades and textures as the viewer''s eyes  move toward the center of the frame.  Or one other fix would be to leave it in color, but add one nicely colored conch shell to the center of the upper right quadrent.  While this is true minimalism ... it is too minimalism.  We need more info. 4.</td>', 'Here is another "feet are shoes too" entry.  No they''re not.  No more than hands are gloves.  As for the composition: I like the distant light blue shade, but there is no other adjacent color to compliment it (the feet, because of their earth tones and position are a non-entity in terms of color.)  This would have come across better as a high key B&W.  Perhaps a little more ankle showing and all four borders are white with a gradual fade into the lines, shades and textures as the viewer''s eyes  move toward the center of the frame.  Or one other fix would be to leave it in color, but add one nicely colored conch shell to the center of the upper right quadrent.  While this is true minimalism ... it is too minimalism.  We need more info. 4.', '2005-09-02 17:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669484, 224606, 32338, '<td valign="top">The carpet at the bottom and the designs at the top give this image a point of view - I''m guessing a school.  But when the image is cropped to eliminate everything at and above the black horizontal line, a great pattern/ line picture of shoes emerges.</td>', 'The carpet at the bottom and the designs at the top give this image a point of view - I''m guessing a school.  But when the image is cropped to eliminate everything at and above the black horizontal line, a great pattern/ line picture of shoes emerges.', '2005-09-02 17:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669491, 224978, 32338, '<td valign="top">Cute perspective (and title).</td>', 'Cute perspective (and title).', '2005-09-02 17:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669495, 222942, 42602, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. Very nice contrast, and the lighting was great. Border comes in a little more on the right than on the left, but it''s not really that noticable. :) Keep up the great work.</td>', 'Cute idea. Very nice contrast, and the lighting was great. Border comes in a little more on the right than on the left, but it''s not really that noticable. :) Keep up the great work.', '2005-09-02 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
