(1669502, 224579, 42602, '<td valign="top">Good job on lighting from both sides. Black background looks very nice, but maybe a slightly textured background would have looked good, too.</td>', 'Good job on lighting from both sides. Black background looks very nice, but maybe a slightly textured background would have looked good, too.', '2005-09-02 17:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
