(1669507, 223316, 30817, '<td valign="top">No, the first shoes were probably animal skins or palm leaves.  You are already aware that opting out of the theme-wear is costly, but I applaud your independent attitude.  Sort of like the first human to keep an actual fire in his cave.  (He probably wore skins for shoes)  As to your work here.  It is chaotic, random and unenlightening.  A photograph, like a great teacher,  should either 1. Educate  2. Entertain  3. Reflect an emotion or 4. Call in recall to the viewer.  This does none of those things.  It is the book report of a student who put off the work for too much time and settled for writing from Cliff''s notes.  4.</td>', 'No, the first shoes were probably animal skins or palm leaves.  You are already aware that opting out of the theme-wear is costly, but I applaud your independent attitude.  Sort of like the first human to keep an actual fire in his cave.  (He probably wore skins for shoes)  As to your work here.  It is chaotic, random and unenlightening.  A photograph, like a great teacher,  should either 1. Educate  2. Entertain  3. Reflect an emotion or 4. Call in recall to the viewer.  This does none of those things.  It is the book report of a student who put off the work for too much time and settled for writing from Cliff''s notes.  4.', '2005-09-02 17:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669508, 223783, 42602, '<td valign="top">Great name. Angle is a biit awkward; shoes are crooked.</td>', 'Great name. Angle is a biit awkward; shoes are crooked.', '2005-09-02 17:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
