(1669563, 225022, 42602, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, contrast was good. Border allows shoes to fade into each other, though.try with black or white?</td>', 'Nice lighting, contrast was good. Border allows shoes to fade into each other, though.try with black or white?', '2005-09-02 17:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
