(1669834, 223831, 3032, '<td valign="top">(personal note)Golf course greens are a great backdrop for a photo(/personal note).<br/>I like the greath depth, the composition, the tonal range and what especially works here, the true colors. There''s also this fictional (male thing?) line between the shoes and the girl. Like "Hey where did that chick go!? O there she is!"</td>', '(personal note)Golf course greens are a great backdrop for a photo(/personal note).I like the greath depth, the composition, the tonal range and what especially works here, the true colors. There''s also this fictional (male thing?) line between the shoes and the girl. Like "Hey where did that chick go!? O there she is!"', '2005-09-02 19:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669836, 223101, 3032, '<td valign="top">I just love the mood of this photograph, the placement of the feet is intriguing (I bet I spelled that wrong).</td>', 'I just love the mood of this photograph, the placement of the feet is intriguing (I bet I spelled that wrong).', '2005-09-02 19:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669837, 224217, 3032, '<td valign="top">You know what, the curtains do add that "home" part to the photo. Good B&amp;W, perhaps a bit soft but I like the way the light increases from light to left and how the shoes are positioned in the frame. 8</td>', 'You know what, the curtains do add that "home" part to the photo. Good B&W, perhaps a bit soft but I like the way the light increases from light to left and how the shoes are positioned in the frame. 8', '2005-09-02 20:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669839, 224587, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, adidas in your face! The flow of the lines also looks natural, works out well.</td>', 'Cool perspective, adidas in your face! The flow of the lines also looks natural, works out well.', '2005-09-02 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669844, 224503, 3032, '<td valign="top">Perhaps nothing is really in focus or the dof is very limited, but I sure like the effect. 8</td>', 'Perhaps nothing is really in focus or the dof is very limited, but I sure like the effect. 8', '2005-09-02 20:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669845, 225018, 3032, '<td valign="top">Unreal, rofl! :) 8</td>', 'Unreal, rofl! :) 8', '2005-09-02 20:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669846, 225019, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is a very nice photograph. But the hat draws more attention than the shoes. This has to do with subject placement but moreover with the lighting. No mistake, I love the photograph but for the shoe challenge: 7</td>', 'It is a very nice photograph. But the hat draws more attention than the shoes. This has to do with subject placement but moreover with the lighting. No mistake, I love the photograph but for the shoe challenge: 7', '2005-09-02 20:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
