(1669974, 223323, 41510, '<td valign="top">I like how the focus is on the shoes yet the capture makes my eye wander all over the picture. I am drawn back to the shoes. Very nicely done. Good color, detail, focus. Nice silhouette.</td>', 'I like how the focus is on the shoes yet the capture makes my eye wander all over the picture. I am drawn back to the shoes. Very nicely done. Good color, detail, focus. Nice silhouette.', '2005-09-02 21:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1669978, 224957, 33400, '<td valign="top">A little macabre, but clever.  You need to match the lighting and focus for both the close shoe and the distant girl so I don''t see right away what this really is.  The out-of-focus shoe compared to the girl looks closer than her - losing the strength of the effect.</td>', 'A little macabre, but clever.  You need to match the lighting and focus for both the close shoe and the distant girl so I don''t see right away what this really is.  The out-of-focus shoe compared to the girl looks closer than her - losing the strength of the effect.', '2005-09-02 21:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
