(1670006, 224975, 35602, '<td valign="top">It looks as if you applied a filter to get the brushed look of the image.  It seems to work with the shoes okay, but I find that the background is distracting.  I know it is basic editing and you can''t spot edit, but if you want to get a really nice image (for sale or something) I would clear the background of the spotting and have it plain.  Good interpretation of the theme, however.</td>', 'It looks as if you applied a filter to get the brushed look of the image.  It seems to work with the shoes okay, but I find that the background is distracting.  I know it is basic editing and you can''t spot edit, but if you want to get a really nice image (for sale or something) I would clear the background of the spotting and have it plain.  Good interpretation of the theme, however.', '2005-09-02 21:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
