(1670221, 223613, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice work--a good example of how compositional rules can be broken to good effect. good tonal range. not sure about the border.</td>', 'nice work--a good example of how compositional rules can be broken to good effect. good tonal range. not sure about the border.', '2005-09-02 23:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670225, 223741, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the composition, but the yellow cast is bothersome. this is easily fixed with either levels or hue/saturation adjustment.</td>', 'I like the concept and the composition, but the yellow cast is bothersome. this is easily fixed with either levels or hue/saturation adjustment.', '2005-09-02 23:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670226, 224717, 6519, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you included the person in this to show us the scale of the grand-daddies of all shoes. There are a few technical problems with this (glare, composition), but I imagine you were very limited by the room you were in. Certainly on topic!</td>', 'I''m glad you included the person in this to show us the scale of the grand-daddies of all shoes. There are a few technical problems with this (glare, composition), but I imagine you were very limited by the room you were in. Certainly on topic!', '2005-09-02 23:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670228, 223027, 37930, '<td valign="top">Cute baby.. but I don''t see any shoes. A tad out of focus I think, but overall a nice shot, just wish it had something to do with shoes and not just a play on words in the title.</td>', 'Cute baby.. but I don''t see any shoes. A tad out of focus I think, but overall a nice shot, just wish it had something to do with shoes and not just a play on words in the title.', '2005-09-02 23:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670234, 224322, 17507, '<td valign="top">excellent representation of feminine/masculine in a surprising and creative manner.</td>', 'excellent representation of feminine/masculine in a surprising and creative manner.', '2005-09-02 23:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670241, 223382, 17507, '<td valign="top">crosshatch lighting effect is not to my tastes but is well executed.</td>', 'crosshatch lighting effect is not to my tastes but is well executed.', '2005-09-02 23:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670248, 224391, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am trying to see something - ANYTHING - more than a very hasty snapshot in this photo, but I''m not succeeding. This is just a quick snap that isn''t even clear focus  :-(</td>', 'I am trying to see something - ANYTHING - more than a very hasty snapshot in this photo, but I''m not succeeding. This is just a quick snap that isn''t even clear focus  :-(', '2005-09-02 23:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670255, 222378, 35226, '<td valign="top">i bet those shoes are from payless shoesource... hehe sorry i work there...  nice shot, although the background seems to drown out the otherwise eyecatching composition of the photo</td>', 'i bet those shoes are from payless shoesource... hehe sorry i work there...  nice shot, although the background seems to drown out the otherwise eyecatching composition of the photo', '2005-09-02 23:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670260, 224986, 6519, '<td valign="top">hmmm..... the shoe in this photo doesn''t quite manage to be the subject of the photo - it is rather hard to see and quite overwhelmed by its surroundings. But appreciate the effort.</td>', 'hmmm..... the shoe in this photo doesn''t quite manage to be the subject of the photo - it is rather hard to see and quite overwhelmed by its surroundings. But appreciate the effort.', '2005-09-03 00:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670266, 224986, 32644, '<td valign="top">My moniter shows this as too dark. I have trouble finding the shoe/flames. Maybe a relector would have made it stand out better.</td>', 'My moniter shows this as too dark. I have trouble finding the shoe/flames. Maybe a relector would have made it stand out better.', '2005-09-03 00:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670272, 224437, 35226, '<td valign="top">i love it...</td>', 'i love it...', '2005-09-03 00:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670276, 224883, 6519, '<td valign="top">I have NO problems with nudity where it makes sense, but in this case there is no point to it. It is totally offtopic and adds nothing to the photo in any way. <br/>Your subject seems to be the striped stockings, the rest is just.... well....... there.</td>', 'I have NO problems with nudity where it makes sense, but in this case there is no point to it. It is totally offtopic and adds nothing to the photo in any way. Your subject seems to be the striped stockings, the rest is just.... well....... there.', '2005-09-03 00:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670277, 224606, 42332, '<td valign="top">personally, i would have cropped out the bugs on top, because i find them distracting and contrary to the wonderful pattern-geometric-thing you have going on here. but, it''s a really cute bug... :-)</td>', 'personally, i would have cropped out the bugs on top, because i find them distracting and contrary to the wonderful pattern-geometric-thing you have going on here. but, it''s a really cute bug... :-)', '2005-09-03 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670278, 224472, 35226, '<td valign="top">i bet most those shoes are from payless shoesource.. hehe i work there so i recongnize them.. nice concept for the shot although it seems poorly lit and somewhat out of focus..</td>', 'i bet most those shoes are from payless shoesource.. hehe i work there so i recongnize them.. nice concept for the shot although it seems poorly lit and somewhat out of focus..', '2005-09-03 00:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670281, 224628, 35226, '<td valign="top">amazing shot, great concept... but the object in the backgroud is very distracting and takes away from the otherwise flawless shot</td>', 'amazing shot, great concept... but the object in the backgroud is very distracting and takes away from the otherwise flawless shot', '2005-09-03 00:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670283, 224393, 6519, '<td valign="top">What I like about this photo: The composition, the cute kid, the lovely gentle sunlight, the perspective that makes the boots look even bigger that they would if taken from another angle.<br/>What I don''t like: the very crooked horizon, the shadow on the rock (made by the photographer, I assume?) and the worried look on Junior''s face.</td>', 'What I like about this photo: The composition, the cute kid, the lovely gentle sunlight, the perspective that makes the boots look even bigger that they would if taken from another angle.What I don''t like: the very crooked horizon, the shadow on the rock (made by the photographer, I assume?) and the worried look on Junior''s face.', '2005-09-03 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670284, 225045, 6519, '<td valign="top">The background is far too busy for these shoes. The shoes themselves have so much detail - the many skinny straps, plus the patterns ON those straps, heel, colors etc.  A calm surface and background would let the shoes stand out a lot more.</td>', 'The background is far too busy for these shoes. The shoes themselves have so much detail - the many skinny straps, plus the patterns ON those straps, heel, colors etc.  A calm surface and background would let the shoes stand out a lot more.', '2005-09-03 00:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670285, 223266, 6519, '<td valign="top">This wouldn''t do you much good as advertising, but I like it a lot for this challenge. We get to see enough to know what we''re looking at, but the soft focus gives them some mystique, too.</td>', 'This wouldn''t do you much good as advertising, but I like it a lot for this challenge. We get to see enough to know what we''re looking at, but the soft focus gives them some mystique, too.', '2005-09-03 00:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670288, 225042, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the set-up and composition</td>', 'I like the set-up and composition', '2005-09-03 00:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670289, 223993, 35226, '<td valign="top">love the concept and compostion, but the lighting could have been improved...</td>', 'love the concept and compostion, but the lighting could have been improved...', '2005-09-03 00:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670291, 225058, 6519, '<td valign="top">You have a good idea going here, but the glare from the flash is annoying. This would look so much better with different lighting (especially including lighting from the side to give depth).</td>', 'You have a good idea going here, but the glare from the flash is annoying. This would look so much better with different lighting (especially including lighting from the side to give depth).', '2005-09-03 00:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670293, 224908, 6519, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the amount of effort you put into this photo.</td>', 'I appreciate the amount of effort you put into this photo.', '2005-09-03 00:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670294, 224916, 34857, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The flash ( or other lightsouce ) adds a nice bit of gloss to it.</td>', 'I like this one. The flash ( or other lightsouce ) adds a nice bit of gloss to it.', '2005-09-03 00:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670296, 224412, 34857, '<td valign="top">Very professional looking. It looks like something you might see in the Sunday papers :)</td>', 'Very professional looking. It looks like something you might see in the Sunday papers :)', '2005-09-03 00:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670298, 224520, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like the strong side sunlight, the composition and the effect of the front shoe being in mid stride. The sepia works well here, too.</td>', 'Nicely done, I like the strong side sunlight, the composition and the effect of the front shoe being in mid stride. The sepia works well here, too.', '2005-09-03 00:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670299, 224994, 34857, '<td valign="top">Precious memories...</td>', 'Precious memories...', '2005-09-03 00:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670300, 225072, 34857, '<td valign="top">Very good, natural lighting on this one. Makes the curves stand out softly</td>', 'Very good, natural lighting on this one. Makes the curves stand out softly', '2005-09-03 00:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670301, 225071, 34857, '<td valign="top">I think this setup had a lot more potential. The lighting coming in the right side of the pic looks cool, and plays nicely on the sandal, but the bacground looks a liitle to dark for my tastes.</td>', 'I think this setup had a lot more potential. The lighting coming in the right side of the pic looks cool, and plays nicely on the sandal, but the bacground looks a liitle to dark for my tastes.', '2005-09-03 00:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670302, 223361, 6519, '<td valign="top">This photo appears to be a hastily taken snapshot  :-(</td>', 'This photo appears to be a hastily taken snapshot  :-(', '2005-09-03 00:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670303, 224437, 34857, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Those little figurines are quite expressive.</td>', 'Very cool. Those little figurines are quite expressive.', '2005-09-03 00:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670304, 224841, 34857, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast would make this better, still good though.</td>', 'A little more contrast would make this better, still good though.', '2005-09-03 00:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670305, 225033, 35226, '<td valign="top">great idea but the other shoes in the background throw off your message/concept of the photo.. otherwise love it<br/></td>', 'great idea but the other shoes in the background throw off your message/concept of the photo.. otherwise love it', '2005-09-03 00:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670307, 222311, 34857, '<td valign="top">Very emotional shot, but a liltle more contrast would make it stronger.</td>', 'Very emotional shot, but a liltle more contrast would make it stronger.', '2005-09-03 00:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670308, 224992, 34857, '<td valign="top">Good symetry.</td>', 'Good symetry.', '2005-09-03 00:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670310, 224520, 34857, '<td valign="top">The return of the invisible man!!! This one should score pretty high IMO. I like it.</td>', 'The return of the invisible man!!! This one should score pretty high IMO. I like it.', '2005-09-03 00:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670311, 222265, 34857, '<td valign="top">Another good macro shot. Pretty good.</td>', 'Another good macro shot. Pretty good.', '2005-09-03 00:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670313, 222418, 34857, '<td valign="top">And a perfect crop.</td>', 'And a perfect crop.', '2005-09-03 00:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670314, 223981, 35226, '<td valign="top">nice concept although i feel the background should have been in focus as opposed to the foreground.. maybe this was intentional?</td>', 'nice concept although i feel the background should have been in focus as opposed to the foreground.. maybe this was intentional?', '2005-09-03 00:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670315, 224907, 34857, '<td valign="top">Nice play with scale. The piano key seems gigantic!!!</td>', 'Nice play with scale. The piano key seems gigantic!!!', '2005-09-03 00:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670318, 224917, 8879, '<td valign="top">Cool tones.</td>', 'Cool tones.', '2005-09-03 00:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670319, 224499, 8879, '<td valign="top">That kitty is so cute, I can''t help myself</td>', 'That kitty is so cute, I can''t help myself', '2005-09-03 00:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670321, 224903, 8879, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, not sure I like the message. The wood floor is a little distracting.</td>', 'Cool concept, not sure I like the message. The wood floor is a little distracting.', '2005-09-03 00:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670327, 224255, 8879, '<td valign="top">Cool action shot. How did you get the shot while in motion? Long Zoom?</td>', 'Cool action shot. How did you get the shot while in motion? Long Zoom?', '2005-09-03 00:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670332, 224810, 8879, '<td valign="top">Would be cool to have everything in focus, but a cool concept. B&amp;W or duo-tone would be a nice effect here.</td>', 'Would be cool to have everything in focus, but a cool concept. B&W or duo-tone would be a nice effect here.', '2005-09-03 00:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670338, 225041, 3569, '<td valign="top">wonderful setting, a bit too dark in highlight areas toi me</td>', 'wonderful setting, a bit too dark in highlight areas toi me', '2005-09-03 01:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670359, 223741, 43047, '<td valign="top">Great picture; great title; makes me curious to see the rest ;-)</td>', 'Great picture; great title; makes me curious to see the rest ;-)', '2005-09-03 01:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670362, 224907, 38476, '<td valign="top">Angle works well in this photo</td>', 'Angle works well in this photo', '2005-09-03 01:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670363, 223101, 33672, '<td valign="top">great lighting and texture.</td>', 'great lighting and texture.', '2005-09-03 01:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670364, 224772, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice comp.The efeect is almost that of a painting... I like it.</td>', 'Nice comp.The efeect is almost that of a painting... I like it.', '2005-09-03 01:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670368, 224883, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great comp. It could use a bit more contrast and maybe a different color chair.</td>', 'Great comp. It could use a bit more contrast and maybe a different color chair.', '2005-09-03 01:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670370, 224032, 38476, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Great moment captured.</td>', 'Great idea. Great moment captured.', '2005-09-03 01:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670372, 224008, 33672, '<td valign="top">The title fits... So does this photo. One of the best in the theme.</td>', 'The title fits... So does this photo. One of the best in the theme.', '2005-09-03 01:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670375, 225045, 38476, '<td valign="top">Interesting setting for your shoes. Thoughtfully chosen.</td>', 'Interesting setting for your shoes. Thoughtfully chosen.', '2005-09-03 01:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670380, 224999, 38476, '<td valign="top">This one''s on the verge of slapstick humor. I like it!</td>', 'This one''s on the verge of slapstick humor. I like it!', '2005-09-03 01:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670405, 224917, 40155, '<td valign="top">This is an example of "thinking outside the box." I like your shot, especially the textures.</td>', 'This is an example of "thinking outside the box." I like your shot, especially the textures.', '2005-09-03 02:18:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1670407, 222938, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Great shot.  One of the best of shoes and ''what they do'' in my opinion in the Challenge.  Also looks like a macro to me.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a slight ''straightening'' of the shoe, less noise (if possible) on the ''far shoe''.  Perhaps if there was more ''empty space'' to the right of the ''far shoe'' it may have made this shot even better, in my opinion, but not sure, plus you are restricted ''sizewise''.  I just like the perspective and angle, the colors, detail in textures  and the simplicity, well done.  A little baffled as to why it needed to be validated, but ''it has been''.</td>', '8 - Great shot.  One of the best of shoes and ''what they do'' in my opinion in the Challenge.  Also looks like a macro to me.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a slight ''straightening'' of the shoe, less noise (if possible) on the ''far shoe''.  Perhaps if there was more ''empty space'' to the right of the ''far shoe'' it may have made this shot even better, in my opinion, but not sure, plus you are restricted ''sizewise''.  I just like the perspective and angle, the colors, detail in textures  and the simplicity, well done.  A little baffled as to why it needed to be validated, but ''it has been''.', '2005-09-03 02:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670408, 224359, 40155, '<td valign="top">Great focus and good lighting. It took me a bit to understand the guitar background, but I get it now.</td>', 'Great focus and good lighting. It took me a bit to understand the guitar background, but I get it now.', '2005-09-03 02:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670411, 224394, 40155, '<td valign="top">Great colour, and I love the cropping. You have made it interesting.</td>', 'Great colour, and I love the cropping. You have made it interesting.', '2005-09-03 02:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670412, 223993, 40155, '<td valign="top">great perspective</td>', 'great perspective', '2005-09-03 02:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670413, 224916, 40155, '<td valign="top">The flash on the floor is harsh and the space theme does not work so well with sandals and bare legs.</td>', 'The flash on the floor is harsh and the space theme does not work so well with sandals and bare legs.', '2005-09-03 02:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670415, 223468, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure that I like the effect applied here.  Whatever it was that was done to this photo has left pink and blue blotchy areas on the shoes.  I think the lighting makes the photo interesting, but I think the shadow between the shoes is a distraction.  Focus seems ok, although hard to tell with the effect.  Very interesting shoes though.</td>', 'I''m not really sure that I like the effect applied here.  Whatever it was that was done to this photo has left pink and blue blotchy areas on the shoes.  I think the lighting makes the photo interesting, but I think the shadow between the shoes is a distraction.  Focus seems ok, although hard to tell with the effect.  Very interesting shoes though.', '2005-09-03 02:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670416, 222218, 40155, '<td valign="top">Great eye.  You have captured everyday-ness and given it interest.</td>', 'Great eye.  You have captured everyday-ness and given it interest.', '2005-09-03 02:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670418, 223895, 3080, '<td valign="top">Would love to see a level horizon here.  Interesting shoes and I think an interesting idea.  Good potential.  I like the sky color, but not so sure about the bright pink sand? Focus is good on the subject and dof makes it interesting.  I wish the photo wasn''t so divided between the blue and pink.</td>', 'Would love to see a level horizon here.  Interesting shoes and I think an interesting idea.  Good potential.  I like the sky color, but not so sure about the bright pink sand? Focus is good on the subject and dof makes it interesting.  I wish the photo wasn''t so divided between the blue and pink.', '2005-09-03 02:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670419, 223741, 40155, '<td valign="top">I just love the lighting</td>', 'I just love the lighting', '2005-09-03 02:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670420, 224472, 40155, '<td valign="top">I think the shot falls short of the message it is trying to convey.</td>', 'I think the shot falls short of the message it is trying to convey.', '2005-09-03 02:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670422, 222311, 40155, '<td valign="top">too blurry</td>', 'too blurry', '2005-09-03 02:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670423, 225005, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I do like this shot,  I nearly marked it down to 7 but it is the simplicity and creativity I think I like the most, so 8 it stays.   Criticism; It is lacking ''something'' in my opinion.  Whether it is ''depth'', coloring, more shadow play, not sure.  The shoes are a good ''clean and simple'' choice, just needs some ''oompth'' somewhere in my opinion.  Perhaps even in this case, a frame may have ''dramatized'' it more, not sure.  Perhaps a different background, perhaps more ''space'' on one side, different angle, not sure, sorry.  The only other thing to add would be that the focus seems to be sharper on the ''far'' shoe than the ''fore'', it would have been nice to see more detail/texture on the ''fore'' shoe, especially the ''toe''.</td>', '8 - I do like this shot,  I nearly marked it down to 7 but it is the simplicity and creativity I think I like the most, so 8 it stays.   Criticism; It is lacking ''something'' in my opinion.  Whether it is ''depth'', coloring, more shadow play, not sure.  The shoes are a good ''clean and simple'' choice, just needs some ''oompth'' somewhere in my opinion.  Perhaps even in this case, a frame may have ''dramatized'' it more, not sure.  Perhaps a different background, perhaps more ''space'' on one side, different angle, not sure, sorry.  The only other thing to add would be that the focus seems to be sharper on the ''far'' shoe than the ''fore'', it would have been nice to see more detail/texture on the ''fore'' shoe, especially the ''toe''.', '2005-09-03 02:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670425, 224177, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this photo.  The color is really nice and focus and clarity are also good.  The bee on the wall is a bit of a distraction for me, but not that big of a deal.  The angle is definatley interesting and adds to the photo in my opinion.  Overall a really nice shot, definately meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the feel of this photo.  The color is really nice and focus and clarity are also good.  The bee on the wall is a bit of a distraction for me, but not that big of a deal.  The angle is definatley interesting and adds to the photo in my opinion.  Overall a really nice shot, definately meets the challenge.', '2005-09-03 02:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670426, 224239, 40155, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is a little harsh .</td>', 'Your lighting is a little harsh .', '2005-09-03 02:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670427, 224157, 40155, '<td valign="top">Clean and crisp.</td>', 'Clean and crisp.', '2005-09-03 02:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670428, 222714, 40155, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2005-09-03 02:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670429, 224657, 3080, '<td valign="top">I definately don''t get the title...but who cares.  The shot is interesting to look at.  Focus seems a bit soft to me though.  It could just be the lighting making it look that way.  Doesn''t seem to be ideal lighitng conditions for shooting.  I''m wondering if this would benefit from a less centered positioning.  Something to think about anyway.</td>', 'I definately don''t get the title...but who cares.  The shot is interesting to look at.  Focus seems a bit soft to me though.  It could just be the lighting making it look that way.  Doesn''t seem to be ideal lighitng conditions for shooting.  I''m wondering if this would benefit from a less centered positioning.  Something to think about anyway.', '2005-09-03 02:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670430, 224724, 40155, '<td valign="top">Good use of the thirds rule.  I like your tone of sepia.</td>', 'Good use of the thirds rule.  I like your tone of sepia.', '2005-09-03 02:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670432, 222748, 40155, '<td valign="top">The fuzziness is distracting.</td>', 'The fuzziness is distracting.', '2005-09-03 02:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670434, 222938, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Great angle, great perspective.  Focus and clarity are good, dof works well.  The only thing bugging me a bit is the pixelish look in the back foot and the bottom of the front foot.  Seems noisy or pixelated or something.  Otherwise, excellent shot.</td>', 'I really like this.  Great angle, great perspective.  Focus and clarity are good, dof works well.  The only thing bugging me a bit is the pixelish look in the back foot and the bottom of the front foot.  Seems noisy or pixelated or something.  Otherwise, excellent shot.', '2005-09-03 02:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670436, 224006, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean shot of a shoe.  Crop seems a bit tight in the lower right corner, but not a huge deal.  background works.  I like that it''s not a solid color background, but slightly different.  Love the blue.  focus and clarity are really good.  overall, just a neat shot.</td>', 'Nice, clean shot of a shoe.  Crop seems a bit tight in the lower right corner, but not a huge deal.  background works.  I like that it''s not a solid color background, but slightly different.  Love the blue.  focus and clarity are really good.  overall, just a neat shot.', '2005-09-03 02:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670438, 222992, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately old.  I cannot fathom anyone actually wearing this shoe, but it looks like they have!!  Focus and clarity look good to me.  Lighting ok.  Seems a tad bright on the lace, and maybe just a bit dark toward the back of the shoe, but neither is terribly bad.  Seems like a bit too tight on the crop in my opinion.  Otherwise, definately different.</td>', 'Definately old.  I cannot fathom anyone actually wearing this shoe, but it looks like they have!!  Focus and clarity look good to me.  Lighting ok.  Seems a tad bright on the lace, and maybe just a bit dark toward the back of the shoe, but neither is terribly bad.  Seems like a bit too tight on the crop in my opinion.  Otherwise, definately different.', '2005-09-03 02:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670440, 224742, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately shoes.  I''m thinking that a different crop would have maybe been a better choice.  It''s awefully tight on the left and you don''t really show enough of the shoe on the right to make up for it.  Focus looks good.  I like the texture I can see in the shoe.  Background has some specks in it.  some vertical lines in the right side, and horizontal lines to the left side.  Show up mostly when lightened, don''t show up when viewed darker though.  Depending on calibration, depends on who''s going to see it and who wont.</td>', 'Definately shoes.  I''m thinking that a different crop would have maybe been a better choice.  It''s awefully tight on the left and you don''t really show enough of the shoe on the right to make up for it.  Focus looks good.  I like the texture I can see in the shoe.  Background has some specks in it.  some vertical lines in the right side, and horizontal lines to the left side.  Show up mostly when lightened, don''t show up when viewed darker though.  Depending on calibration, depends on who''s going to see it and who wont.', '2005-09-03 02:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670452, 223815, 40703, '<td valign="top">Very vivid detail. Excellent. 8</td>', 'Very vivid detail. Excellent. 8', '2005-09-03 02:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670454, 224827, 40703, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. Just something I can feel. 10</td>', 'I love this photo. Just something I can feel. 10', '2005-09-03 02:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670457, 222557, 40703, '<td valign="top">Would have been a better shot if the pail wasn''t behind the boot. 4</td>', 'Would have been a better shot if the pail wasn''t behind the boot. 4', '2005-09-03 03:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670464, 223643, 42984, '<td valign="top">Superb shot of the horse, perhaps a tenuous link to the challenge :)</td>', 'Superb shot of the horse, perhaps a tenuous link to the challenge :)', '2005-09-03 03:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
