(1670471, 224751, 42837, '<td valign="top">subject is uninspiring; glittery slippers placed on some bird-poop stained fencing!?! And the focus is far too narrow, and misses the shoes, settling on what seems to be the hotspot at the toe in the front. Maybe considering the ''glam'' look of the shoe they should have a ''glam'' setting and context?</td>', 'subject is uninspiring; glittery slippers placed on some bird-poop stained fencing!?! And the focus is far too narrow, and misses the shoes, settling on what seems to be the hotspot at the toe in the front. Maybe considering the ''glam'' look of the shoe they should have a ''glam'' setting and context?', '2005-09-03 03:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670472, 222528, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cute B&amp;W imaging</td>', 'Cute B&W imaging', '2005-09-03 03:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670473, 223153, 42984, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice piece of photo journalism image</td>', 'Wow, nice piece of photo journalism image', '2005-09-03 03:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670474, 224333, 42984, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enought to rate sorry</td>', 'Not sharp enought to rate sorry', '2005-09-03 03:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670475, 224993, 42837, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, and good composition, just a shame it could have been executed better. take the dirt on the boots first of all. and they could have been lit better to accentuate the contrast with the otherwise plain background. And maybe a slight blur on the boots would have helped the effect.</td>', 'Nice concept, and good composition, just a shame it could have been executed better. take the dirt on the boots first of all. and they could have been lit better to accentuate the contrast with the otherwise plain background. And maybe a slight blur on the boots would have helped the effect.', '2005-09-03 03:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670477, 224861, 42837, '<td valign="top">perhaps a different title, since there''s no sand, and it''s clearly not a beach. It just looks like a snapshot while out walking by the shore, could have worked on developing a theme or make a comment on the style of shoe. Black socks with the sandals would have at least given the viewer a chuckle.</td>', 'perhaps a different title, since there''s no sand, and it''s clearly not a beach. It just looks like a snapshot while out walking by the shore, could have worked on developing a theme or make a comment on the style of shoe. Black socks with the sandals would have at least given the viewer a chuckle.', '2005-09-03 03:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670480, 225040, 42984, '<td valign="top">Beaker is my fav muppet</td>', 'Beaker is my fav muppet', '2005-09-03 03:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670482, 225000, 42984, '<td valign="top">The jumps make this an interestign shot</td>', 'The jumps make this an interestign shot', '2005-09-03 03:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670483, 224415, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2005-09-03 03:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670487, 224868, 42984, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, well executed and nice sharp clear imagery.  I wonder if it would have more wow factor had you used the other daisy poster to cover the edge of the main one. It just looks a little sloppy - which is a shame - 7</td>', 'Clever idea, well executed and nice sharp clear imagery.  I wonder if it would have more wow factor had you used the other daisy poster to cover the edge of the main one. It just looks a little sloppy - which is a shame - 7', '2005-09-03 03:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670488, 225002, 42837, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t look controlled, and has far too much going on besides the ''little feet''. Cropping the untidy parts like the blanket and nappy (diaper) till you''re left with just the feet and hand helps a lot. The sock/shoe comparison hasn''t been developed as strongly as it could be.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t look controlled, and has far too much going on besides the ''little feet''. Cropping the untidy parts like the blanket and nappy (diaper) till you''re left with just the feet and hand helps a lot. The sock/shoe comparison hasn''t been developed as strongly as it could be.', '2005-09-03 03:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670492, 225007, 42984, '<td valign="top">Mmmm yes.  The sturation levels are great.  The colour, density and light on the wire captivates me and the overall colouring and effects are quite captivating.  The angle bugged me to begin with, it still does but I can live with it now - 9</td>', 'Mmmm yes.  The sturation levels are great.  The colour, density and light on the wire captivates me and the overall colouring and effects are quite captivating.  The angle bugged me to begin with, it still does but I can live with it now - 9', '2005-09-03 03:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670493, 223709, 42837, '<td valign="top">Looks just like a snapshot, maybe even waiting for the car to get out of shot would have improved it.</td>', 'Looks just like a snapshot, maybe even waiting for the car to get out of shot would have improved it.', '2005-09-03 03:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670496, 224638, 42984, '<td valign="top">Not much effort into this one is there?  It looks it</td>', 'Not much effort into this one is there?  It looks it', '2005-09-03 03:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670497, 223981, 35545, '<td valign="top">Presumably, the shoes are the main interest in this shot.  Why are they out of focus.   I really like the texture of the steps, and it has the possibility of being a really good shot, but it''s all foreground with nothing in it.</td>', 'Presumably, the shoes are the main interest in this shot.  Why are they out of focus.   I really like the texture of the steps, and it has the possibility of being a really good shot, but it''s all foreground with nothing in it.', '2005-09-03 04:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670498, 223209, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and background, I''m impressed.  I''m not sure about the composition, something about it bugs me at the moment - 8</td>', 'Great lighting and background, I''m impressed.  I''m not sure about the composition, something about it bugs me at the moment - 8', '2005-09-03 04:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670500, 225043, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, is missing some drama element, can''t decide what that might be yet.</td>', 'Nice macro, is missing some drama element, can''t decide what that might be yet.', '2005-09-03 04:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670503, 225034, 42837, '<td valign="top">Excellent job, and well done on both the conceptual work leading up to, and the execution of this shot. I love shots like this, and you''ve really captured both the movement, and just enough extra of the shoes to make them the focus of the shot. I wondered at first if I should nit-pick about the corridor being too bright for a ''spooky'' atmosphere, but the more I look the more I really like this image. 10</td>', 'Excellent job, and well done on both the conceptual work leading up to, and the execution of this shot. I love shots like this, and you''ve really captured both the movement, and just enough extra of the shoes to make them the focus of the shot. I wondered at first if I should nit-pick about the corridor being too bright for a ''spooky'' atmosphere, but the more I look the more I really like this image. 10', '2005-09-03 04:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670506, 222905, 42984, '<td valign="top">Now this isn''t going to score high in the challange because it doesn''t have those huge wow factors, but I personally think this is a top picture.  The lighting values, the sharpness of the sand, the composition, lighting and balance are all spot on.  Except &lt;grrr&gt; for that one in the foreground ... costs it a point - 8</td>', 'Now this isn''t going to score high in the challange because it doesn''t have those huge wow factors, but I personally think this is a top picture.  The lighting values, the sharpness of the sand, the composition, lighting and balance are all spot on.  Except <grrr> for that one in the foreground ... costs it a point - 8', '2005-09-03 04:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670507, 224981, 42984, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2005-09-03 04:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670510, 223898, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good sports action shot but the hero of the shot, the shoe is out of focus and out of the focal point of the shot - 4<br/></td>', 'Good sports action shot but the hero of the shot, the shoe is out of focus and out of the focal point of the shot - 4', '2005-09-03 04:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670511, 224887, 42837, '<td valign="top">Less is more, and I usually agree with this principle, however if that was the case, then why not follow it right through and wait for the clouds to move entirely from shot. Either that or go for a different angle and sillhouette the shoes against an amazing colourful sunset, or deep blue sky. I like this version of the dangling shoe theme the best so far though.</td>', 'Less is more, and I usually agree with this principle, however if that was the case, then why not follow it right through and wait for the clouds to move entirely from shot. Either that or go for a different angle and sillhouette the shoes against an amazing colourful sunset, or deep blue sky. I like this version of the dangling shoe theme the best so far though.', '2005-09-03 04:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670512, 224444, 34547, '<td valign="top">That shadow up top kills this. Good color and placing the pink and green next to eachother.</td>', 'That shadow up top kills this. Good color and placing the pink and green next to eachother.', '2005-09-03 04:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670513, 224342, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very contrived, and far too busy making the boots lose their battle for dominance as the main subjects entirely</td>', 'Very contrived, and far too busy making the boots lose their battle for dominance as the main subjects entirely', '2005-09-03 04:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670514, 224879, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great stuff.  Fantastic effect, I would use this in a magazine ad without any problem at all.  I am bugged by the shoe at the end of the day still being zipped up.  Even if they are usually kicked off like this, if there is a story being told about the end of the day, then these little details help convey the story.  Picky? yes but this is a tough school and the commercial world is tougher.</td>', 'Great stuff.  Fantastic effect, I would use this in a magazine ad without any problem at all.  I am bugged by the shoe at the end of the day still being zipped up.  Even if they are usually kicked off like this, if there is a story being told about the end of the day, then these little details help convey the story.  Picky? yes but this is a tough school and the commercial world is tougher.', '2005-09-03 04:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670515, 224469, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good concept, balancing act and sharpness.  Creativity gets it a 7</td>', 'Good concept, balancing act and sharpness.  Creativity gets it a 7', '2005-09-03 04:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670516, 224606, 34547, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the top off and a tad off the bottom to make the array more prominent.</td>', 'I would have cropped the top off and a tad off the bottom to make the array more prominent.', '2005-09-03 04:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670518, 224021, 42984, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, I don''t think it quite came off but was worth a try. Where is she?</td>', 'Interesting concept, I don''t think it quite came off but was worth a try. Where is she?', '2005-09-03 04:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670519, 224469, 42837, '<td valign="top">omg!!! <br/> <br/>...ouch. The shot is powerful if only just for that reaction. Composition-wise, might be nitpicking here, but with balance being the theme, showing more of the shin to equal the shoe, and make them meet in the centre would seem more ''balanced''.<br/> <br/>again i say OUCH!</td>', 'omg!!!  ...ouch. The shot is powerful if only just for that reaction. Composition-wise, might be nitpicking here, but with balance being the theme, showing more of the shin to equal the shoe, and make them meet in the centre would seem more ''balanced''. again i say OUCH!', '2005-09-03 04:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670520, 224815, 34547, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, of course you''re going to hear over and over how small it is, and perhaps the lack of shoes.  I like whites and faint blues and the interesting lighting on the feet.</td>', 'This is beautiful, of course you''re going to hear over and over how small it is, and perhaps the lack of shoes.  I like whites and faint blues and the interesting lighting on the feet.', '2005-09-03 04:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670522, 224926, 34547, '<td valign="top">This is a little harsh for me. I''m trying to figure the context for using the effect and I can''t quite tell what is going on under the heal and in the background.</td>', 'This is a little harsh for me. I''m trying to figure the context for using the effect and I can''t quite tell what is going on under the heal and in the background.', '2005-09-03 04:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670523, 224831, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great composition, leads the eye down to the splash of colour which is, rather satisfyingly, the subject ie: wedge shaped shoes. The fantastic legs on the model will bump the marks up no end as well i''ll wager.  ;)</td>', 'Great composition, leads the eye down to the splash of colour which is, rather satisfyingly, the subject ie: wedge shaped shoes. The fantastic legs on the model will bump the marks up no end as well i''ll wager.  ;)', '2005-09-03 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670524, 224986, 34547, '<td valign="top">The contrast is tough on distinguishing the boot from the bike.  Unfortunately, all that chrome makes it tough to hide the flash, perhaps a longer shutter?</td>', 'The contrast is tough on distinguishing the boot from the bike.  Unfortunately, all that chrome makes it tough to hide the flash, perhaps a longer shutter?', '2005-09-03 04:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670526, 224747, 34547, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  I like the darkened reds and the contrasty lines, but I can perceive the halos around the areas where dark meets light.  Barring that, this is a nice, nostalgia-looking sports shoe photo. I think with a bit more time and tedium the Photoshop work could be perfect.</td>', 'I like this photo.  I like the darkened reds and the contrasty lines, but I can perceive the halos around the areas where dark meets light.  Barring that, this is a nice, nostalgia-looking sports shoe photo. I think with a bit more time and tedium the Photoshop work could be perfect.', '2005-09-03 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670527, 224158, 34547, '<td valign="top">If I weren''t aware of the challenge topic, your title would be the only thing leading me understanding what the subject matter is.  The shadow is nice and crisp but the shoe looks like it is moving.</td>', 'If I weren''t aware of the challenge topic, your title would be the only thing leading me understanding what the subject matter is.  The shadow is nice and crisp but the shoe looks like it is moving.', '2005-09-03 04:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670528, 223834, 42837, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you get the unearthly glowing effect in the sky? I also like how this shot left me puzzling, and therefore required me to go and find out the cultural references and meaning of the title. Pity you put a great lump of iron post right in shot though.</td>', 'Wow, how did you get the unearthly glowing effect in the sky? I also like how this shot left me puzzling, and therefore required me to go and find out the cultural references and meaning of the title. Pity you put a great lump of iron post right in shot though.', '2005-09-03 04:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670531, 225030, 34547, '<td valign="top">Gnarly. The way you handled the color is nice, as well as the smoothe gradient for the background.  The image is put together well with a nice combination of shoe style with the weathered jeans. I''d like to see this in the top 5 to 10.  Good luck!</td>', 'Gnarly. The way you handled the color is nice, as well as the smoothe gradient for the background.  The image is put together well with a nice combination of shoe style with the weathered jeans. I''d like to see this in the top 5 to 10.  Good luck!', '2005-09-03 04:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670532, 223802, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very poorly lit, and the bag seems distracting</td>', 'Very poorly lit, and the bag seems distracting', '2005-09-03 04:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670534, 223831, 34547, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You know, I''m not a fan of just giving comments to say "I like it" but this is really fantastic.  Everything is right. Welcome to my favorites. Good luck on your ribbon!</td>', 'Wow!  You know, I''m not a fan of just giving comments to say "I like it" but this is really fantastic.  Everything is right. Welcome to my favorites. Good luck on your ribbon!', '2005-09-03 04:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670535, 224740, 42984, '<td valign="top">Pretty awesome depthe of field and motion - 6</td>', 'Pretty awesome depthe of field and motion - 6', '2005-09-03 04:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670537, 224941, 42837, '<td valign="top">Holiday snap feel. The spade is distracting focus from the subject.</td>', 'Holiday snap feel. The spade is distracting focus from the subject.', '2005-09-03 04:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670539, 225077, 34547, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you were slightly too close to the shoe to get it entirely focused, but perhaps a further, longer lens wasn''t feasible. Close the aperture up, longer exposure? The concept is good and I think the way you have it all laid out is perfect.</td>', 'Perhaps you were slightly too close to the shoe to get it entirely focused, but perhaps a further, longer lens wasn''t feasible. Close the aperture up, longer exposure? The concept is good and I think the way you have it all laid out is perfect.', '2005-09-03 04:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670540, 223802, 34547, '<td valign="top">Nice socks!  Now who is doing the speaking in this photo? It is a bit too dark.</td>', 'Nice socks!  Now who is doing the speaking in this photo? It is a bit too dark.', '2005-09-03 04:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670541, 224698, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, perhaps a little lazily executed since you could gain a huge increase in impact by rotation and crop.  This could have been really funny - 4</td>', 'Nice concept, perhaps a little lazily executed since you could gain a huge increase in impact by rotation and crop.  This could have been really funny - 4', '2005-09-03 04:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670542, 223407, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hehe, charming wit. Apt pose, but maybe the awkardness of the subject might have been better expressed by setting them further from the viewer, and less ''in your face'' and umm, confrontational.</td>', 'Hehe, charming wit. Apt pose, but maybe the awkardness of the subject might have been better expressed by setting them further from the viewer, and less ''in your face'' and umm, confrontational.', '2005-09-03 04:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
