(1670553, 223741, 34547, '<td valign="top">The white-balance is a bit too warm. Great, sexy stockings black (dark) shoes. It doesnt'' work so well for me when the woman is wearing read shoes.</td>', 'The white-balance is a bit too warm. Great, sexy stockings black (dark) shoes. It doesnt'' work so well for me when the woman is wearing read shoes.', '2005-09-03 04:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670555, 225050, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hahahahahaha, brillant. Excellent dark shot picking out just enough detail in the boots, and I love the idea and execution of the long exposure odour trails. Well balced and effective composition.</td>', 'Hahahahahaha, brillant. Excellent dark shot picking out just enough detail in the boots, and I love the idea and execution of the long exposure odour trails. Well balced and effective composition.', '2005-09-03 04:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670557, 225012, 42837, '<td valign="top">Lacks imagination, and doesn''t say anything about the shoes.</td>', 'Lacks imagination, and doesn''t say anything about the shoes.', '2005-09-03 04:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670558, 225040, 34547, '<td valign="top">Actually, IMO, I think this would have been a great photo without the puppet.  The lighting is terrific and the white is very clean making for some nice textures in the leather. That little guy just breaks all that.    :(</td>', 'Actually, IMO, I think this would have been a great photo without the puppet.  The lighting is terrific and the white is very clean making for some nice textures in the leather. That little guy just breaks all that.    :(', '2005-09-03 04:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670559, 225077, 42837, '<td valign="top">Terrible composition by cropping the main subject. Think of it as being similar to cropping someones forehead out of a picture. If only for that, the DOF would have really pulled this shot up. But unfortunately that''s so off putting.</td>', 'Terrible composition by cropping the main subject. Think of it as being similar to cropping someones forehead out of a picture. If only for that, the DOF would have really pulled this shot up. But unfortunately that''s so off putting.', '2005-09-03 04:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
