(1670579, 223762, 43227, '<td valign="top">nice wiew</td>', 'nice wiew', '2005-09-03 05:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670581, 224647, 36001, '<td valign="top">I love your photo but I have to be honest, If I didn''t know what catagory it was I would think this was a very good photo of a man with his horse. The shoes were not a focal point in the composition. Unfortunately, the same mistake I made.</td>', 'I love your photo but I have to be honest, If I didn''t know what catagory it was I would think this was a very good photo of a man with his horse. The shoes were not a focal point in the composition. Unfortunately, the same mistake I made.', '2005-09-03 05:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670585, 224723, 42837, '<td valign="top">Without the title, and knowing the contest theme this image is far too close, and could do with moving back to release even a little more information for the viewer to let them be recognisable as shoes. Nice abstract composition despite this.</td>', 'Without the title, and knowing the contest theme this image is far too close, and could do with moving back to release even a little more information for the viewer to let them be recognisable as shoes. Nice abstract composition despite this.', '2005-09-03 05:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670587, 223631, 42837, '<td valign="top">The whole left hand side of the picture is superfluous, and is much stronger without it. In fact the bottom right 1/4 of the pic (the shoes and shadow) are all that''s needed.</td>', 'The whole left hand side of the picture is superfluous, and is much stronger without it. In fact the bottom right 1/4 of the pic (the shoes and shadow) are all that''s needed.', '2005-09-03 05:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670589, 224983, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of lighting, picking out just the right amount of detail on the subjects.</td>', 'Very nice use of lighting, picking out just the right amount of detail on the subjects.', '2005-09-03 05:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670593, 223025, 42837, '<td valign="top">Elegant weight of line and beautiful composition. A clever idea well executed.</td>', 'Elegant weight of line and beautiful composition. A clever idea well executed.', '2005-09-03 06:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670595, 224499, 42837, '<td valign="top">The choice of black shoe against a black background, practically removes the shoes from the subject, making the kitten entirely the focus of this this shot.</td>', 'The choice of black shoe against a black background, practically removes the shoes from the subject, making the kitten entirely the focus of this this shot.', '2005-09-03 06:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670601, 224957, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hehe, funny! Has buckets of potential to be a winner.<br/>Would be better with a different set-up so you get the shoe in focus as well, since it is suppossed to be in the same plane as the girl. Maybe taking the shot with the shoe closer to the girl, and then cropping the image down later. Not sure if you have access to different lenses, you might try a wide-angle for greater DOF, or maybe a smaller aperture might possibly do the trick. The lighting between both is also inconsistent.</td>', 'Hehe, funny! Has buckets of potential to be a winner.Would be better with a different set-up so you get the shoe in focus as well, since it is suppossed to be in the same plane as the girl. Maybe taking the shot with the shoe closer to the girl, and then cropping the image down later. Not sure if you have access to different lenses, you might try a wide-angle for greater DOF, or maybe a smaller aperture might possibly do the trick. The lighting between both is also inconsistent.', '2005-09-03 06:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670606, 224999, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the colours are a bit dull. Maybe it would have worked better in B/W with a bit more contrast.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the colours are a bit dull. Maybe it would have worked better in B/W with a bit more contrast.', '2005-09-03 06:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670607, 222425, 42837, '<td valign="top">Not close enough to get an abstract type textural picture, and too close to take advantage of evoking the era that the shoes portray, ie: 1940''s Casablanca type shot.</td>', 'Not close enough to get an abstract type textural picture, and too close to take advantage of evoking the era that the shoes portray, ie: 1940''s Casablanca type shot.', '2005-09-03 06:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670608, 224554, 41554, '<td valign="top">I just can''t figure out what this is. Sorry, doesn''t say "shoes" to me.</td>', 'I just can''t figure out what this is. Sorry, doesn''t say "shoes" to me.', '2005-09-03 06:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670609, 223264, 42837, '<td valign="top">There could be a lot more going on in this image. There doesn''t seem to be any dialogue with the viewer beyond: "here''s my shoes which I just placed on this step". There''s nothing in the picture to indicate change.</td>', 'There could be a lot more going on in this image. There doesn''t seem to be any dialogue with the viewer beyond: "here''s my shoes which I just placed on this step". There''s nothing in the picture to indicate change.', '2005-09-03 06:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670610, 224342, 41554, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter in this one.If it were only the boots in the woodbench, I think it would have worked better.</td>', 'Too much clutter in this one.If it were only the boots in the woodbench, I think it would have worked better.', '2005-09-03 06:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670611, 224957, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but by focusing on the girl, the shoe is evidently out of focus, and the trick is revealed... Shooting with more DOF would have made this a great picture.</td>', 'Nice idea, but by focusing on the girl, the shoe is evidently out of focus, and the trick is revealed... Shooting with more DOF would have made this a great picture.', '2005-09-03 06:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670612, 224820, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of depth of field and lighting to pick out the shoes. An adorable image all round, but could have been even more intimate by cropping out the wall, and a little of the left hand side bringing in tighter to the babys head. Whereas in other situations such close cropping might appear claustrophobic and too intense, this subject would easily disarm any  such impressions and actually makes the mood even warmer and more cosy.</td>', 'Very effective use of depth of field and lighting to pick out the shoes. An adorable image all round, but could have been even more intimate by cropping out the wall, and a little of the left hand side bringing in tighter to the babys head. Whereas in other situations such close cropping might appear claustrophobic and too intense, this subject would easily disarm any  such impressions and actually makes the mood even warmer and more cosy.', '2005-09-03 06:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670614, 222675, 42837, '<td valign="top">I feel I disagree about the title of the shot, since it seems much more a fashion shot than a dance/movement shot. But that aside, the composition, contrast and form are very powerful and effective creating a beautiful image. Simple and elegant.</td>', 'I feel I disagree about the title of the shot, since it seems much more a fashion shot than a dance/movement shot. But that aside, the composition, contrast and form are very powerful and effective creating a beautiful image. Simple and elegant.', '2005-09-03 07:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670617, 223396, 42837, '<td valign="top">Another case of anthropomorphism which makes the shot seem (like the other examples) far too contrived and forced. If you had been making some comment about a lost shoe maybe or something this may have worked.</td>', 'Another case of anthropomorphism which makes the shot seem (like the other examples) far too contrived and forced. If you had been making some comment about a lost shoe maybe or something this may have worked.', '2005-09-03 07:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670619, 223762, 42837, '<td valign="top">The horizon should really be moved to place both shoes in sillhouette against the sky. Also, considering the location shoes like that are usually found, ie: up high on a telephone wire, the viewer is far too close to the subject. I guess you just weren''t willing to part with an old pair of trainers, and went for the low shot for easy retrieval.</td>', 'The horizon should really be moved to place both shoes in sillhouette against the sky. Also, considering the location shoes like that are usually found, ie: up high on a telephone wire, the viewer is far too close to the subject. I guess you just weren''t willing to part with an old pair of trainers, and went for the low shot for easy retrieval.', '2005-09-03 07:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1670620, 225066, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hehe, the second one of these stinky shoe pics I''ve seen. Very well done. Maybe the shoes are a bit underexposed and could be filled in with a flash or something, but very good nonetheless.</td>', 'Hehe, the second one of these stinky shoe pics I''ve seen. Very well done. Maybe the shoes are a bit underexposed and could be filled in with a flash or something, but very good nonetheless.', '2005-09-03 07:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
