(1670865, 223266, 26633, '<td valign="top">The best of the still life pictures. The angle of view was well chosen, the depth of field and point of focus were spot on and the monochrome treatment well handled. 9. Bumped to 10</td>', 'The best of the still life pictures. The angle of view was well chosen, the depth of field and point of focus were spot on and the monochrome treatment well handled. 9. Bumped to 10', '2005-09-03 11:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
