(1671224, 224748, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the many branches don''t give the shoes of standing out - the eyes can''t focus anywhere, there is no composition. 4.</td>', 'Good idea, but the many branches don''t give the shoes of standing out - the eyes can''t focus anywhere, there is no composition. 4.', '2005-09-03 14:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671226, 225071, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the coloration and lighting on this. Very different and eyecatching.</td>', 'I like the coloration and lighting on this. Very different and eyecatching.', '2005-09-03 14:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671229, 224883, 27845, '<td valign="top">A sideview of the model would have improved this shot a lot. Also, the choice of the couch was a bad idea - it has almost the same colour tone as the girl''s skin. 5.</td>', 'A sideview of the model would have improved this shot a lot. Also, the choice of the couch was a bad idea - it has almost the same colour tone as the girl''s skin. 5.', '2005-09-03 14:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671232, 224883, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very fun. Like the composition and line. Eyecatching.</td>', 'Very fun. Like the composition and line. Eyecatching.', '2005-09-03 14:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671236, 224219, 27845, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour tones and textures, great composition and ambient light. I''d have preferred a plain black border. The colour you chose fits the image only in some parts, it feels irregular to the eye. 10.</td>', 'Lovely colour tones and textures, great composition and ambient light. I''d have preferred a plain black border. The colour you chose fits the image only in some parts, it feels irregular to the eye. 10.', '2005-09-03 14:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671238, 225067, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the tonality. Showing a bit more of the head would have been nice. Kudos for the idea and execution. 9.</td>', 'I like the tonality. Showing a bit more of the head would have been nice. Kudos for the idea and execution. 9.', '2005-09-03 14:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671239, 224613, 27845, '<td valign="top">Interesting over-exposure. I''d have preferred a tighter crop at the top, just above the heel. 7.</td>', 'Interesting over-exposure. I''d have preferred a tighter crop at the top, just above the heel. 7.', '2005-09-03 14:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671242, 224988, 27845, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh - try not to use your on-camera flash for close-ups. 3.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh - try not to use your on-camera flash for close-ups. 3.', '2005-09-03 14:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671246, 225004, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, but blown out highlights. I''d have preferred this as a sepia version. 5.</td>', 'Good perspective, but blown out highlights. I''d have preferred this as a sepia version. 5.', '2005-09-03 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671247, 225073, 27845, '<td valign="top">Showing a hobnailed horsefoot is a good idea, but the light from the flash is much too harsh and ruins the athmosphere. Also, a wider angle showing the man''s head would have been good. 4.</td>', 'Showing a hobnailed horsefoot is a good idea, but the light from the flash is much too harsh and ruins the athmosphere. Also, a wider angle showing the man''s head would have been good. 4.', '2005-09-03 14:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671249, 225005, 27845, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that is a problem :) The darks should be darker. The highlights are good, the light is soft. The high-heel should be a bit darker. Mabe you could change that during b/w conversion in the channel mixer? 7.</td>', 'Yeah, that is a problem :) The darks should be darker. The highlights are good, the light is soft. The high-heel should be a bit darker. Mabe you could change that during b/w conversion in the channel mixer? 7.', '2005-09-03 14:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671264, 222596, 43148, '<td valign="top">just does not make the boot the focal point, sorry, but makes no sense to me</td>', 'just does not make the boot the focal point, sorry, but makes no sense to me', '2005-09-03 15:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671273, 223750, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is darling. I love the white on white with the basic contrast coming from her skin tones and the all-stars.  It''s original and not just a pair of shoes.   I''m upping this to a 9.</td>', 'This is darling. I love the white on white with the basic contrast coming from her skin tones and the all-stars.  It''s original and not just a pair of shoes.   I''m upping this to a 9.', '2005-09-03 15:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671275, 224934, 15711, '<td valign="top">With the shoes and the black and white, it reminds me of something from the 40''s. It has whimsy and the lighting and composition are good.</td>', 'With the shoes and the black and white, it reminds me of something from the 40''s. It has whimsy and the lighting and composition are good.', '2005-09-03 15:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671276, 225071, 15711, '<td valign="top">The rust against the turquoise is interesting and adds to the shot.</td>', 'The rust against the turquoise is interesting and adds to the shot.', '2005-09-03 15:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671279, 224810, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very linear and has perfect symmetry, when done so obviously, works. This would make a great poster.  I like the light and dark of it as well as the geometry of the straps.  This is clever and after 2nd review, I''m upping my score. (:~p)</td>', 'This is very linear and has perfect symmetry, when done so obviously, works. This would make a great poster.  I like the light and dark of it as well as the geometry of the straps.  This is clever and after 2nd review, I''m upping my score. (:~p)', '2005-09-03 15:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671280, 224772, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the filtration on this with it''s urban edge. I think I''d crop out some of the area on the right so that the legs isn''t dead center. The coloration is rich and the warm of the brown tones against the stark white and black with the blue of the jeans is a nice melange!</td>', 'I like the filtration on this with it''s urban edge. I think I''d crop out some of the area on the right so that the legs isn''t dead center. The coloration is rich and the warm of the brown tones against the stark white and black with the blue of the jeans is a nice melange!', '2005-09-03 15:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671282, 224839, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the bunny. The background color kind of leaves me a bit ho hum. I wonder if this might have had more impact in black and white, since the boot and the rabbit are the same color?  Hmmmm - just my take on it.</td>', 'I love the bunny. The background color kind of leaves me a bit ho hum. I wonder if this might have had more impact in black and white, since the boot and the rabbit are the same color?  Hmmmm - just my take on it.', '2005-09-03 15:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671283, 224685, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sentiment of this alot.  The pink on pink is nicely done, but I''m wondering if it could have been shot from a different angle if it would have been more interesting.  Nothing beats baby''s shoes. :~)</td>', 'I like the sentiment of this alot.  The pink on pink is nicely done, but I''m wondering if it could have been shot from a different angle if it would have been more interesting.  Nothing beats baby''s shoes. :~)', '2005-09-03 15:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671288, 224885, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the elements of this shot alot.  The leaves of the plant have a metallic feel. The single shoe with the light bouncing off of it is well done. I have a sense that somebody just ran off, leaving one tap shoe behind. The laces tumbling over the step is a nice touch. Compositionally, this is done quite well. It makes you wonder what happened. I''m upping my score.</td>', 'I like the elements of this shot alot.  The leaves of the plant have a metallic feel. The single shoe with the light bouncing off of it is well done. I have a sense that somebody just ran off, leaving one tap shoe behind. The laces tumbling over the step is a nice touch. Compositionally, this is done quite well. It makes you wonder what happened. I''m upping my score.', '2005-09-03 15:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671289, 223025, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a whimsical sense to it which I like.  The diagonal line is interesting to the eye. I even like the pink coloration. With the shoes being black against the negative space, they have great impace.  This is definitely a fun shot!</td>', 'This has a whimsical sense to it which I like.  The diagonal line is interesting to the eye. I even like the pink coloration. With the shoes being black against the negative space, they have great impace.  This is definitely a fun shot!', '2005-09-03 15:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671292, 225030, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is kind of gross, as we hate roaches, yet it is very interesting and the more I look at it, the more I like it. The slight desaturation of color works. The contrast of the stripes of the shoes is interesting along with the texture of the leather shoe and the ragged hem of the jeans. I''m upping my score upon 2nd review.</td>', 'This is kind of gross, as we hate roaches, yet it is very interesting and the more I look at it, the more I like it. The slight desaturation of color works. The contrast of the stripes of the shoes is interesting along with the texture of the leather shoe and the ragged hem of the jeans. I''m upping my score upon 2nd review.', '2005-09-03 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671298, 224749, 15711, '<td valign="top">With the varied colors and all that''s going on this shot, it''s a bit busy for me. I do like the angle and the focus. I think maybe if you put it in black and white, then the color would no longer distract and you could concentrate on all of the other interesting elements of this shot. I think I''d crop out the chrome upon which the shoe is resting. I don''t think you need it to ground the foot. 7</td>', 'With the varied colors and all that''s going on this shot, it''s a bit busy for me. I do like the angle and the focus. I think maybe if you put it in black and white, then the color would no longer distract and you could concentrate on all of the other interesting elements of this shot. I think I''d crop out the chrome upon which the shoe is resting. I don''t think you need it to ground the foot. 7', '2005-09-03 15:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671299, 225046, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think what seperates this from the other studio type shots is the wheel in the background. The curve of the shoes mimic the curve of the tire - interesting and well done in that regard.  The clarity is spot on. 8</td>', 'I think what seperates this from the other studio type shots is the wheel in the background. The curve of the shoes mimic the curve of the tire - interesting and well done in that regard.  The clarity is spot on. 8', '2005-09-03 15:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671302, 223853, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the dappled light and the back shot effect. Not the most interesting, but considering the subject we were given, this is more than just a pair of combat boots. 7</td>', 'I like the dappled light and the back shot effect. Not the most interesting, but considering the subject we were given, this is more than just a pair of combat boots. 7', '2005-09-03 15:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671304, 225034, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this is really cool and a nice change for the challenge. I wish the photo were larger.  The title suites the aparition-like quality of the sneakers under the school lockers.</td>', 'I think this is really cool and a nice change for the challenge. I wish the photo were larger.  The title suites the aparition-like quality of the sneakers under the school lockers.', '2005-09-03 15:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671305, 222528, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the leaning boot. I think I''d make the background solid white instead of the wooden floor. The texture and detailing is well done.</td>', 'I like the leaning boot. I think I''d make the background solid white instead of the wooden floor. The texture and detailing is well done.', '2005-09-03 15:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671308, 224008, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love this .  Great sepia.  The angle and perspective is really good.  Upon 2nd review, I''m really like this as much as I did the first time. The DOF is perfectly achieved. I''m upping the score.</td>', 'I love this .  Great sepia.  The angle and perspective is really good.  Upon 2nd review, I''m really like this as much as I did the first time. The DOF is perfectly achieved. I''m upping the score.', '2005-09-03 15:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671310, 224195, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is great detailing. I almost think you could have even made it a single grommet with the lace coming out for a SUPER MACRO. Even as minimal as it is, it''s a tad busy with the lacing and color variations and all the speckled dust around the grommets.</td>', 'This is great detailing. I almost think you could have even made it a single grommet with the lace coming out for a SUPER MACRO. Even as minimal as it is, it''s a tad busy with the lacing and color variations and all the speckled dust around the grommets.', '2005-09-03 15:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671311, 223406, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would be awesome in black and white with high contrast. I like the close up of it.</td>', 'I think this would be awesome in black and white with high contrast. I like the close up of it.', '2005-09-03 15:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671314, 224175, 15711, '<td valign="top">Upon second review, I like this more and more. It''s clever and not expected. Great contrast and lighting. This would also work for high contrast. It is simplicity at its most empactful. I can see this hanging in a loft apartment. The "almost symmetry" works so well.  I''m definitely upping my score. 9</td>', 'Upon second review, I like this more and more. It''s clever and not expected. Great contrast and lighting. This would also work for high contrast. It is simplicity at its most empactful. I can see this hanging in a loft apartment. The "almost symmetry" works so well.  I''m definitely upping my score. 9', '2005-09-03 15:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671318, 224580, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the pinkish brown tone - it''s a bit unexpected. I love the title and the single shoe. The scenery adds to what could be a rather dull subject.  Nicely executed. 8</td>', 'I like the pinkish brown tone - it''s a bit unexpected. I love the title and the single shoe. The scenery adds to what could be a rather dull subject.  Nicely executed. 8', '2005-09-03 15:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671323, 224998, 15711, '<td valign="top">These seem to almost be moving with an invisible person. There are lots of pairs of sneakers, but these have a character to them which I like. The lighting is really good along with the detailing of them. 8</td>', 'These seem to almost be moving with an invisible person. There are lots of pairs of sneakers, but these have a character to them which I like. The lighting is really good along with the detailing of them. 8', '2005-09-03 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671324, 222875, 15711, '<td valign="top">The diagonal angle of this is interesting and fun. I like the use of negative space.</td>', 'The diagonal angle of this is interesting and fun. I like the use of negative space.', '2005-09-03 15:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671331, 224501, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this for some reason. I can''t really explain. I like the DOF with the back shoe being a bit blurred.  The blue and white tones of the shoe against the natural browns of the ground are a nice contrast. I assume that''s water in the background and just that hint of it work to create a lazy day sense.</td>', 'I like this for some reason. I can''t really explain. I like the DOF with the back shoe being a bit blurred.  The blue and white tones of the shoe against the natural browns of the ground are a nice contrast. I assume that''s water in the background and just that hint of it work to create a lazy day sense.', '2005-09-03 15:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671333, 225005, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  This is funny. From the thumbnail you couldn''t tell one was a man and one was a woman..... hmmmm or is it?  I guess I''ll never know.</td>', 'ROFL  This is funny. From the thumbnail you couldn''t tell one was a man and one was a woman..... hmmmm or is it?  I guess I''ll never know.', '2005-09-03 15:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671336, 224425, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has good movement and for stop action, is very focused.  Although this has shoes in it, I think the focus is more on the skateboard and the guy riding it.  I do like the greenish sepia filter. 7</td>', 'This has good movement and for stop action, is very focused.  Although this has shoes in it, I think the focus is more on the skateboard and the guy riding it.  I do like the greenish sepia filter. 7', '2005-09-03 15:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671339, 224368, 15711, '<td valign="top">I agree with the political statement this makes but it seems a tad busy. I wonder if shooting it from down on the ground would have been a tad more effective than shooting down. I like the slight desat of the colors. 7</td>', 'I agree with the political statement this makes but it seems a tad busy. I wonder if shooting it from down on the ground would have been a tad more effective than shooting down. I like the slight desat of the colors. 7', '2005-09-03 15:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671342, 224913, 36616, '<td valign="top">The centre of the break appears to be under her sole rather than the heel. Hope this was supposed to be a shot on an unbroken mirror which could have been awesome. The fractured one introduces too many distractions for me.</td>', 'The centre of the break appears to be under her sole rather than the heel. Hope this was supposed to be a shot on an unbroken mirror which could have been awesome. The fractured one introduces too many distractions for me.', '2005-09-03 15:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671345, 224645, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. I love the detailing of the hands. The use of black and white is perfect to showcase all of the texture in the shoe and hands. Upon 2nd review, I''m upping my score.</td>', 'This is interesting. I love the detailing of the hands. The use of black and white is perfect to showcase all of the texture in the shoe and hands. Upon 2nd review, I''m upping my score.', '2005-09-03 15:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1671346, 224520, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is cool how they seem to be walking without anybody in them. I like the long shadows of the late day light. The filter adds a nostalgic sense to them. I like this more upon second review. 8</td>', 'This is cool how they seem to be walking without anybody in them. I like the long shadows of the late day light. The filter adds a nostalgic sense to them. I like this more upon second review. 8', '2005-09-03 15:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
