(1672185, 222470, 41675, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think photos work better when the main object of the photo is not directly in the center of a shot. A good, solid photo of a well worn shoe.</td>', 'Personally, I think photos work better when the main object of the photo is not directly in the center of a shot. A good, solid photo of a well worn shoe.', '2005-09-03 23:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
