(1672758, 224990, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>The straight down angle for the boots isn''t the greatest. I would have tried a much lower angle, and made use of shallow DOF also. This one is just too plain.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 The straight down angle for the boots isn''t the greatest. I would have tried a much lower angle, and made use of shallow DOF also. This one is just too plain.', '2005-09-04 11:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
