(1672767, 225022, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Compositioin: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 2/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 2/2<br/> <br/>Really nice use of DOF. I especially like the out-of-focus shoe in the background to add depth and character. Nice desat/sepia conversion.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Compositioin: 2/2Photo Quality: 2/2My Subjective Affinity: 2/2 Really nice use of DOF. I especially like the out-of-focus shoe in the background to add depth and character. Nice desat/sepia conversion.', '2005-09-04 11:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672768, 224647, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2', '2005-09-04 11:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672770, 224238, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjecytive Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>There is no apparent detail in the photo. The lighting is very flat and dull, and the background color is also too dull. I would''ve tried maybe getting close to one or two of them, at a lower angle, and used the rest with limited DOF to add more character to the photo. Also, get rid of the border.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjecytive Affinity: 0/2 There is no apparent detail in the photo. The lighting is very flat and dull, and the background color is also too dull. I would''ve tried maybe getting close to one or two of them, at a lower angle, and used the rest with limited DOF to add more character to the photo. Also, get rid of the border.', '2005-09-04 11:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672772, 223137, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 1/2<br/>Composition: 2/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>This is a great photo of some boots. Very soft feeling. But it needs some brighter white somewhere in the photo. Otherwise it just looks too plain and dull.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 1/2Composition: 2/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 This is a great photo of some boots. Very soft feeling. But it needs some brighter white somewhere in the photo. Otherwise it just looks too plain and dull.', '2005-09-04 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672774, 224749, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2<br/> <br/>I like the idea here, but maybe a little bit more shallow DOF would have better served this composition.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Color/Contrast: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2 I like the idea here, but maybe a little bit more shallow DOF would have better served this composition.', '2005-09-04 11:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
