(1672808, 223382, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the sparkle on the toe, but there is too much haze around the pearls.</td>', 'I like the sparkle on the toe, but there is too much haze around the pearls.', '2005-09-04 12:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672813, 224437, 15497, '<td valign="top">Very funny shot! 10<br/></td>', 'Very funny shot! 10', '2005-09-04 12:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672831, 223993, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is so clever and original.  I love it!  My only minor complaint (and yes, I know it''s because of DOF) is that the top shoe isn''t as in focus as the other two are - they''re so crisp.  Perfect crop and color/lighting.  Really a brilliant shot.</td>', 'This is so clever and original.  I love it!  My only minor complaint (and yes, I know it''s because of DOF) is that the top shoe isn''t as in focus as the other two are - they''re so crisp.  Perfect crop and color/lighting.  Really a brilliant shot.', '2005-09-04 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672833, 223209, 34659, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition, color, lighting, focus - I even like the border.  Great job!</td>', 'Perfect composition, color, lighting, focus - I even like the border.  Great job!', '2005-09-04 12:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672835, 224611, 34659, '<td valign="top">LOL - This is really good.  Great focus, lighting, and tones.  Composition is also excellent.  I feel for the poor pooch - how many shots did it take to get this one?!?  Great expression too.  Top notch shot.</td>', 'LOL - This is really good.  Great focus, lighting, and tones.  Composition is also excellent.  I feel for the poor pooch - how many shots did it take to get this one?!?  Great expression too.  Top notch shot.', '2005-09-04 12:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672836, 224810, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines and composition.  I like the tones too.  At first I didn''t like the DOF and the fact that the front of the shoes weren''t crisply in focus, but it''s grown on me and now I think it wouldn''t look right any other way.  Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful lines and composition.  I like the tones too.  At first I didn''t like the DOF and the fact that the front of the shoes weren''t crisply in focus, but it''s grown on me and now I think it wouldn''t look right any other way.  Great job!', '2005-09-04 12:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672839, 222725, 34659, '<td valign="top">This shot is so crisp, I feel like I could reach out and touch the shoes.  Great natural color and good lighting.  Good composition too.  A+  :-)</td>', 'This shot is so crisp, I feel like I could reach out and touch the shoes.  Great natural color and good lighting.  Good composition too.  A+  :-)', '2005-09-04 12:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672840, 225025, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is certainly reminiscent of one particular photographer''s style on here - and this is just as brilliant as his work consistently is.  Great job - 10.</td>', 'This is certainly reminiscent of one particular photographer''s style on here - and this is just as brilliant as his work consistently is.  Great job - 10.', '2005-09-04 12:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672843, 223834, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is one of those shots that takes a little study to fully appreciate.  I love the antique tones and feel.  Great focus &amp; DOF (albeit not the normal type that you see here).  This shot works so well - I''m instantly transported to another place and time - and I feel like I''m right there smelling the breeze off the water.  Hauntingly powerful shot.  Kudos...</td>', 'This is one of those shots that takes a little study to fully appreciate.  I love the antique tones and feel.  Great focus & DOF (albeit not the normal type that you see here).  This shot works so well - I''m instantly transported to another place and time - and I feel like I''m right there smelling the breeze off the water.  Hauntingly powerful shot.  Kudos...', '2005-09-04 12:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672846, 224916, 20056, '<td valign="top">I guess flas was necessary... but it is a little distracting</td>', 'I guess flas was necessary... but it is a little distracting', '2005-09-04 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672847, 223831, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Fantastic focus and really, happy appealing colors.  I think the border works well too.  Great job.</td>', 'Great shot.  Fantastic focus and really, happy appealing colors.  I think the border works well too.  Great job.', '2005-09-04 12:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672850, 223380, 34659, '<td valign="top">This shot is soo good.  Perfect crop &amp; composition.  The blown out highlights on the right aren''t even a distraction (although the title is a bit long).  By far, the best horseshoe shot (and one of the best shots in the challenge).</td>', 'This shot is soo good.  Perfect crop & composition.  The blown out highlights on the right aren''t even a distraction (although the title is a bit long).  By far, the best horseshoe shot (and one of the best shots in the challenge).', '2005-09-04 12:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672856, 224253, 34659, '<td valign="top">LOVE this shot!  My only minor criticism is that her hair and arms look oversharpened against the black backdrop - also the background doesn''t look uniform in color/texture.  Still, GREAT pose, composition, crop, colors.  Superior job.</td>', 'LOVE this shot!  My only minor criticism is that her hair and arms look oversharpened against the black backdrop - also the background doesn''t look uniform in color/texture.  Still, GREAT pose, composition, crop, colors.  Superior job.', '2005-09-04 12:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672862, 224839, 34659, '<td valign="top">The fact that you got a bunny whose fur is almost exactly the same hue as the suede makes this shot.  The pink background works really well too.  Outstanding job.</td>', 'The fact that you got a bunny whose fur is almost exactly the same hue as the suede makes this shot.  The pink background works really well too.  Outstanding job.', '2005-09-04 12:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672863, 224760, 22379, '<td valign="top">for a silhoueete to be sucessful, the object in shadow needs to have a crisp sharp outline. The shutter speed needed to be faster in this photo to get that steady outline, rather than this little touch of motion.<br/>If this had been advance editting, the little orange streak would have to have been cloed out - because you weren''t allowed to clone, i wonder - was it something flying through the sky? Could you have waited for it to pass and then make another attempt? I really like the sky gradient.</td>', 'for a silhoueete to be sucessful, the object in shadow needs to have a crisp sharp outline. The shutter speed needed to be faster in this photo to get that steady outline, rather than this little touch of motion.If this had been advance editting, the little orange streak would have to have been cloed out - because you weren''t allowed to clone, i wonder - was it something flying through the sky? Could you have waited for it to pass and then make another attempt? I really like the sky gradient.', '2005-09-04 12:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672864, 224918, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is so fun - great job.  Love the colors and composition - the crop is perfect.  The focus could be a bit sharper and there''s a glare on the right wall, but otherwise it''s perfect.</td>', 'This is so fun - great job.  Love the colors and composition - the crop is perfect.  The focus could be a bit sharper and there''s a glare on the right wall, but otherwise it''s perfect.', '2005-09-04 12:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672865, 222938, 34659, '<td valign="top">Now that''s some DOF for you...  Fantastic shot - love the perspective.  Amazing detail in the foreground too.  Great job.</td>', 'Now that''s some DOF for you...  Fantastic shot - love the perspective.  Amazing detail in the foreground too.  Great job.', '2005-09-04 12:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672867, 224772, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love the processing on this one.  The composition/crop is quite good too.  Very appealing photo.</td>', 'Love the processing on this one.  The composition/crop is quite good too.  Very appealing photo.', '2005-09-04 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672868, 224288, 22379, '<td valign="top">I like the way you posed the shoe with the flowing laces. <br/>If you are going to use a thin bed sheet as a backdrop, it is important that you iron out the creases in to to achieve an even backdrop.  The backlighting is interesting, but you have not made this image a silhouette, thus there needed to be a light to counterbalance in the front. Right now the viewer is aware that details exist, but cannot quite grasp them.</td>', 'I like the way you posed the shoe with the flowing laces. If you are going to use a thin bed sheet as a backdrop, it is important that you iron out the creases in to to achieve an even backdrop.  The backlighting is interesting, but you have not made this image a silhouette, thus there needed to be a light to counterbalance in the front. Right now the viewer is aware that details exist, but cannot quite grasp them.', '2005-09-04 12:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672870, 224219, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm tones in this shot.  Great composition too.  (I even like the border)  The yellows and oranges in the (cedar?) wood almost overpower the colors and focus of the boots though.  Still - very appealing image.</td>', 'Beautiful warm tones in this shot.  Great composition too.  (I even like the border)  The yellows and oranges in the (cedar?) wood almost overpower the colors and focus of the boots though.  Still - very appealing image.', '2005-09-04 12:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672871, 224852, 34659, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot!  Perfect composition/crop and I like the border.  The colors are great too.  The only very slight criticism is the lighting here.  It doesn''t seem quite right for the high key feel this image has - too dark in the shadows and too light in the highlights (make sense?).  Granted, that is small potatos compared to the overall impression of the shot - it''s really a great capture!</td>', 'GREAT shot!  Perfect composition/crop and I like the border.  The colors are great too.  The only very slight criticism is the lighting here.  It doesn''t seem quite right for the high key feel this image has - too dark in the shadows and too light in the highlights (make sense?).  Granted, that is small potatos compared to the overall impression of the shot - it''s really a great capture!', '2005-09-04 12:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672872, 223245, 22379, '<td valign="top">For future referance, your white balance is off in this photo. On your camra white balance will be marked as WB on a button or menu option. For house lights it needs to be set to tungsten to disaperate this yellow tinge. <br/>As a static image, the focus should have been sharper.<br/>Also be aware of your background. If you had moved the shoes over just a little the image would have been spared that dark distracting crack leading into the wardrobe.</td>', 'For future referance, your white balance is off in this photo. On your camra white balance will be marked as WB on a button or menu option. For house lights it needs to be set to tungsten to disaperate this yellow tinge. As a static image, the focus should have been sharper.Also be aware of your background. If you had moved the shoes over just a little the image would have been spared that dark distracting crack leading into the wardrobe.', '2005-09-04 12:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672873, 224579, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great take on a classic pose.  Very cool shot - the lighting is a bit harsh, but otherwise very nice job.</td>', 'Great take on a classic pose.  Very cool shot - the lighting is a bit harsh, but otherwise very nice job.', '2005-09-04 12:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672874, 224325, 34659, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what is on those shoes, but they are certainly covered in it!  LOL  Great composition and terrific textures here.  The tones of the shot are really good too.  Very unique and strangely appealing image - good job!</td>', 'I have no idea what is on those shoes, but they are certainly covered in it!  LOL  Great composition and terrific textures here.  The tones of the shot are really good too.  Very unique and strangely appealing image - good job!', '2005-09-04 12:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672876, 224714, 22379, '<td valign="top">cool shoes, however composition is lacking in this photo. The stair, which blocks our view of the groom, is taking up a third of the image. The Brides skirt is bunched up with no apparent body for it to be connected to.  Having the couple step just a smidge to the right when taking this picture would have made a orld of difference.</td>', 'cool shoes, however composition is lacking in this photo. The stair, which blocks our view of the groom, is taking up a third of the image. The Brides skirt is bunched up with no apparent body for it to be connected to.  Having the couple step just a smidge to the right when taking this picture would have made a orld of difference.', '2005-09-04 12:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672877, 224921, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love this shot!  Beautiful tones and lines.  Good focus and crop too.  Very playful and emotive feel to this image.  Great job!</td>', 'Love this shot!  Beautiful tones and lines.  Good focus and crop too.  Very playful and emotive feel to this image.  Great job!', '2005-09-04 12:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672880, 223406, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones in this shot.  Good composition/crop - the focus is the only thing I see that''s ever so slightly "off".  Very nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful tones in this shot.  Good composition/crop - the focus is the only thing I see that''s ever so slightly "off".  Very nice work.', '2005-09-04 12:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672881, 224378, 22379, '<td valign="top">This image would have been far more appealing with bodies attached to the shoes. That and i''d really like to see someone attempt to play twister in heels or foorball shoes. The light is quite uneven and the angle the photo was taken serves as a distraction where the game mat breaks to become brown floor.</td>', 'This image would have been far more appealing with bodies attached to the shoes. That and i''d really like to see someone attempt to play twister in heels or foorball shoes. The light is quite uneven and the angle the photo was taken serves as a distraction where the game mat breaks to become brown floor.', '2005-09-04 12:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672882, 224333, 22379, '<td valign="top">While the shoe in the center tooks crisp and bright and wonderful, the other shoe is completely lost to shadows. There is so much ppotential here, try shuffling the lights around or using white surfaces to bounce the lifght off so the shadow doesnt take over. Be weary of wherte your frame ends in camera.</td>', 'While the shoe in the center tooks crisp and bright and wonderful, the other shoe is completely lost to shadows. There is so much ppotential here, try shuffling the lights around or using white surfaces to bounce the lifght off so the shadow doesnt take over. Be weary of wherte your frame ends in camera.', '2005-09-04 12:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672883, 224748, 22379, '<td valign="top">To me this feels very snapshoty. The red leaves are the pretiest part of the tree - be careful not to let the sky blow them out.</td>', 'To me this feels very snapshoty. The red leaves are the pretiest part of the tree - be careful not to let the sky blow them out.', '2005-09-04 12:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672887, 224951, 22379, '<td valign="top">Considering the camera was sitting right in your lap, this image should have been sharp as a tack, but the slippers are out of focus. Looking at our own feet has always been a fairly uninteresting thing to do.</td>', 'Considering the camera was sitting right in your lap, this image should have been sharp as a tack, but the slippers are out of focus. Looking at our own feet has always been a fairly uninteresting thing to do.', '2005-09-04 13:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672889, 224908, 22379, '<td valign="top">from this distance you can hardly tell they are shoes. This image needs something to make it pop.</td>', 'from this distance you can hardly tell they are shoes. This image needs something to make it pop.', '2005-09-04 13:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672890, 224986, 22379, '<td valign="top">It would be about the frames if they were more visable. Every time i view this image i have to hunt for the shoe because so much detail has been lost in the shadow. My eye is much more drawn to the shiny crome and the sky about the bike.</td>', 'It would be about the frames if they were more visable. Every time i view this image i have to hunt for the shoe because so much detail has been lost in the shadow. My eye is much more drawn to the shiny crome and the sky about the bike.', '2005-09-04 13:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672894, 224235, 22379, '<td valign="top">He may be walking, i am not sure - but there is camera shake as well. The whole image is blurry.</td>', 'He may be walking, i am not sure - but there is camera shake as well. The whole image is blurry.', '2005-09-04 13:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672900, 224472, 22379, '<td valign="top">The image should have been crisper for such a static set up. There are a few distractions that dont make sense in this image. The blue and white log sticking up out of i dont know where blocking the shoe behind it. A yellos womething  and a bigger green something in the back row.</td>', 'The image should have been crisper for such a static set up. There are a few distractions that dont make sense in this image. The blue and white log sticking up out of i dont know where blocking the shoe behind it. A yellos womething  and a bigger green something in the back row.', '2005-09-04 13:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672908, 223709, 22379, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this picture looks like it was taken start out of a family holiday photo alumb. Look Billy Bob, everythings Biger in Texas.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this picture looks like it was taken start out of a family holiday photo alumb. Look Billy Bob, everythings Biger in Texas.', '2005-09-04 13:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672931, 225057, 43280, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot; i really had to look at it to know what they were; very nice.</td>', 'I like this a lot; i really had to look at it to know what they were; very nice.', '2005-09-04 13:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672935, 224957, 32334, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  I love the humor.  There are two things I can think of that could improve it, see if you can get the shoe in focus (It might be beyond the capabilities of your camera), and see if you can get the shadow to line up with what the shadow of the shoe would be, have the shadow cast by a building or something instead of a tree?</td>', 'Great picture.  I love the humor.  There are two things I can think of that could improve it, see if you can get the shoe in focus (It might be beyond the capabilities of your camera), and see if you can get the shadow to line up with what the shadow of the shoe would be, have the shadow cast by a building or something instead of a tree?', '2005-09-04 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672937, 224912, 43280, '<td valign="top">I am not to keen on this competition; i don''t like shoes. With that said i love boots; and i love dogs. Very nice picture; i erally like it.</td>', 'I am not to keen on this competition; i don''t like shoes. With that said i love boots; and i love dogs. Very nice picture; i erally like it.', '2005-09-04 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672949, 224803, 32334, '<td valign="top">Those sure are some shiny shoes.  I like the angles that the outlines of the shoes make against the black background.<br/> <br/>An improvement that I can think of would be to either crop out or clone out the little bit of a skirt at the very top.</td>', 'Those sure are some shiny shoes.  I like the angles that the outlines of the shoes make against the black background. An improvement that I can think of would be to either crop out or clone out the little bit of a skirt at the very top.', '2005-09-04 13:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672953, 224769, 32334, '<td valign="top">I like the implied geometry of this picture, how the top left corner has some lines that point at the sandals, and how the shadows from the sandles point to the sandals in the bottom left and bottom right.</td>', 'I like the implied geometry of this picture, how the top left corner has some lines that point at the sandals, and how the shadows from the sandles point to the sandals in the bottom left and bottom right.', '2005-09-04 14:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672957, 223396, 32334, '<td valign="top">Good landscape, but it feels like the shoe is just placed in the picture.  Maybe if you had shown the shoe being used to climb up the mountain?</td>', 'Good landscape, but it feels like the shoe is just placed in the picture.  Maybe if you had shown the shoe being used to climb up the mountain?', '2005-09-04 14:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672958, 224988, 22379, '<td valign="top">whenever you have a model change from one tight article to another (in this case shoes) you must always wait until the indentations and lines from the preveious garment have disappeared before shooting in another garment. This angle is not flattering for the model.</td>', 'whenever you have a model change from one tight article to another (in this case shoes) you must always wait until the indentations and lines from the preveious garment have disappeared before shooting in another garment. This angle is not flattering for the model.', '2005-09-04 14:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672968, 224614, 32334, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a lot of miles.  I like the arrangement.</td>', 'Wow, that is a lot of miles.  I like the arrangement.', '2005-09-04 14:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672973, 224917, 37961, '<td valign="top">Great focus and metal tones. Love the positioning of the shoes. Cool!</td>', 'Great focus and metal tones. Love the positioning of the shoes. Cool!', '2005-09-04 14:13:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1672974, 224219, 37961, '<td valign="top">Great hues/tones and focus. This could be a Cabelas ad. Great job.</td>', 'Great hues/tones and focus. This could be a Cabelas ad. Great job.', '2005-09-04 14:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672975, 222938, 32334, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field and the tread pattern on the bottom.</td>', 'I like the depth of field and the tread pattern on the bottom.', '2005-09-04 14:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672978, 223996, 32334, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the background, but the wire down the right shoe is a little distracting.  Overall a good picture though.</td>', 'I like the colors and the background, but the wire down the right shoe is a little distracting.  Overall a good picture though.', '2005-09-04 14:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1672987, 223999, 32334, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view used in this picture, very original.  Maybe if more of the left shoe was in highlight to balance out the right shoe it would be a little better?</td>', 'I like the point of view used in this picture, very original.  Maybe if more of the left shoe was in highlight to balance out the right shoe it would be a little better?', '2005-09-04 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673010, 224339, 32334, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this image.  I like how the raindrops look like stars in this picture.  The picture looks kinda blurry to me.  Don''t know if there was some camera shake or if the original picture was small, or if the focus was off.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this image.  I like how the raindrops look like stars in this picture.  The picture looks kinda blurry to me.  Don''t know if there was some camera shake or if the original picture was small, or if the focus was off.', '2005-09-04 14:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673016, 223261, 32334, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this picture, and the shape of the background, however I think its just a little too high key.  If it was just a little darker overall, I think it would have been a better picture.<br/> <br/>Also the focus doesn''t look real sharp on the shoe itself, not sure if that''s just because of the texture of the shoe or the brightness of the picture or what.</td>', 'I like the colors in this picture, and the shape of the background, however I think its just a little too high key.  If it was just a little darker overall, I think it would have been a better picture. Also the focus doesn''t look real sharp on the shoe itself, not sure if that''s just because of the texture of the shoe or the brightness of the picture or what.', '2005-09-04 14:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673022, 225050, 32334, '<td valign="top">What a great way to show something invisible.  I like how the right shoe is pointing to the corner of the picture, rather than just having both shoes pointing straight at the camera.  Maybe if the green lines looked more like they are spreading out from the shoes it would be a little better.</td>', 'What a great way to show something invisible.  I like how the right shoe is pointing to the corner of the picture, rather than just having both shoes pointing straight at the camera.  Maybe if the green lines looked more like they are spreading out from the shoes it would be a little better.', '2005-09-04 15:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673030, 224420, 36199, '<td valign="top">This should be the winner for me, it stands out from the rest, it is very creative with a good pose, good colour a brilliant shot.</td>', 'This should be the winner for me, it stands out from the rest, it is very creative with a good pose, good colour a brilliant shot.', '2005-09-04 15:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673032, 224926, 36199, '<td valign="top">i like the rendering of the image, gives a modern art feel well done</td>', 'i like the rendering of the image, gives a modern art feel well done', '2005-09-04 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673035, 224611, 43006, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and great photo</td>', 'Nice idea and great photo', '2005-09-04 15:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673038, 224255, 16636, '<td valign="top">well created image, good luck</td>', 'well created image, good luck', '2005-09-04 15:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673046, 224934, 16636, '<td valign="top">not sure about the background, but nicely exposed image</td>', 'not sure about the background, but nicely exposed image', '2005-09-04 15:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673047, 223631, 41802, '<td valign="top">I love the blue.</td>', 'I love the blue.', '2005-09-04 15:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673050, 223152, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow awesome shot. The background is wonderful.</td>', 'Wow awesome shot. The background is wonderful.', '2005-09-04 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673051, 223996, 41802, '<td valign="top">I love this one! Very different.</td>', 'I love this one! Very different.', '2005-09-04 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673053, 224520, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great image</td>', 'Great image', '2005-09-04 15:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673055, 225000, 41802, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting.</td>', 'I love the lighting.', '2005-09-04 15:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673058, 225003, 42837, '<td valign="top">The composition works well for a sports shot, but it''s a line of footballers if we''re honest and not a lins of shoes. Doesn''t fit the brief. Could have changed your viewpoint slightly by getting down and just catching the ''line of shoes'' you mention in the frame, and nothing else.</td>', 'The composition works well for a sports shot, but it''s a line of footballers if we''re honest and not a lins of shoes. Doesn''t fit the brief. Could have changed your viewpoint slightly by getting down and just catching the ''line of shoes'' you mention in the frame, and nothing else.', '2005-09-04 15:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673060, 224255, 20850, '<td valign="top">nice....8</td>', 'nice....8', '2005-09-04 15:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673061, 223153, 41802, '<td valign="top">I think you will do great! This is an awesome photo.  Very few could find a shot so appropriate for the contest.<br/></td>', 'I think you will do great! This is an awesome photo.  Very few could find a shot so appropriate for the contest.', '2005-09-04 15:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673063, 224811, 41802, '<td valign="top">What a great shoe!!</td>', 'What a great shoe!!', '2005-09-04 15:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673065, 224179, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great angle, lighting and color.</td>', 'Great angle, lighting and color.', '2005-09-04 15:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673072, 223025, 16636, '<td valign="top">excellent original image for this challenge, hope this does well for you</td>', 'excellent original image for this challenge, hope this does well for you', '2005-09-04 15:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673077, 225041, 42837, '<td valign="top">Not the most inspired shot considering the possibliities available with these shoes. At a ballet class or something actually capturing them mid-pose, like standing up on their toes would have been a stronger image.</td>', 'Not the most inspired shot considering the possibliities available with these shoes. At a ballet class or something actually capturing them mid-pose, like standing up on their toes would have been a stronger image.', '2005-09-04 15:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673085, 225067, 42837, '<td valign="top">Very witty, and original take on the theme,  however the nitty gritty technical aspects of the photography let this down. My eyes were finding it difficult to focus on anything here, and perhaps a wide-angle approach could have married the 2 elements and strengthened the illusion they''re in the same plane.</td>', 'Very witty, and original take on the theme,  however the nitty gritty technical aspects of the photography let this down. My eyes were finding it difficult to focus on anything here, and perhaps a wide-angle approach could have married the 2 elements and strengthened the illusion they''re in the same plane.', '2005-09-04 15:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673091, 223741, 32334, '<td valign="top">Classic pose for this picture.  I like how the white background really contrasts with the womans shoes.<br/> <br/>I am torn though, I think I would like the picture a little better if the mans pants had more definition, so you could see that he has two legs, but, on the other hand, it isn''t an important point in the image, so it might just force more attention on a part of the picture that isn''t the true focus.</td>', 'Classic pose for this picture.  I like how the white background really contrasts with the womans shoes. I am torn though, I think I would like the picture a little better if the mans pants had more definition, so you could see that he has two legs, but, on the other hand, it isn''t an important point in the image, so it might just force more attention on a part of the picture that isn''t the true focus.', '2005-09-04 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673092, 225069, 42837, '<td valign="top">A cute and well taken pet pic [he(she)''s adorable btw], but the shoe seems very much secondary to the focus which is the dog. A different set up with the tattered shoe in the foreground as focal point with the dog behind looking all innocence and ''butter wouldn''t melt...'' would be much more effective in suiting this contest theme.</td>', 'A cute and well taken pet pic [he(she)''s adorable btw], but the shoe seems very much secondary to the focus which is the dog. A different set up with the tattered shoe in the foreground as focal point with the dog behind looking all innocence and ''butter wouldn''t melt...'' would be much more effective in suiting this contest theme.', '2005-09-04 15:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673097, 224966, 32334, '<td valign="top">This would be a great advertisement shot.  The red in the background helps the picture quite a bit.  However I am not sure about the jewelry in the near shoe.  I can understand the desire to break up the long expanse of black in the front, but I think the jewelry might be too detailed, maybe a simple chain would have been better?</td>', 'This would be a great advertisement shot.  The red in the background helps the picture quite a bit.  However I am not sure about the jewelry in the near shoe.  I can understand the desire to break up the long expanse of black in the front, but I think the jewelry might be too detailed, maybe a simple chain would have been better?', '2005-09-04 15:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673101, 224906, 42837, '<td valign="top">Without the title the shot doesn''t make itself clear. The concept seems a bit uninspired and just looks like an oddly cropped pic of a teddy bear lying on an untidy trainer. Perhaps you intended a ''cute'' image but it just seems messy, and unplanned.</td>', 'Without the title the shot doesn''t make itself clear. The concept seems a bit uninspired and just looks like an oddly cropped pic of a teddy bear lying on an untidy trainer. Perhaps you intended a ''cute'' image but it just seems messy, and unplanned.', '2005-09-04 15:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673103, 223969, 42837, '<td valign="top">The composition is pleasing, however the focus is not. Whenever there''s writing included as part of the subject in a picture, it''s aggravating when it''s not sharp. All in all an  uninspiriing shot, sorry!</td>', 'The composition is pleasing, however the focus is not. Whenever there''s writing included as part of the subject in a picture, it''s aggravating when it''s not sharp. All in all an  uninspiriing shot, sorry!', '2005-09-04 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673107, 224219, 42837, '<td valign="top">This is another of those odd shots in this challenge where the photographer has antropomorphisized their shoes, Are those boots just after chopping that wood? You get me? Should have left the boots on the person chopping the wood.</td>', 'This is another of those odd shots in this challenge where the photographer has antropomorphisized their shoes, Are those boots just after chopping that wood? You get me? Should have left the boots on the person chopping the wood.', '2005-09-04 15:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673109, 223999, 22379, '<td valign="top">The idea was fun, but this image is incredibly over exposed. The shadows are not complimentary and the highlights are completely blown out. Try focusing the camera on a brighter stop so details are not lost to the sunlight.</td>', 'The idea was fun, but this image is incredibly over exposed. The shadows are not complimentary and the highlights are completely blown out. Try focusing the camera on a brighter stop so details are not lost to the sunlight.', '2005-09-04 15:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673113, 224909, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of these 2 elements together. The execution could be a lot better however. Take the focus, use the writing on the side of the boot as a guide. and the composition has a few distracting and superfluous elements like the leaves in the bottom left, and the picture top right.</td>', 'I like the idea of these 2 elements together. The execution could be a lot better however. Take the focus, use the writing on the side of the boot as a guide. and the composition has a few distracting and superfluous elements like the leaves in the bottom left, and the picture top right.', '2005-09-04 15:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673114, 223323, 30791, '<td valign="top">one of the better shoe pictures in this challenge, gosh ive given out about 300 1''s<br/> <br/>here you get a 10</td>', 'one of the better shoe pictures in this challenge, gosh ive given out about 300 1''s here you get a 10', '2005-09-04 15:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673123, 225053, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 1/2', '2005-09-04 16:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673124, 224681, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good composition and depth of field. I like the way you used the colour to pick out that particular pair. I''m curious how you managed to do this in basic editing.</td>', 'Good composition and depth of field. I like the way you used the colour to pick out that particular pair. I''m curious how you managed to do this in basic editing.', '2005-09-04 16:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
