(1673177, 224450, 31403, '<td valign="top">everything about this photo tells my eye to look in the room, past your main subject.  The light and saturated vase pull my eye right in.  If that was your intent, excellent job, but it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'everything about this photo tells my eye to look in the room, past your main subject.  The light and saturated vase pull my eye right in.  If that was your intent, excellent job, but it doesn''t work for me.', '2005-09-04 16:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
