(1673179, 224724, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the image even if the title seems odd. A lower viewpoint which includes the other foot would have done wonders for the composition and made the use of DOF even stronger than it is. Has a lot of potential. 5</td>', 'I like the image even if the title seems odd. A lower viewpoint which includes the other foot would have done wonders for the composition and made the use of DOF even stronger than it is. Has a lot of potential. 5', '2005-09-04 16:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673182, 223153, 31403, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot!  Take the "ones" out of the title for my preference, but it might just make it different, not necessarily better.  Excellent photo, did he pose, or is it candid? 7</td>', 'I like this a lot!  Take the "ones" out of the title for my preference, but it might just make it different, not necessarily better.  Excellent photo, did he pose, or is it candid? 7', '2005-09-04 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673183, 223413, 42837, '<td valign="top">It''s not obvious whether the footprint, the flipflop, or the wave is meant to be the focal point of the shot. Lose the footprint and sharpen focus on the shoe and it would work much better.</td>', 'It''s not obvious whether the footprint, the flipflop, or the wave is meant to be the focal point of the shot. Lose the footprint and sharpen focus on the shoe and it would work much better.', '2005-09-04 16:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673186, 224827, 42005, '<td valign="top">Suggesting only one leg?</td>', 'Suggesting only one leg?', '2005-09-04 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673189, 224555, 42837, '<td valign="top">Good textur caught well by the focus, but the composition doesn''t take advantage of the stripes. With such a close shot a more abstract composition  may be more effective... perhaps even closer.</td>', 'Good textur caught well by the focus, but the composition doesn''t take advantage of the stripes. With such a close shot a more abstract composition  may be more effective... perhaps even closer.', '2005-09-04 16:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673190, 222902, 42005, '<td valign="top">Whatever the shoes are standing on really adds to the picture. 7</td>', 'Whatever the shoes are standing on really adds to the picture. 7', '2005-09-04 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673193, 224342, 31403, '<td valign="top">lots of visual noise here - the background being in focus takes attention away from the subject, and the weeds/hay the boots are resting on gives my eye all kinds of lines to explore taking my eye away from your subject.  I would recommend cropping right down to the boots, and holding a sheet in front of the sun to soften the light and shadows.  Hope that helps. 3</td>', 'lots of visual noise here - the background being in focus takes attention away from the subject, and the weeds/hay the boots are resting on gives my eye all kinds of lines to explore taking my eye away from your subject.  I would recommend cropping right down to the boots, and holding a sheet in front of the sun to soften the light and shadows.  Hope that helps. 3', '2005-09-04 16:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673194, 224999, 42005, '<td valign="top">Hmmm..Evokes a disaster....beyond fatigue. Emotional. 9</td>', 'Hmmm..Evokes a disaster....beyond fatigue. Emotional. 9', '2005-09-04 16:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673199, 224908, 42005, '<td valign="top">Clever</td>', 'Clever', '2005-09-04 16:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673204, 225000, 41669, '<td valign="top">nice moment catpured here.</td>', 'nice moment catpured here.', '2005-09-04 16:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673205, 225048, 42837, '<td valign="top">The idea is superb, and has lots of potential. I love the double vision effect created. But... the fact that nothing in the image makes sense without the title brings it down in my estimation. The tight close up loses any potential for setting a scene as it were. Could have really played on the drunk theme more by taking the shot in a bar with neon beer lights in the background, pulling the viewpoint back from the shoe a bit so it''s still the dominant subject even though it''s out of focus. And maybe rotate the image 90º to play on the fact that the viewer is drunk, and resolve the odd positioning created by such a low down viewpoint.</td>', 'The idea is superb, and has lots of potential. I love the double vision effect created. But... the fact that nothing in the image makes sense without the title brings it down in my estimation. The tight close up loses any potential for setting a scene as it were. Could have really played on the drunk theme more by taking the shot in a bar with neon beer lights in the background, pulling the viewpoint back from the shoe a bit so it''s still the dominant subject even though it''s out of focus. And maybe rotate the image 90º to play on the fact that the viewer is drunk, and resolve the odd positioning created by such a low down viewpoint.', '2005-09-04 16:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673207, 224714, 41669, '<td valign="top">crazy shoes.</td>', 'crazy shoes.', '2005-09-04 16:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673208, 224628, 41669, '<td valign="top">very orginal placement.</td>', 'very orginal placement.', '2005-09-04 16:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673210, 224459, 42837, '<td valign="top">At least there''s a foot in this shoe, unlike some of the other examples on this theme with shoes hiking up mountains by themselves. The focus on the shoe could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'At least there''s a foot in this shoe, unlike some of the other examples on this theme with shoes hiking up mountains by themselves. The focus on the shoe could be a bit sharper.', '2005-09-04 16:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
