(1673287, 224955, 42837, '<td valign="top">A beautiful textural shot, well lit giving a good contrast which accentuates the form nicely and really picking out the footprints. The compositon could be stronger (slightly) by coming in tighter to the further footprints and giving a tiny bit more space between the closer pair and the viewer, although I feel I''m nitpicking with that point. My biggest problem is that your idea although very well executed, could be just a little too far "outside the box". There''s a fine line between that and missing the point; ie: not fulfilling the brief. 5</td>', 'A beautiful textural shot, well lit giving a good contrast which accentuates the form nicely and really picking out the footprints. The compositon could be stronger (slightly) by coming in tighter to the further footprints and giving a tiny bit more space between the closer pair and the viewer, although I feel I''m nitpicking with that point. My biggest problem is that your idea although very well executed, could be just a little too far "outside the box". There''s a fine line between that and missing the point; ie: not fulfilling the brief. 5', '2005-09-04 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673300, 224883, 41669, '<td valign="top">good score for the color/composition, not the peeking nipple. fyi</td>', 'good score for the color/composition, not the peeking nipple. fyi', '2005-09-04 18:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673304, 222467, 41669, '<td valign="top">lovely, expressive, great colors--just not sharp enough for me.  The floor in the bottom left corner feels more in focus, perhaps that is because it is the destination? the goal of the shoe?  Would have loved sharper lines on at least parts of the shoe.</td>', 'lovely, expressive, great colors--just not sharp enough for me.  The floor in the bottom left corner feels more in focus, perhaps that is because it is the destination? the goal of the shoe?  Would have loved sharper lines on at least parts of the shoe.', '2005-09-04 18:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673305, 223240, 41669, '<td valign="top">great eye for texture.</td>', 'great eye for texture.', '2005-09-04 18:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673307, 224401, 42837, '<td valign="top">Another bizarre shot ''humanisizing'' the shoes that only serves to make them look out of place. Shoes can''t climb trees, sorry! This just seems bizarre for the sake of being bizarre and the subject just doesn''t suit it. Next time just put the shoes on someone and show them actually genuinely climbing the tree, instead of nailing some old shoes to it. The shoes aren''t in focus either.</td>', 'Another bizarre shot ''humanisizing'' the shoes that only serves to make them look out of place. Shoes can''t climb trees, sorry! This just seems bizarre for the sake of being bizarre and the subject just doesn''t suit it. Next time just put the shoes on someone and show them actually genuinely climbing the tree, instead of nailing some old shoes to it. The shoes aren''t in focus either.', '2005-09-04 18:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673313, 224920, 42837, '<td valign="top">The leather curtain takes away from the subject here. Less is more, and just the shoes and freckle of the title would have been stronger on their own.  The composition would be vastly improved by moving the shoes further left and rtemoving the superfluous empty space there. It''s a classic ''snapshoit type'' mistake to place the subject bang in the center. Considering the title I would have liked to see more effort to make the freckle the focus of the shot. Closing the aperture down a 1/2 a stop or so could have made the form of the feet stand out more and seem less flat.</td>', 'The leather curtain takes away from the subject here. Less is more, and just the shoes and freckle of the title would have been stronger on their own.  The composition would be vastly improved by moving the shoes further left and rtemoving the superfluous empty space there. It''s a classic ''snapshoit type'' mistake to place the subject bang in the center. Considering the title I would have liked to see more effort to make the freckle the focus of the shot. Closing the aperture down a 1/2 a stop or so could have made the form of the feet stand out more and seem less flat.', '2005-09-04 18:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673321, 224888, 42837, '<td valign="top">The title is off-putting since the boots are unoccupied and unlikely to do any walking. They''re also cloaked in darkness with the exception of some obvious hotspots while the patchy grass proceeding them is bathed in light.</td>', 'The title is off-putting since the boots are unoccupied and unlikely to do any walking. They''re also cloaked in darkness with the exception of some obvious hotspots while the patchy grass proceeding them is bathed in light.', '2005-09-04 18:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673325, 224650, 42837, '<td valign="top">Make up your mind about the title, and then use a suitable subject. These shoes are only ever so slightly scuffed, the stitching is all perfectly intact, and there''s no holes. This approach with such a close shot  and use of narrow DOF could have been pulled off if you were picking out something like a hole in a battered old pair of trainers or something.</td>', 'Make up your mind about the title, and then use a suitable subject. These shoes are only ever so slightly scuffed, the stitching is all perfectly intact, and there''s no holes. This approach with such a close shot  and use of narrow DOF could have been pulled off if you were picking out something like a hole in a battered old pair of trainers or something.', '2005-09-04 18:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673326, 223993, 42837, '<td valign="top">Was this entered twice because I''ve already commented on this one</td>', 'Was this entered twice because I''ve already commented on this one', '2005-09-04 18:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673340, 223745, 42837, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot and isn''t telling me anything about the "distant shoe" or the "near shoe", and why the crop in the closest shoe? Just seems like an exercise in use of DOF (which incidentally was done well).</td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot and isn''t telling me anything about the "distant shoe" or the "near shoe", and why the crop in the closest shoe? Just seems like an exercise in use of DOF (which incidentally was done well).', '2005-09-04 18:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673345, 222292, 42837, '<td valign="top">Not a pretty foot, and I fail to see the relevance of the title. It looks like the shoes fit. The cross dressing theme hasn''t been used anywhere near it''s potential. The possibilities for farce have been completely passed up for this fairly uninspiring picture.</td>', 'Not a pretty foot, and I fail to see the relevance of the title. It looks like the shoes fit. The cross dressing theme hasn''t been used anywhere near it''s potential. The possibilities for farce have been completely passed up for this fairly uninspiring picture.', '2005-09-04 18:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673346, 225024, 42005, '<td valign="top">Very very emotional for me.  Wonderful ...evocative.  But they look like vases, not boots upon second glance.</td>', 'Very very emotional for me.  Wonderful ...evocative.  But they look like vases, not boots upon second glance.', '2005-09-04 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673348, 224670, 42005, '<td valign="top">After looking at all of the pictures, I am reassessing...enioy it.  But no tenis show I every had came through it that white.</td>', 'After looking at all of the pictures, I am reassessing...enioy it.  But no tenis show I every had came through it that white.', '2005-09-04 18:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673351, 224622, 42005, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Warm. Yet to be worn it appears.</td>', 'Lovely. Warm. Yet to be worn it appears.', '2005-09-04 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673355, 224588, 42837, '<td valign="top">A very strong image with great potential. It seems like the viewer isn''t square on to the window, and is looking up at it. If the shot had been taken straight on, and the top had been cropped to remove the distracting roof details and the bottom cropped to even out the border this would have made the window the canvas and the silhouette would have been even stronger.  5</td>', 'A very strong image with great potential. It seems like the viewer isn''t square on to the window, and is looking up at it. If the shot had been taken straight on, and the top had been cropped to remove the distracting roof details and the bottom cropped to even out the border this would have made the window the canvas and the silhouette would have been even stronger.  5', '2005-09-04 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673360, 223998, 42837, '<td valign="top">The shot''s far too busy and the boots are fighting for position with too many other elements. Could be arranged better.</td>', 'The shot''s far too busy and the boots are fighting for position with too many other elements. Could be arranged better.', '2005-09-04 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673364, 223121, 42837, '<td valign="top">NIce composition although without the title the image doesn''t make sense. The focus seems to be more on the clouds than the shoes.</td>', 'NIce composition although without the title the image doesn''t make sense. The focus seems to be more on the clouds than the shoes.', '2005-09-04 18:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673368, 224672, 255, '<td valign="top">ah, my first ever style of vans, circa 6th grade. :) i don''t have the checkerboards anymore, but vans are still my favorite shoes. thanks for the memories. :)</td>', 'ah, my first ever style of vans, circa 6th grade. :) i don''t have the checkerboards anymore, but vans are still my favorite shoes. thanks for the memories. :)', '2005-09-04 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673370, 223025, 255, '<td valign="top">this is just awesome--love the lighting, the composition, and the stark simplicity of the shot. i hope this ribbons.</td>', 'this is just awesome--love the lighting, the composition, and the stark simplicity of the shot. i hope this ribbons.', '2005-09-04 19:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673372, 224253, 42837, '<td valign="top">Seems more like a pic of Suzie Wong than her boots. Even as a portrait of Suzie rather than her boots the hair in her eyes is annoying, and there''s a lot of empty space above her serving no discernible purpose. You could have made this fit the challenge by using less, like maybe just the boots and the tattoo. Less is more.</td>', 'Seems more like a pic of Suzie Wong than her boots. Even as a portrait of Suzie rather than her boots the hair in her eyes is annoying, and there''s a lot of empty space above her serving no discernible purpose. You could have made this fit the challenge by using less, like maybe just the boots and the tattoo. Less is more.', '2005-09-04 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673383, 223834, 255, '<td valign="top">i love this. has a great feel to it, almost ghostly. great idea and well done.</td>', 'i love this. has a great feel to it, almost ghostly. great idea and well done.', '2005-09-04 19:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673409, 224975, 42837, '<td valign="top">The effects are unnecessary and distracting from the textures which are suppossed to be the subject of the shot. The composition also seems awkward. Why is there one shoe facing the opposite way?</td>', 'The effects are unnecessary and distracting from the textures which are suppossed to be the subject of the shot. The composition also seems awkward. Why is there one shoe facing the opposite way?', '2005-09-04 19:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673415, 225046, 42837, '<td valign="top">Composition would be stronger if the shoes were seperated slightly. At first glance it just looks like one shoe.  Also a small point but, they look more like: ''resting away from the bike'' than ''dying to ride''. Wouldn''t they be clipped into the pedals? Nice use of depth of field to pick out the subjects.</td>', 'Composition would be stronger if the shoes were seperated slightly. At first glance it just looks like one shoe.  Also a small point but, they look more like: ''resting away from the bike'' than ''dying to ride''. Wouldn''t they be clipped into the pedals? Nice use of depth of field to pick out the subjects.', '2005-09-04 19:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673427, 224008, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great concept and the sepia effect works a treat</td>', 'Great concept and the sepia effect works a treat', '2005-09-04 19:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673433, 223654, 16636, '<td valign="top">I like this image and the way you have used the backlighting. Not sure about the positioning of the shoes though? Maybe the right hand one needs to be fully in the frame and pointed in slightly. Godd Luck</td>', 'I like this image and the way you have used the backlighting. Not sure about the positioning of the shoes though? Maybe the right hand one needs to be fully in the frame and pointed in slightly. Godd Luck', '2005-09-04 19:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673434, 224179, 16636, '<td valign="top">nicely lit and composed</td>', 'nicely lit and composed', '2005-09-04 19:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673435, 223266, 16636, '<td valign="top">excellent use of soft light</td>', 'excellent use of soft light', '2005-09-04 19:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673436, 224008, 16636, '<td valign="top">well thought out and composed</td>', 'well thought out and composed', '2005-09-04 19:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673438, 223101, 16636, '<td valign="top">excellent image and good composition</td>', 'excellent image and good composition', '2005-09-04 19:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673440, 222822, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I think the image itself has ended up too cluttered and tgherefore confusing.</td>', 'Good idea.  I think the image itself has ended up too cluttered and tgherefore confusing.', '2005-09-04 19:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673441, 223976, 41802, '<td valign="top">Love the image.</td>', 'Love the image.', '2005-09-04 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673444, 222425, 42984, '<td valign="top">Now this had possibilities but sort of doesn''t quite make it due to a couple of small but important things.  1) The whites of the foreground shoe are blown  2) the background detracts from the shot due to it being unessesary clutter - 4</td>', 'Now this had possibilities but sort of doesn''t quite make it due to a couple of small but important things.  1) The whites of the foreground shoe are blown  2) the background detracts from the shot due to it being unessesary clutter - 4', '2005-09-04 19:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673447, 224175, 41802, '<td valign="top">Love how the shoes grow in the emptyness.  I am sure you ment to make the biggest shoes laces black I would have liked them white (just me though)</td>', 'Love how the shoes grow in the emptyness.  I am sure you ment to make the biggest shoes laces black I would have liked them white (just me though)', '2005-09-04 19:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673448, 224908, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Must have taken serious effort, good shot!</td>', 'Great idea.  Must have taken serious effort, good shot!', '2005-09-04 19:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673449, 224922, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-09-04 19:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673452, 224276, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cute, the colors work well together.</td>', 'Cute, the colors work well together.', '2005-09-04 19:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673453, 224611, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the coloring is very nice.</td>', 'Great idea, the coloring is very nice.', '2005-09-04 19:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673457, 224670, 42984, '<td valign="top">White-on-white works brilliantly here.  Its not easy to do.  If the theory about composition (see tutorial) is true, then the shoes in the right hand corner would be more powerful - and maybe worth an extra point, who knows - 7</td>', 'White-on-white works brilliantly here.  Its not easy to do.  If the theory about composition (see tutorial) is true, then the shoes in the right hand corner would be more powerful - and maybe worth an extra point, who knows - 7', '2005-09-04 19:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673458, 223741, 41802, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Great coloring and contrast.</td>', 'Lovely image.  Great coloring and contrast.', '2005-09-04 19:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673462, 224301, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice image, not sure about the yellow in contrast but good shot!</td>', 'Nice image, not sure about the yellow in contrast but good shot!', '2005-09-04 19:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
