(1673475, 222378, 42984, '<td valign="top">Nice colouration and toning!  You''ve lost some of the detail in the toe of the shoe wehich is not easy to get because of the colour of it.  It looks as if the sharpest point is just a little nearer the camera than the shoe''s toe? - 5</td>', 'Nice colouration and toning!  You''ve lost some of the detail in the toe of the shoe wehich is not easy to get because of the colour of it.  It looks as if the sharpest point is just a little nearer the camera than the shoe''s toe? - 5', '2005-09-04 20:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
