(1673647, 224887, 34857, '<td valign="top">Very nice. This is sorta what I was going for with my submission, but this minalmalistic (sp?) is much more effective. Good job!!! I am jealous. : )</td>', 'Very nice. This is sorta what I was going for with my submission, but this minalmalistic (sp?) is much more effective. Good job!!! I am jealous. : )', '2005-09-04 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
