(1673652, 225030, 34857, '<td valign="top">Very nice, subtle coloring. I wish I knew how to achieve such an effect. Nice nice.</td>', 'Very nice, subtle coloring. I wish I knew how to achieve such an effect. Nice nice.', '2005-09-04 21:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
