(1673890, 224891, 32334, '<td valign="top">Ahh man!  I hate it when this happens.<br/> <br/>I really like the angle you''ve chosen.  I am undecided about the background, if it was less busy it would help you focus on the gum and the shoe, but, the realness of the background helps make the shot seem more believable.<br/> <br/>Maybe if just the car on the right was gone?</td>', 'Ahh man!  I hate it when this happens. I really like the angle you''ve chosen.  I am undecided about the background, if it was less busy it would help you focus on the gum and the shoe, but, the realness of the background helps make the shot seem more believable. Maybe if just the car on the right was gone?', '2005-09-04 22:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
