(1673898, 223313, 32334, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.<br/> <br/>I like that you put the bright orange and blue shoes up close.</td>', 'Clever idea. I like that you put the bright orange and blue shoes up close.', '2005-09-04 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673904, 224518, 32334, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the log and the colors of the ground.<br/> <br/>I think I would have prefered the picture if you had been a little higher up, so both the boots were against the ground, instead of the top of the left boot against the sky.<br/> <br/>Those darn powerlines sure get in the way don''t they?<br/> <br/>Good picture overall though.</td>', 'I like the texture of the log and the colors of the ground. I think I would have prefered the picture if you had been a little higher up, so both the boots were against the ground, instead of the top of the left boot against the sky. Those darn powerlines sure get in the way don''t they? Good picture overall though.', '2005-09-04 22:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673910, 224186, 32334, '<td valign="top">What interesting shoes!<br/> <br/>I like the background color choice, the red really pops against the green background.  I am not sure about all the texture in the background though, I guess I would have prefered a solid green rather than the orange patterns in it.</td>', 'What interesting shoes! I like the background color choice, the red really pops against the green background.  I am not sure about all the texture in the background though, I guess I would have prefered a solid green rather than the orange patterns in it.', '2005-09-04 22:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673918, 223296, 32334, '<td valign="top">Good capture getting a pic of both birds playing with the laces.<br/> <br/>However, it looks a little grainy, and kinda hazy.  Plus it might have been better with a solid background vs the pattern.</td>', 'Good capture getting a pic of both birds playing with the laces. However, it looks a little grainy, and kinda hazy.  Plus it might have been better with a solid background vs the pattern.', '2005-09-04 22:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673920, 222814, 42837, '<td valign="top">There''s too much sky. Consider the rule of thirds when placing your horizon. DOF could be stronger by getting the trainers with a slightly sharper focus. Otherwise a good idea well done. I like how you lead the viewer from the shoes to the wader with their orientation, and the way you picked out just enough of the sunlight on the trainers and nothing else.  6<br/> <br/>A tiny point I noticed, was the lack of footprints between the 2. Can he fly? If so, cool! I''d pay to see that. :D</td>', 'There''s too much sky. Consider the rule of thirds when placing your horizon. DOF could be stronger by getting the trainers with a slightly sharper focus. Otherwise a good idea well done. I like how you lead the viewer from the shoes to the wader with their orientation, and the way you picked out just enough of the sunlight on the trainers and nothing else.  6 A tiny point I noticed, was the lack of footprints between the 2. Can he fly? If so, cool! I''d pay to see that. :D', '2005-09-04 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673922, 222902, 42837, '<td valign="top">A great textural study. Nice DOF.</td>', 'A great textural study. Nice DOF.', '2005-09-04 22:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673923, 225036, 32334, '<td valign="top">Hmm, what kind of dancer was she?  :)<br/> <br/>I like the blue/purple tint to the picture, and that the shoes are the brightest point, really draws your attention.<br/> <br/>However, I am not sure about the hair on the back.  Maybe if it was pulled back so you couldn''t see it?  The way it is looks more natural, but I think the line of her back would echo the angle of the back of her thigh, which would be cool.</td>', 'Hmm, what kind of dancer was she?  :) I like the blue/purple tint to the picture, and that the shoes are the brightest point, really draws your attention. However, I am not sure about the hair on the back.  Maybe if it was pulled back so you couldn''t see it?  The way it is looks more natural, but I think the line of her back would echo the angle of the back of her thigh, which would be cool.', '2005-09-04 22:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673926, 224255, 32334, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice angle on the shoes.  I like the blur of the background also.</td>', 'Wow, nice angle on the shoes.  I like the blur of the background also.', '2005-09-04 23:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
