(1673947, 224852, 42837, '<td valign="top">Well done mesmeraj, another excellent shot with those red shoes. Excellent use of negative space to accentuate the pose, and it (the pose) creates a very elegant shape too.  Brillant illustration of the idiom "less is more". The stark white also adds to the dream-like effect you would associate with a fantastical story like wizard of oz.</td>', 'Well done mesmeraj, another excellent shot with those red shoes. Excellent use of negative space to accentuate the pose, and it (the pose) creates a very elegant shape too.  Brillant illustration of the idiom "less is more". The stark white also adds to the dream-like effect you would associate with a fantastical story like wizard of oz.', '2005-09-04 23:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1673949, 224822, 33672, '<td valign="top">half cropped items in the background really take away from this.  Good idea.  perhaps moving the items or use of a DOF to blur them out would''ve helped.</td>', 'half cropped items in the background really take away from this.  Good idea.  perhaps moving the items or use of a DOF to blur them out would''ve helped.', '2005-09-04 23:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
