(1674007, 223519, 42837, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. I like the pose, but it makes me want to see (even a small indication of) how they''re hanging in mid-air. Is it sitting on a swing or a tyre hanging from a tree? If this is not possible then a plain background might have worked better, perhaps a complementary colour to the bright pink and make colour the whole theme. It''s also slightly underexposed losing the summery essence of the pink boots. Got potential.</td>', 'Cute picture. I like the pose, but it makes me want to see (even a small indication of) how they''re hanging in mid-air. Is it sitting on a swing or a tyre hanging from a tree? If this is not possible then a plain background might have worked better, perhaps a complementary colour to the bright pink and make colour the whole theme. It''s also slightly underexposed losing the summery essence of the pink boots. Got potential.', '2005-09-04 23:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674008, 222714, 34857, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract shot.  The one eye especially makes this one stand out.. Not bad at all.</td>', 'Nice abstract shot.  The one eye especially makes this one stand out.. Not bad at all.', '2005-09-04 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
