(1674027, 223643, 42837, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, very witty title, and suitable pose well caught. Unfortunately I won''t be marking this highly though since it loses relevance to the challenge once you discount the title.</td>', 'Hahaha, very witty title, and suitable pose well caught. Unfortunately I won''t be marking this highly though since it loses relevance to the challenge once you discount the title.', '2005-09-04 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
