(1674036, 224474, 34857, '<td valign="top">Very nice blending on colors on this one. Everything fits together nicely. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice blending on colors on this one. Everything fits together nicely. Good job.', '2005-09-04 23:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674037, 225004, 42837, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, good composition, and the diagonal really adds to the action in the shot.</td>', 'Nice DOF, good composition, and the diagonal really adds to the action in the shot.', '2005-09-04 23:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674040, 224811, 34857, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. It really does look like more of a painting then it does a photograph. Very impressed, this is the sort of thing that I try to achieve with my own shots.</td>', 'Simply beautiful. It really does look like more of a painting then it does a photograph. Very impressed, this is the sort of thing that I try to achieve with my own shots.', '2005-09-04 23:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674041, 222311, 42837, '<td valign="top">Looks like an accidental release of the shutter being so poorly composed and horribly out of focus. Sorry, but I fail to see what effect you were going for here.</td>', 'Looks like an accidental release of the shutter being so poorly composed and horribly out of focus. Sorry, but I fail to see what effect you were going for here.', '2005-09-04 23:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674055, 225001, 42837, '<td valign="top">The tilt is just because you can it seems, and would be better removed. And I''m not sure what your shot is trying to say, but after any games I play (minds out of the gutter please ppl!) I have a shower. But I don''t undress on the court/pitch or whatever that yellow line is indicating.</td>', 'The tilt is just because you can it seems, and would be better removed. And I''m not sure what your shot is trying to say, but after any games I play (minds out of the gutter please ppl!) I have a shower. But I don''t undress on the court/pitch or whatever that yellow line is indicating.', '2005-09-04 23:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674064, 222567, 42837, '<td valign="top">But they''re not legs, they''re shoes. Why didn''t you take a picture of some legs crossed wearing those shoes? It would have made more sense than a pair of floating shoes. The floral curtain is also fighting for too much attention and should be either plain, or further from the subject so it''s less in focus.</td>', 'But they''re not legs, they''re shoes. Why didn''t you take a picture of some legs crossed wearing those shoes? It would have made more sense than a pair of floating shoes. The floral curtain is also fighting for too much attention and should be either plain, or further from the subject so it''s less in focus.', '2005-09-04 23:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674071, 223340, 42837, '<td valign="top">The shoes should be sharper focused, and you could remove the wires and cables since this would pace the shoes up in a more comfortable position  Think rule of thirds. Nicely spotted and chosen image though.</td>', 'The shoes should be sharper focused, and you could remove the wires and cables since this would pace the shoes up in a more comfortable position  Think rule of thirds. Nicely spotted and chosen image though.', '2005-09-04 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674079, 224500, 42837, '<td valign="top">The focus on the shoes isn''t sharp enough and the telegraph pole is distracting. A portrait shot would have accentuated the space below the shoes. I''d also like to see the point on the wire where the laces and wire meet included in shot.</td>', 'The focus on the shoes isn''t sharp enough and the telegraph pole is distracting. A portrait shot would have accentuated the space below the shoes. I''d also like to see the point on the wire where the laces and wire meet included in shot.', '2005-09-05 00:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674093, 224913, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but feel it would make a lot more sense for the heel to be placed over the centre of the break on the mirror. You could have adjusted the lighting to remove the strange shadows on the feet and legs also.</td>', 'I like the idea, but feel it would make a lot more sense for the heel to be placed over the centre of the break on the mirror. You could have adjusted the lighting to remove the strange shadows on the feet and legs also.', '2005-09-05 00:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674134, 223493, 43653, '<td valign="top">With 462 photos to review this one just happened to get my attention, therefor it must have something that the others did not.</td>', 'With 462 photos to review this one just happened to get my attention, therefor it must have something that the others did not.', '2005-09-05 00:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674136, 222218, 42837, '<td valign="top">Looks too much like a snapshot I''m afraid. the sign is old and tatty, and it would have been better to use a new one. the composition and cropping is poor taking attention away from the shoes and making the socks jostle for more attention than they should, and letting the viewers eyes wander without any resolution. And the kitchen details in the top right serve no purpose.</td>', 'Looks too much like a snapshot I''m afraid. the sign is old and tatty, and it would have been better to use a new one. the composition and cropping is poor taking attention away from the shoes and making the socks jostle for more attention than they should, and letting the viewers eyes wander without any resolution. And the kitchen details in the top right serve no purpose.', '2005-09-05 00:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674149, 223299, 13026, '<td valign="top">Your model has nice arches!  Wish mine looked like that.  lol  : )<br/> <br/>Anyhoo, I like the b&amp;w here, and the OOF hand in the back definitely adds to this shot.</td>', 'Your model has nice arches!  Wish mine looked like that.  lol  : ) Anyhoo, I like the b&w here, and the OOF hand in the back definitely adds to this shot.', '2005-09-05 00:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
