(1674164, 224505, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed shot. You could have forced the camera to overexpose the shot maybe one fstop to bring the white back to the brillance that the camera has lost. Cameras will always make predominantly white compositions slightly underexposed. The background could have been all white to add to this ''clean'' effect, and I think you could have chosen a better title also, since ''pimp shoes'' they clearly are not.</td>', 'A nicely composed shot. You could have forced the camera to overexpose the shot maybe one fstop to bring the white back to the brillance that the camera has lost. Cameras will always make predominantly white compositions slightly underexposed. The background could have been all white to add to this ''clean'' effect, and I think you could have chosen a better title also, since ''pimp shoes'' they clearly are not.', '2005-09-05 00:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674172, 224910, 42837, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m looking at a tv with the wrong aspect ratio setting here, and it''s uncomfortable. If this was resolved I would really like this study. Its a good composition and use of the line of the sole.</td>', 'I feel like I''m looking at a tv with the wrong aspect ratio setting here, and it''s uncomfortable. If this was resolved I would really like this study. Its a good composition and use of the line of the sole.', '2005-09-05 00:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674214, 224909, 31403, '<td valign="top">the bubbles are such a great addition to this!  I have issues with the texture in the floor, and the frame on the wall, but the bubbles are such a cool surprise overall I just love it, 7</td>', 'the bubbles are such a great addition to this!  I have issues with the texture in the floor, and the frame on the wall, but the bubbles are such a cool surprise overall I just love it, 7', '2005-09-05 00:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674224, 223316, 31403, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this except those green bars!  They are very unfortunate, but a great idea and love the colors, angle, and composition for the most part. 5</td>', 'I love everything about this except those green bars!  They are very unfortunate, but a great idea and love the colors, angle, and composition for the most part. 5', '2005-09-05 00:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674225, 224978, 42837, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and brillant use of DOF, but I feel a fisheye lens would have been the correct lens to achieve this shots full potential, since the image is a little too reliant on the title for it''s strength.  8</td>', 'Great idea, and brillant use of DOF, but I feel a fisheye lens would have been the correct lens to achieve this shots full potential, since the image is a little too reliant on the title for it''s strength.  8', '2005-09-05 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674246, 222596, 31403, '<td valign="top">I guess that satin thing is the shoe?  Push those whites all the way to white and you''ve got a much stronger photo</td>', 'I guess that satin thing is the shoe?  Push those whites all the way to white and you''ve got a much stronger photo', '2005-09-05 00:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674250, 224990, 42837, '<td valign="top">A more original approach, maybe trying to say something to us about those particular boots, would be better. composition-wise, the space above the boots is uneven, and you could maybe have included more (if not all) of therir shadows since the low angle of sunlight is dominant in the picture.</td>', 'A more original approach, maybe trying to say something to us about those particular boots, would be better. composition-wise, the space above the boots is uneven, and you could maybe have included more (if not all) of therir shadows since the low angle of sunlight is dominant in the picture.', '2005-09-05 00:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674256, 223916, 42837, '<td valign="top">A plaster on the heel of the foot would have been a simple and easy way to make the point you were trying to make.</td>', 'A plaster on the heel of the foot would have been a simple and easy way to make the point you were trying to make.', '2005-09-05 00:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674262, 223631, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is a terrific concept!  So close to excellent.  If you could have worked it a little more so the chain link wasn''t there, just the court, maybe a hint of net, and this great selective desat I''d give you the 10.  The visual distraction is too much to overcome in this photo though.  Great concept though!  Excellent vision.</td>', 'this is a terrific concept!  So close to excellent.  If you could have worked it a little more so the chain link wasn''t there, just the court, maybe a hint of net, and this great selective desat I''d give you the 10.  The visual distraction is too much to overcome in this photo though.  Great concept though!  Excellent vision.', '2005-09-05 00:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674284, 225050, 31403, '<td valign="top">pretty cool take on the challenge - lighter colored shoes would be better I think?  great idea</td>', 'pretty cool take on the challenge - lighter colored shoes would be better I think?  great idea', '2005-09-05 00:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674295, 224378, 42837, '<td valign="top">Another of those houses where the shoes are coming to life, it''s already down to a 3. Sorry!  It''s also poorly lit, and the choice of footwear is just bizarre. A nicely lit close up shot of some kids feet while actually placing twister would have been much much better, and the card with the pointer showing pictures of feet could have been incorporated to add to the farcical nature of the game. Perhaps showing the ''just about to collapse'' moment while everyone struggles to try and get their left foot on the same yellow spot for example. 2</td>', 'Another of those houses where the shoes are coming to life, it''s already down to a 3. Sorry!  It''s also poorly lit, and the choice of footwear is just bizarre. A nicely lit close up shot of some kids feet while actually placing twister would have been much much better, and the card with the pointer showing pictures of feet could have been incorporated to add to the farcical nature of the game. Perhaps showing the ''just about to collapse'' moment while everyone struggles to try and get their left foot on the same yellow spot for example. 2', '2005-09-05 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1674306, 224588, 31403, '<td valign="top">the black border takes the energy right out of this for me.  The silo on the blue glass blocks would be very cool, with little to no border IMO.  Cool idea though,</td>', 'the black border takes the energy right out of this for me.  The silo on the blue glass blocks would be very cool, with little to no border IMO.  Cool idea though,', '2005-09-05 00:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
