(1674329, 225073, 42837, '<td valign="top">A nice study of the hands, but the protractor (or whatever it''s called) is dominating the focus of the image. A different angle where the classic horseshoe shape is dominating the shot would have been more suitable to this particular challenge.</td>', 'A nice study of the hands, but the protractor (or whatever it''s called) is dominating the focus of the image. A different angle where the classic horseshoe shape is dominating the shot would have been more suitable to this particular challenge.', '2005-09-05 00:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
