(1675378, 223316, 39833, '<td valign="top">dunno... the challenge call is for shoes... I think this shot is a bit out of topic. It would be more interesting if the left foot were not cut. 4</td>', 'dunno... the challenge call is for shoes... I think this shot is a bit out of topic. It would be more interesting if the left foot were not cut. 4', '2005-09-05 10:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675487, 223802, 12311, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  This would work better here if you''d use the full size available to you (640 pixels on a side).  I still like the image, though.</td>', 'Nice idea.  This would work better here if you''d use the full size available to you (640 pixels on a side).  I still like the image, though.', '2005-09-05 11:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675496, 223296, 12311, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2005-09-05 11:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675497, 225036, 12311, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... shoes? what shoes??</td>', 'Hmmm... shoes? what shoes??', '2005-09-05 11:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675657, 224390, 37844, '<td valign="top">I feel this photo is better than the other horse photos because your photo is drawing attention directly to the subject of the shoes whereas the others were just implied . You may not have known what the other photos were about if it hadn''t been for their title.</td>', 'I feel this photo is better than the other horse photos because your photo is drawing attention directly to the subject of the shoes whereas the others were just implied . You may not have known what the other photos were about if it hadn''t been for their title.', '2005-09-05 12:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675666, 223361, 37844, '<td valign="top">This photo would have been more effective if the cat was rubbing on the shoes doiing something to interact with them.  He looks a little bored like this wasn''t his idea.</td>', 'This photo would have been more effective if the cat was rubbing on the shoes doiing something to interact with them.  He looks a little bored like this wasn''t his idea.', '2005-09-05 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675687, 224914, 37844, '<td valign="top">This idea is cute,  I would have liked to have seen the same scene with more colorful items, then I would have recognized the shoes as being a child''s more easily . As it is, the dog could be huge  and so could the shoes, the only thing that says they are a child''s is the title.<br/>Really good composition.</td>', 'This idea is cute,  I would have liked to have seen the same scene with more colorful items, then I would have recognized the shoes as being a child''s more easily . As it is, the dog could be huge  and so could the shoes, the only thing that says they are a child''s is the title.Really good composition.', '2005-09-05 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675750, 225069, 37844, '<td valign="top">Great expression, he looks like he is in so much trouble.  The background isn''t  adding anything to the photo, but that is minimal. 10</td>', 'Great expression, he looks like he is in so much trouble.  The background isn''t  adding anything to the photo, but that is minimal. 10', '2005-09-05 12:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675755, 224611, 37844, '<td valign="top">Only one of his boots is muddy, looks like he stepped in something. Cute concept, but I would rather have seen "shoes"  for this challenge  although these are technically the same thing</td>', 'Only one of his boots is muddy, looks like he stepped in something. Cute concept, but I would rather have seen "shoes"  for this challenge  although these are technically the same thing', '2005-09-05 12:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675761, 223783, 43682, '<td valign="top">well loved.....with a life of their own</td>', 'well loved.....with a life of their own', '2005-09-05 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675766, 224499, 37844, '<td valign="top">Sweet kitten. It''s very tough to see the shoes in this photo and basically it turned out to be a kitten photo instead of a "shoes" photo, maybe work on the lighting, or get a lighter pair of shoes would help.</td>', 'Sweet kitten. It''s very tough to see the shoes in this photo and basically it turned out to be a kitten photo instead of a "shoes" photo, maybe work on the lighting, or get a lighter pair of shoes would help.', '2005-09-05 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675781, 223296, 37844, '<td valign="top">Background is not lending anything to photo and the photo  appears pretty grainy, could be the ISO of your film. If you don''t know about ISO PM me and I will try to help. The capture is terrific! Cute birds.</td>', 'Background is not lending anything to photo and the photo  appears pretty grainy, could be the ISO of your film. If you don''t know about ISO PM me and I will try to help. The capture is terrific! Cute birds.', '2005-09-05 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675805, 224869, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 1/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity:  1/2</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 1/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity:  1/2', '2005-09-05 12:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675813, 224912, 37844, '<td valign="top">Such a soleful expression. He looks more like he''s been punished than guarding.  Not crazy about the background .</td>', 'Such a soleful expression. He looks more like he''s been punished than guarding.  Not crazy about the background .', '2005-09-05 13:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675818, 225014, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 0/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 0/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>This is too much of a snapshot. I would have chosen a different background , used more than the on camera flash to even out the lighting and eliminate the harsh background shadow from the leg, and probably remove the leg all together, and just have the two pair of shoes instead. Then you can focus more on technical lighting and placement of the shoes.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 2/2Contrast/Color: 0/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 0/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 This is too much of a snapshot. I would have chosen a different background , used more than the on camera flash to even out the lighting and eliminate the harsh background shadow from the leg, and probably remove the leg all together, and just have the two pair of shoes instead. Then you can focus more on technical lighting and placement of the shoes.', '2005-09-05 13:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675822, 223831, 37844, '<td valign="top">Composition is great. This could make a good photo for advertisement use.  Good job.</td>', 'Composition is great. This could make a good photo for advertisement use.  Good job.', '2005-09-05 13:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675835, 225036, 37844, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting or color in  this,  it''s not adding anything to draw attention to your subject .</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting or color in  this,  it''s not adding anything to draw attention to your subject .', '2005-09-05 13:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675856, 224852, 41087, '<td valign="top">Ewww get out of the 80''s</td>', 'Ewww get out of the 80''s', '2005-09-05 13:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675860, 223981, 37844, '<td valign="top">The composition and focus is not doing anything to help draw attention to your subject "shoes". First rule of photography is usually to  do something that draws attention to your subject, iyou generally use out of focus to draw attention away from objects that you don''t want noticed, so this ends up being a photo of "steps".</td>', 'The composition and focus is not doing anything to help draw attention to your subject "shoes". First rule of photography is usually to  do something that draws attention to your subject, iyou generally use out of focus to draw attention away from objects that you don''t want noticed, so this ends up being a photo of "steps".', '2005-09-05 13:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675862, 224887, 41087, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.. very simple but says a lot!</td>', 'Nice shot.. very simple but says a lot!', '2005-09-05 13:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1675991, 224450, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2<br/>Color/Contrast: 0/2<br/>Composition: 0/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/> <br/>Photo is too dark, with lack of contrast. Only focus point the the blue vase, and the shoe is barely visible. The setting appears to have been more of a snapshot that really thought out.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 0/2Color/Contrast: 0/2Composition: 0/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2 Photo is too dark, with lack of contrast. Only focus point the the blue vase, and the shoe is barely visible. The setting appears to have been more of a snapshot that really thought out.', '2005-09-05 13:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
