(1677338, 224868, 40797, '<td valign="top">What a neat paper shoe. It is so cool. I am not sure how I feel about it sitting in the grass with the flowers.  Yes I do, I like it. It adds intrest along with the edge of your yard looking down into another yard. Very refreshing image.</td>', 'What a neat paper shoe. It is so cool. I am not sure how I feel about it sitting in the grass with the flowers.  Yes I do, I like it. It adds intrest along with the edge of your yard looking down into another yard. Very refreshing image.', '2005-09-05 22:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
