(1677500, 223316, 7485, '<td valign="top">If the foot and the shoe print were intended to be the point, then you should have cropped in on just that. It took me quite a while to get this because of all the other distracting elements.</td>', 'If the foot and the shoe print were intended to be the point, then you should have cropped in on just that. It took me quite a while to get this because of all the other distracting elements.', '2005-09-05 23:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
