(1677518, 223971, 42403, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I wish the background were more in focus, though. I really like how the line of the shoe decends, giving the shot a more sorrowful feel. It fits well with the title.</td>', 'Nice shot. I wish the background were more in focus, though. I really like how the line of the shoe decends, giving the shot a more sorrowful feel. It fits well with the title.', '2005-09-05 23:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
