(1677626, 224769, 7485, '<td valign="top">8? If you say so... A slightly deeper DOF and slightly higher vantage point would have made the other sandals recognizable. But even then, making a row of sandals look sufficiently interesting is tricky.</td>', '8? If you say so... A slightly deeper DOF and slightly higher vantage point would have made the other sandals recognizable. But even then, making a row of sandals look sufficiently interesting is tricky.', '2005-09-06 00:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
