(1677643, 224668, 7485, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title "To be wear", some kind of a pun? But a worse problem is that there is no structure to the composition. The jumble is obviously your point, but there''s nothing to catch the eye. Also some of the whites are blown and the DOF is in that awkward stage of almost containing the whole scene, but not quite.</td>', 'I don''t get the title "To be wear", some kind of a pun? But a worse problem is that there is no structure to the composition. The jumble is obviously your point, but there''s nothing to catch the eye. Also some of the whites are blown and the DOF is in that awkward stage of almost containing the whole scene, but not quite.', '2005-09-06 00:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
