(1677692, 224998, 7485, '<td valign="top">Getting so tired of old shoe photos that I almost gave yours a 4 like the rest, but just realized this one is good! Something about the simplicity, composition, and quality of light makes this photo stand out amongst literally hundreds of unbelievably unimaginative photos - 8</td>', 'Getting so tired of old shoe photos that I almost gave yours a 4 like the rest, but just realized this one is good! Something about the simplicity, composition, and quality of light makes this photo stand out amongst literally hundreds of unbelievably unimaginative photos - 8', '2005-09-06 00:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
