(1677898, 224909, 42403, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I wish it were a bit more in focus, though, and a bit brighter. Also, I find the edge of the window rather distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot. I wish it were a bit more in focus, though, and a bit brighter. Also, I find the edge of the window rather distracting.', '2005-09-06 02:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
