(1677902, 225070, 42403, '<td valign="top">I wish this shot were less busy. I had to search for a while to find the snake, and the rest of the stuff seems totally irrelivent.</td>', 'I wish this shot were less busy. I had to search for a while to find the snake, and the rest of the stuff seems totally irrelivent.', '2005-09-06 02:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
