(1677977, 225030, 37844, '<td valign="top">Oh, yuk, yuk yuk, but stll, very good composition, lighting, and clarity.  The subject could almost be "bugs" here instead of shoes, except  the color of the shoes demands your attention.</td>', 'Oh, yuk, yuk yuk, but stll, very good composition, lighting, and clarity.  The subject could almost be "bugs" here instead of shoes, except  the color of the shoes demands your attention.', '2005-09-06 03:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
