(1677994, 224467, 37844, '<td valign="top">I think the fingers shouldn''t be in t he photo ( not good to chop them off as you have done either, they need to be in or out.) The flower is pretty but isn''t adding to the scene. i would have cropped the bottom half more and dropped the floor on the step for more drama.</td>', 'I think the fingers shouldn''t be in t he photo ( not good to chop them off as you have done either, they need to be in or out.) The flower is pretty but isn''t adding to the scene. i would have cropped the bottom half more and dropped the floor on the step for more drama.', '2005-09-06 03:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677996, 224748, 40341, '<td valign="top">not too sharp though</td>', 'not too sharp though', '2005-09-06 03:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1677998, 224684, 40341, '<td valign="top">bitjie dark...</td>', 'bitjie dark...', '2005-09-06 03:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678002, 225005, 37844, '<td valign="top">I think I would have called this contrast.  The composition is really good and overall it is a good fun photo. 9</td>', 'I think I would have called this contrast.  The composition is really good and overall it is a good fun photo. 9', '2005-09-06 03:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678003, 222966, 42837, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the texture of the metal is well done, however I''m not so keen on the choice of cropping, leaving the space on the right.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the texture of the metal is well done, however I''m not so keen on the choice of cropping, leaving the space on the right.', '2005-09-06 03:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678008, 224398, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea. Compositon is good, background works. Boots are very dark on my screen without detail.  Framed nicely.</td>', 'This is a cute idea. Compositon is good, background works. Boots are very dark on my screen without detail.  Framed nicely.', '2005-09-06 03:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678012, 224032, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Good capture. Interesting shot.', '2005-09-06 03:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678013, 224044, 42837, '<td valign="top">A shot with the camera following the rollerblades and keeps them sharp while blurring the background would have been much more suitable for expressing their personality. The crop is too tight also.</td>', 'A shot with the camera following the rollerblades and keeps them sharp while blurring the background would have been much more suitable for expressing their personality. The crop is too tight also.', '2005-09-06 03:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678014, 223407, 37844, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting you chose. Looks old fashion.</td>', 'I like the lighting you chose. Looks old fashion.', '2005-09-06 03:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678021, 223695, 42837, '<td valign="top">The composition and focus could move down and pick the shoes out better, maybe a shortter DOF. They''re taking a back seat here, especially considering the striking pose of the little girl.</td>', 'The composition and focus could move down and pick the shoes out better, maybe a shortter DOF. They''re taking a back seat here, especially considering the striking pose of the little girl.', '2005-09-06 03:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678023, 223058, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very old shoes , what yearii wonder.  I think the gun helps to add the era to the shoes, not sure about the gold bowl, is it a spit toon? Still compositon is nice.  Lighting is good.</td>', 'Very old shoes , what yearii wonder.  I think the gun helps to add the era to the shoes, not sure about the gold bowl, is it a spit toon? Still compositon is nice.  Lighting is good.', '2005-09-06 03:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678028, 223895, 42837, '<td valign="top">Too dark, and the horizon bang on centre could move.</td>', 'Too dark, and the horizon bang on centre could move.', '2005-09-06 03:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678035, 224293, 42837, '<td valign="top">The shots too busy, and the composition and focus both fails to pick out the boots as the main subject. Very dark too. Maybe a filler flash, or wait a bit for the sun to rise some more.</td>', 'The shots too busy, and the composition and focus both fails to pick out the boots as the main subject. Very dark too. Maybe a filler flash, or wait a bit for the sun to rise some more.', '2005-09-06 03:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678038, 222902, 33706, '<td valign="top">very interesting textures and colors.  I feel like this is nearly an abstract, as the "shoe" shape is pretty obscured with this framing.  I wonder if it would be a bit more interesting if more of the show were in the frame, and perhaps they were placed in their "natural setting"....   Good work!</td>', 'very interesting textures and colors.  I feel like this is nearly an abstract, as the "shoe" shape is pretty obscured with this framing.  I wonder if it would be a bit more interesting if more of the show were in the frame, and perhaps they were placed in their "natural setting"....   Good work!', '2005-09-06 03:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678040, 224879, 33706, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF use to focus on this interesting characteristic of this shoe.  Nice coloring as well.  Cheers!</td>', 'Nice DOF use to focus on this interesting characteristic of this shoe.  Nice coloring as well.  Cheers!', '2005-09-06 03:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678046, 224827, 33706, '<td valign="top">Good contrast and interesting shot.  The shoe theme here is understated, but i think that works quite well, as it reveals something about this person and their situation.</td>', 'Good contrast and interesting shot.  The shoe theme here is understated, but i think that works quite well, as it reveals something about this person and their situation.', '2005-09-06 03:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678047, 223303, 37844, '<td valign="top">I am sure it''s me, I just don''t see it.</td>', 'I am sure it''s me, I just don''t see it.', '2005-09-06 03:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678048, 224415, 42837, '<td valign="top">A football would be more appropriate for placing by your feet. You''d expect the basketball being dribbled, or held in your hands. The picture could have been turned away from the viewer, it distracts from the interaction between the shoes and ball I think. Despite these I like the composition created by the pose, and the perspective from the boards and fading light.</td>', 'A football would be more appropriate for placing by your feet. You''d expect the basketball being dribbled, or held in your hands. The picture could have been turned away from the viewer, it distracts from the interaction between the shoes and ball I think. Despite these I like the composition created by the pose, and the perspective from the boards and fading light.', '2005-09-06 03:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678052, 224393, 40444, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! The emotion, the lighting, everything!</td>', 'This is beautiful! The emotion, the lighting, everything!', '2005-09-06 03:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678053, 222622, 37844, '<td valign="top">This angle appears somewhat awkward . Color is excellent.</td>', 'This angle appears somewhat awkward . Color is excellent.', '2005-09-06 03:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678055, 222905, 37844, '<td valign="top">Although this is a nice photo, i don''t see it as drawing attention to your subject the shoes.</td>', 'Although this is a nice photo, i don''t see it as drawing attention to your subject the shoes.', '2005-09-06 03:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678059, 224943, 33706, '<td valign="top">Wow, great use of a high-key B/W to emphasize the wear pattern on these shoes.  Well executed!</td>', 'Wow, great use of a high-key B/W to emphasize the wear pattern on these shoes.  Well executed!', '2005-09-06 03:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678061, 223898, 37844, '<td valign="top">Decent shot. Not too much  attention drawn toward the title "traction" since the good leg is hoging all the lmelight.</td>', 'Decent shot. Not too much  attention drawn toward the title "traction" since the good leg is hoging all the lmelight.', '2005-09-06 03:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678063, 222528, 33706, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  I like how you managed to get the floor to fade into white as it goes back, highlighting these dark colored shoes, while making it not appear to much like a "studio stilllife".  Well done!</td>', 'Nice job!  I like how you managed to get the floor to fade into white as it goes back, highlighting these dark colored shoes, while making it not appear to much like a "studio stilllife".  Well done!', '2005-09-06 03:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678068, 224891, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Up close and personal. Only thing I see that I don''t care for is the car in the background . and the gum maybe stealing the show from the shoe.</td>', 'Good capture. Up close and personal. Only thing I see that I don''t care for is the car in the background . and the gum maybe stealing the show from the shoe.', '2005-09-06 03:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678073, 224852, 37844, '<td valign="top">Funny, this is the title my sister wanted me to use, but i was afraid not enough people would get it.  This photo reminds me of the legs on the witch from the movie  "Wizard of Oz. Is this what you were going for? One more thing, i think the shoes should be stepping into the frame instead of out of the frame.</td>', 'Funny, this is the title my sister wanted me to use, but i was afraid not enough people would get it.  This photo reminds me of the legs on the witch from the movie  "Wizard of Oz. Is this what you were going for? One more thing, i think the shoes should be stepping into the frame instead of out of the frame.', '2005-09-06 03:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678091, 223741, 37844, '<td valign="top">Seductive, i like the lighting  and composition.</td>', 'Seductive, i like the lighting  and composition.', '2005-09-06 03:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
