(1678626, 224735, 37844, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I would have centered this in the frame, it almost looks like they are standing on a box because of the darkness. Background lighting helps make the photo interesting.</td>', 'I don''t think I would have centered this in the frame, it almost looks like they are standing on a box because of the darkness. Background lighting helps make the photo interesting.', '2005-09-06 11:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678651, 224803, 37844, '<td valign="top">Nice shoes,  I like that you came in close on them but I think you got just a little too much leg becasue it pulls your eyes up and away from your main subject , the shoes. Try cropping it at the bottom of the calf and look how all your attention goes back to the shoes.</td>', 'Nice shoes,  I like that you came in close on them but I think you got just a little too much leg becasue it pulls your eyes up and away from your main subject , the shoes. Try cropping it at the bottom of the calf and look how all your attention goes back to the shoes.', '2005-09-06 11:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678670, 224918, 37844, '<td valign="top">Very trendy teenager. I believe if you had made your depth of field shallow to blur the background or moved them further away, then the texture on the background wouldn''t be so noticeable. The shoes were a good choice, the crop seems  a bit tight, but it was good that you got in close.</td>', 'Very trendy teenager. I believe if you had made your depth of field shallow to blur the background or moved them further away, then the texture on the background wouldn''t be so noticeable. The shoes were a good choice, the crop seems  a bit tight, but it was good that you got in close.', '2005-09-06 11:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
