(1678687, 224647, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is a good looking photo, but I don''t feel you brought enough attention to the subject "shoes" . Maybe if you had zoomed way in on the horses legs showing the texture of his hair and hoofs for interest this would have still made for an interesting photo and  brought more attention to your subject.</td>', 'This is a good looking photo, but I don''t feel you brought enough attention to the subject "shoes" . Maybe if you had zoomed way in on the horses legs showing the texture of his hair and hoofs for interest this would have still made for an interesting photo and  brought more attention to your subject.', '2005-09-06 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
