(1678694, 223316, 43380, '<td valign="top">great imagery.</td>', 'great imagery.', '2005-09-06 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678696, 224946, 37844, '<td valign="top">Well done. The angle you chose made the shoes the most important thing in the photo as it should be for this challenge.  I am wondering if you used a real person here or a bundle of clothes, the reason  I ask is because it looks like his knees are bent the wrong way. That doesn''t matter though , it is a very good shot.</td>', 'Well done. The angle you chose made the shoes the most important thing in the photo as it should be for this challenge.  I am wondering if you used a real person here or a bundle of clothes, the reason  I ask is because it looks like his knees are bent the wrong way. That doesn''t matter though , it is a very good shot.', '2005-09-06 11:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678697, 225024, 43380, '<td valign="top">interesting!</td>', 'interesting!', '2005-09-06 11:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678701, 224420, 36381, '<td valign="top">I love the play of light in this photo.</td>', 'I love the play of light in this photo.', '2005-09-06 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678710, 224815, 37844, '<td valign="top">Since the subject is shoes ( being something that we use to cover and protect our feet) I can''t say this meets the challenge . It would be like doing a challenge on " clothes" and everyone entering nude photos. Other than that it a decent photograph, but a lttle too tightly cropped.</td>', 'Since the subject is shoes ( being something that we use to cover and protect our feet) I can''t say this meets the challenge . It would be like doing a challenge on " clothes" and everyone entering nude photos. Other than that it a decent photograph, but a lttle too tightly cropped.', '2005-09-06 11:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678712, 224981, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good angle, good color,  composition good. You brought attention to your subject and left out stuff that didn''t need to be there. Good for you.</td>', 'Good angle, good color,  composition good. You brought attention to your subject and left out stuff that didn''t need to be there. Good for you.', '2005-09-06 11:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678717, 223101, 36981, '<td valign="top">Terrific image - I love it!</td>', 'Terrific image - I love it!', '2005-09-06 11:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678723, 222748, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think this benefit from a sharper focus and more interesting lighting.</td>', 'I think this benefit from a sharper focus and more interesting lighting.', '2005-09-06 11:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678725, 224831, 37844, '<td valign="top">The only improvement I think you could have done here is to get more hair in the photo, the bit that is showing seems a little distracting, but if it had been more and not as scraggly I think it would have added to the senuality of the photo. AAll details count. Still a very appealing shot with good color. 8</td>', 'The only improvement I think you could have done here is to get more hair in the photo, the bit that is showing seems a little distracting, but if it had been more and not as scraggly I think it would have added to the senuality of the photo. AAll details count. Still a very appealing shot with good color. 8', '2005-09-06 11:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678726, 223513, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think that this could benefit from more interesting lighting and a little adjustment to make the colors, particularly the greens of the grass, "pop" out a little.  It looks very flat as it is (along with the sole!)</td>', 'I think that this could benefit from more interesting lighting and a little adjustment to make the colors, particularly the greens of the grass, "pop" out a little.  It looks very flat as it is (along with the sole!)', '2005-09-06 11:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678730, 223137, 36981, '<td valign="top">Nice try.  I think that if you made the image larger, arranged more interesting lighting and up''d the contrast a bit it might have done better.</td>', 'Nice try.  I think that if you made the image larger, arranged more interesting lighting and up''d the contrast a bit it might have done better.', '2005-09-06 11:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678731, 225015, 36981, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit out of focus and a little bit flat.  You might want to try more interesting light next time.</td>', 'This seems a bit out of focus and a little bit flat.  You might want to try more interesting light next time.', '2005-09-06 11:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
