(1678738, 224918, 36981, '<td valign="top">Terrific colors &amp; composition; amusing idea.  Well done! 9</td>', 'Terrific colors & composition; amusing idea.  Well done! 9', '2005-09-06 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678741, 223360, 36981, '<td valign="top">This could have been fairly boring, but it works for me for some reason.  I''m not good enough to identify why, but I really like this.  Congrats! 9</td>', 'This could have been fairly boring, but it works for me for some reason.  I''m not good enough to identify why, but I really like this.  Congrats! 9', '2005-09-06 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678742, 224839, 36981, '<td valign="top">Great way to emphasize the softness, and the bunny is adorable.  Well done!</td>', 'Great way to emphasize the softness, and the bunny is adorable.  Well done!', '2005-09-06 11:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678743, 223745, 37844, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like you dropped your camera and it went off and took a picture on its own. Being mechanical, it has no heart in it and that''s what I get from this photo, You didn''t seem to put enough heart in it to get  anything really interesting.  The near subject  is leaving the frame which is generally not a good idea, only in special cases. I don''t know which shoe is considered the far shoe becasue there are two. The fact that the front shoes are leaving the scene to the left makes it look like the shoe on the right is there as an accident creating cluttered background. Don''t be discouraged, pick your subject next time and do things to bring attention to it, such as lighting, composition etc...</td>', 'This almost looks like you dropped your camera and it went off and took a picture on its own. Being mechanical, it has no heart in it and that''s what I get from this photo, You didn''t seem to put enough heart in it to get  anything really interesting.  The near subject  is leaving the frame which is generally not a good idea, only in special cases. I don''t know which shoe is considered the far shoe becasue there are two. The fact that the front shoes are leaving the scene to the left makes it look like the shoe on the right is there as an accident creating cluttered background. Don''t be discouraged, pick your subject next time and do things to bring attention to it, such as lighting, composition etc...', '2005-09-06 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678745, 224700, 36981, '<td valign="top">Very original!  THanks for making it more interesting than many of the images - it was nice to come across something different! 8</td>', 'Very original!  THanks for making it more interesting than many of the images - it was nice to come across something different! 8', '2005-09-06 11:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678750, 223101, 37844, '<td valign="top">The pose with the tennis shoes looks awkward and there is alittle too much background on the right, not crazy about the grungy background but I won''t hold that against you.</td>', 'The pose with the tennis shoes looks awkward and there is alittle too much background on the right, not crazy about the grungy background but I won''t hold that against you.', '2005-09-06 11:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678757, 224740, 37844, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the composition you chose here, it''s not enhancing your subject. Your title says moving earth, so I am guessing this might be a shovel? Without the title there isn''t anything here that tells you what this action is or makes your subject stand out.</td>', 'I don''t care for the composition you chose here, it''s not enhancing your subject. Your title says moving earth, so I am guessing this might be a shovel? Without the title there isn''t anything here that tells you what this action is or makes your subject stand out.', '2005-09-06 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678764, 223654, 37844, '<td valign="top">Good idea, would only change two small things, you cut one shoe off a bit tightly and the plant seems to be drawing undue attention to itself with the leaves that are facing down.</td>', 'Good idea, would only change two small things, you cut one shoe off a bit tightly and the plant seems to be drawing undue attention to itself with the leaves that are facing down.', '2005-09-06 11:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678776, 225039, 37844, '<td valign="top">Legs in the background are too much of a distraction and the other leg on the left should be all the way in or all the way out of the photo. Unnessary items clutter photos and draw attention away from your main subject. In addition, your horse isn''t wearing horse shoes, shoes being something used to cover and protect feet. This is basically a photo of a horses "foot". sorry to get technically, but if the shoe doesn''t fit......</td>', 'Legs in the background are too much of a distraction and the other leg on the left should be all the way in or all the way out of the photo. Unnessary items clutter photos and draw attention away from your main subject. In addition, your horse isn''t wearing horse shoes, shoes being something used to cover and protect feet. This is basically a photo of a horses "foot". sorry to get technically, but if the shoe doesn''t fit......', '2005-09-06 12:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678782, 224008, 43746, '<td valign="top">This one really stands out in the crowd!</td>', 'This one really stands out in the crowd!', '2005-09-06 12:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678785, 223519, 37844, '<td valign="top">The triangle shape you created between the legs causes it to look like a frame, drawing your eyes to the center of the photo where you find nothing but darkness and some sky.  I bellieve if you had pulled the legs in closer, perhaps crossing them at the angle, it would bring the attention back where it belongs. Good shoe choice by the way.</td>', 'The triangle shape you created between the legs causes it to look like a frame, drawing your eyes to the center of the photo where you find nothing but darkness and some sky.  I bellieve if you had pulled the legs in closer, perhaps crossing them at the angle, it would bring the attention back where it belongs. Good shoe choice by the way.', '2005-09-06 12:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678788, 224919, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is sweet. I don''t know that you needed the white soft frame, I believe they would ahve stood well on their own with the color you chose.</td>', 'This is sweet. I don''t know that you needed the white soft frame, I believe they would ahve stood well on their own with the color you chose.', '2005-09-06 12:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678806, 224235, 37844, '<td valign="top">Composition and angle are good, the blur would be also except that the background should be blurred more so than your subject. It''s hard to look at the shoes because the blur on the leg is really messing with my eyes. This would be more effective if the shoes were slightly more visible.To get the background to blur as if in motion you need to do what is called "panning" which is focusing on your subject and moving your lens smoothly along with your subject , causing it stay more in focus than the background.  I find this hard to do with the slow auto focus of digital cameras.</td>', 'Composition and angle are good, the blur would be also except that the background should be blurred more so than your subject. It''s hard to look at the shoes because the blur on the leg is really messing with my eyes. This would be more effective if the shoes were slightly more visible.To get the background to blur as if in motion you need to do what is called "panning" which is focusing on your subject and moving your lens smoothly along with your subject , causing it stay more in focus than the background.  I find this hard to do with the slow auto focus of digital cameras.', '2005-09-06 12:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678809, 224255, 38924, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like the perspective.  The skin above the sock is a bit distracting to me, though.</td>', 'Great shot, I like the perspective.  The skin above the sock is a bit distracting to me, though.', '2005-09-06 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678811, 224988, 37844, '<td valign="top">Everything works for me in this photo except the marks left by your model''s previous shoes (or ankle cuffs) and the spots on the top of one of the toenails.  I like the way you got in close  to the subject, i like the colors you  chose, even the butterfly doesn''t look out of place and the background, although it is busy, it is still working with the colors here, so overall, not bad .</td>', 'Everything works for me in this photo except the marks left by your model''s previous shoes (or ankle cuffs) and the spots on the top of one of the toenails.  I like the way you got in close  to the subject, i like the colors you  chose, even the butterfly doesn''t look out of place and the background, although it is busy, it is still working with the colors here, so overall, not bad .', '2005-09-06 12:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678813, 222838, 37844, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing very original here but never the less, I like it. The composition is good, other elements that don''t belong are not there and it''s all good.</td>', 'There''s nothing very original here but never the less, I like it. The composition is good, other elements that don''t belong are not there and it''s all good.', '2005-09-06 12:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
