(1678853, 223244, 37844, '<td valign="top">This is kinda abstract and cool. The composition is good, not centering the shoes was the way to go as you knew. No matter that there are others in challenge with similar concept, what matters is that this photo works.</td>', 'This is kinda abstract and cool. The composition is good, not centering the shoes was the way to go as you knew. No matter that there are others in challenge with similar concept, what matters is that this photo works.', '2005-09-06 12:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678856, 224500, 37844, '<td valign="top">I like the angle , the only thing i think would have really made an improvement is if you could have worked it in to get the actual point where the shoe strings met the wire. Have the pole in the background was a very nice touch.</td>', 'I like the angle , the only thing i think would have really made an improvement is if you could have worked it in to get the actual point where the shoe strings met the wire. Have the pole in the background was a very nice touch.', '2005-09-06 12:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678877, 224883, 37844, '<td valign="top">LOL, subject being shoes, you shouldn''t try to draw the attention away from them. I don''t like the chair as a background, having a nipple didn''t add to the subject. The shoes and socks would do well on their own or another idea would have been to have a small wooden chair, white or black background, show the nude model leaning far forward arms covering most of the important parts, hands under her chin, smile on her face and legs at the same angle.</td>', 'LOL, subject being shoes, you shouldn''t try to draw the attention away from them. I don''t like the chair as a background, having a nipple didn''t add to the subject. The shoes and socks would do well on their own or another idea would have been to have a small wooden chair, white or black background, show the nude model leaning far forward arms covering most of the important parts, hands under her chin, smile on her face and legs at the same angle.', '2005-09-06 12:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1678880, 224471, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is a very good photo, I could see Timberland using it in an advertisement, but I think a greater depth of field would improve it, so that more of the splashing water was in focus</td>', 'this is a very good photo, I could see Timberland using it in an advertisement, but I think a greater depth of field would improve it, so that more of the splashing water was in focus', '2005-09-06 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
