(1690706, 222938, 22937, '<td valign="top">This pair of shoes were new - but no, they weren''t bought solely with the shoe competition in mind :) I found them to have quite an interesting sole. My wife was asked to model for me. Ill have to say that its a good thing to use a model with almost similar size as the shoes - I didn''t. A pair of 35''s (US 5.5) is here seen standing in a pair of 43''s (US 9.5-10). <br/> <br/>I finally found a shot suitable for the competition - but a 5th place in your first submission, well I''m honored! Thanks again! <br/> <br/>Post processing:<br/>Crop<br/>Levels<br/>USM<br/>Neat Image<br/> <br/>//Ekenborg<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-09-13 16:09:31.</i></td>', 'This pair of shoes were new - but no, they weren''t bought solely with the shoe competition in mind :) I found them to have quite an interesting sole. My wife was asked to model for me. Ill have to say that its a good thing to use a model with almost similar size as the shoes - I didn''t. A pair of 35''s (US 5.5) is here seen standing in a pair of 43''s (US 9.5-10).  I finally found a shot suitable for the competition - but a 5th place in your first submission, well I''m honored! Thanks again!  Post processing:CropLevelsUSMNeat Image //Ekenborg', '2005-09-09 16:11:27.000000', '2005-09-13 17:09:31.000000', 0),
