(1691819, 223153, 34247, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a nice story behind the image, and that makes this quite special. I like the texturing here very much. There''s almost a symmetry to the subject''s pose, between upper and lower torso, and that''s very interesting to look at. Finally, there seems to be a bit of rags on the background, to the subject''s right hand side. My eyes kept straying to this point, and for a second I kept thinking it was another person peeking a view. Rather than being a distraction, I think this was also one of those subtle things that add to the image. Nice. Going on favorites...</td>', 'I think it''s a nice story behind the image, and that makes this quite special. I like the texturing here very much. There''s almost a symmetry to the subject''s pose, between upper and lower torso, and that''s very interesting to look at. Finally, there seems to be a bit of rags on the background, to the subject''s right hand side. My eyes kept straying to this point, and for a second I kept thinking it was another person peeking a view. Rather than being a distraction, I think this was also one of those subtle things that add to the image. Nice. Going on favorites...', '2005-09-10 00:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
