(1734906, 224841, 34659, '<td valign="top">This was your first challenge entry?  You should hold your head high my dear!  LOL  Although IMHO the backlighting is a bit overpowering, the composition is pretty good and I like the (albeit slightly washed out) tones.  The boots certainly convey a feeling of being well worn - a full life, so to speak.   And anytime you convey a feeling or emotion in a photograph (at least IMHO), then your shot is a success.  Nice work.</td>', 'This was your first challenge entry?  You should hold your head high my dear!  LOL  Although IMHO the backlighting is a bit overpowering, the composition is pretty good and I like the (albeit slightly washed out) tones.  The boots certainly convey a feeling of being well worn - a full life, so to speak.   And anytime you convey a feeling or emotion in a photograph (at least IMHO), then your shot is a success.  Nice work.', '2005-09-24 00:38:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1737180, 224645, 40579, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the encouraging comments<br/>As an new member i am able to learn new things and i am cautious that the entry should stand the challenge<br/> <br/>Thanks<br/>Anand</td>', 'Thanks for the encouraging commentsAs an new member i am able to learn new things and i am cautious that the entry should stand the challenge ThanksAnand', '2005-09-25 11:57:55.000000', NULL, 0),
