(1742656, 224219, 43115, '<td valign="top">A response to your response...<br/> <br/>I finally was able to put my finger on what bothered me about this picture.<br/> <br/>The boots are positioned in a manner such that they _should_ have feet and legs in them.  Like you caught the lumberjack mid-stride.  But there is no lumberjack, making me wonder if the lumberjack is a ghost or something.<br/> <br/>Instead, what you seem to be going for here is a "tools of the trade" type shot.  You''ve got the axe in a position of rest.  Why not mess the boots up a little, like they''ve just been taken off the lumberjack''s feet?  Muss the laces, pull out one of the tounges, maybe even knock one over on its side...<br/> <br/>The feeling of unrest that I just couldn''t put my finger on until now is that this shot looks TOO perfect... like the lumberjack was just vaporized by aliens or something.</td>', 'A response to your response... I finally was able to put my finger on what bothered me about this picture. The boots are positioned in a manner such that they _should_ have feet and legs in them.  Like you caught the lumberjack mid-stride.  But there is no lumberjack, making me wonder if the lumberjack is a ghost or something. Instead, what you seem to be going for here is a "tools of the trade" type shot.  You''ve got the axe in a position of rest.  Why not mess the boots up a little, like they''ve just been taken off the lumberjack''s feet?  Muss the laces, pull out one of the tounges, maybe even knock one over on its side... The feeling of unrest that I just couldn''t put my finger on until now is that this shot looks TOO perfect... like the lumberjack was just vaporized by aliens or something.', '2005-09-27 16:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1755817, 224177, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . .this is awesome!   I''m just now getting caught up from being on vacation for a while!   I love the baby blues in this.  I think it should have scored much higher!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Awwww. . .this is awesome!   I''m just now getting caught up from being on vacation for a while!   I love the baby blues in this.  I think it should have scored much higher! ', '2005-10-03 13:53:28.000000', NULL, 0),
