(1785164, 223831, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and action seen and felt in this shot. The model was captured perfectly - one bar foot in the vibrant, crisp inviting grass and the other raised as she runs free. Her hair is unbound too and it too bounces with freedom as she runs through the open fields leaving those confining and uncomfortable high heel shoes behind. Freedom to run, freedom to feel the cool and comforting grass beneath ones feet - FREE!</td>', 'I love the composition and action seen and felt in this shot. The model was captured perfectly - one bar foot in the vibrant, crisp inviting grass and the other raised as she runs free. Her hair is unbound too and it too bounces with freedom as she runs through the open fields leaving those confining and uncomfortable high heel shoes behind. Freedom to run, freedom to feel the cool and comforting grass beneath ones feet - FREE!', '2005-10-15 00:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1788043, 224253, 34659, '<td valign="top">This was WAAYYY underrated IMHO.  I scored it a 9 (and would again in a heartbeat!).  I think it is soo outrageously funky cool!  Keep up the good work!<br/> <br/>EDIT:  Looking forward to seeing more of your work!  Post some more pix!  :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-16 16:50:43.</i></td>', 'This was WAAYYY underrated IMHO.  I scored it a 9 (and would again in a heartbeat!).  I think it is soo outrageously funky cool!  Keep up the good work! EDIT:  Looking forward to seeing more of your work!  Post some more pix!  :-)', '2005-10-16 17:46:03.000000', '2005-10-16 17:50:43.000000', 0),
