(2234464, 222814, 17507, '<td valign="top">I really appreciate the delicate rendering done with this picture. I think it would have been very easy to overdo the sky - I''m sure I would have been tempted to do something to "bring out the color," so to speak, but its understated presence is perfect as it is. I can see this now only because you have already presented it to me with such a clean and polished finish, and I can look at it as a final product, which is something I can almost never really do with my own pictures. This is valuable. Thank you.</td>', 'I really appreciate the delicate rendering done with this picture. I think it would have been very easy to overdo the sky - I''m sure I would have been tempted to do something to "bring out the color," so to speak, but its understated presence is perfect as it is. I can see this now only because you have already presented it to me with such a clean and polished finish, and I can look at it as a final product, which is something I can almost never really do with my own pictures. This is valuable. Thank you.', '2006-03-16 20:06:27.000000', NULL, 0),
