(2410167, 224613, 42013, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.  I keep wanting to scroll left to see the toe! Taking your title into consideration, the portait orientation works well. Maybe try to crop or compose so that you have some open space in the top of the frame.  I feel this would enhance the image, especially in light of the title.</td>', 'interesting shot.  I keep wanting to scroll left to see the toe! Taking your title into consideration, the portait orientation works well. Maybe try to crop or compose so that you have some open space in the top of the frame.  I feel this would enhance the image, especially in light of the title.', '2006-05-12 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 0),
