(2469319, 224471, 56797, '<td valign="top">this one looked so impressive to me as a thumbnail i was hoping for a little bit more when i opened it. it would be really nice if all of one thing was focused. like the whole shoe. or all the water, preferably both but i know how hard that really is to accomplish. i like your idea, the crop is close that from a personal stand point it makes me nervous for your cameras safety. lol ;) i hope you didnt get it wet! liek the composition too. nice idea</td>', 'this one looked so impressive to me as a thumbnail i was hoping for a little bit more when i opened it. it would be really nice if all of one thing was focused. like the whole shoe. or all the water, preferably both but i know how hard that really is to accomplish. i like your idea, the crop is close that from a personal stand point it makes me nervous for your cameras safety. lol ;) i hope you didnt get it wet! liek the composition too. nice idea', '2006-05-30 19:56:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2491722, 224437, 59343, '<td valign="top">wow, excellent shot.  I think it would be nicer to have the little guy in the foreground completely in focus--but not sure if that was possible.  I love the colors and the composition otherwise.  Fantastic.</td>', 'wow, excellent shot.  I think it would be nicer to have the little guy in the foreground completely in focus--but not sure if that was possible.  I love the colors and the composition otherwise.  Fantastic.', '2006-06-06 22:02:19.000000', NULL, 0),
